'analyse du paysage concurrentiel est un outil complet pour analyser la concurrence et développer des stratégies de positionnement de marché","de":"Die Wettbewerbslandschaftsanalyse ist ein umfassendes Tool zur Analyse der Konkurrenz und Entwicklung von Marktauftrittsstrategien","pt":"Análise de paisagem competitiva para identificar oportunidades e desenvolver vantagens competitivas","ru":"Анализ конкурентной среды для выявления возможностей и разработки конкурентных преимуществ","ar":"تحليل المشهد التنافسي لتحديد الفرص وتطوير المزايا التنافسية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用Porter的五力分析","应用蓝海战略","创建竞争地图","找出差异化机会","制定市场定位策略"],"ja":["ポーターの五力分析を使用","ブルーオーシャン戦略を適用","競争マップを作成","差別化の機会を発見","マーケットポジショニング戦略を立てる"],"ko":["포터의 5가지 힘 분석 사용","블루 오션 전략 적용","경쟁 지도 생성","차별화 기회 발굴","시장 포지셔닝 전략 수립"],"es":["Análisis de las cinco fuerzas de Porter","Estrategias de posicionamiento de mercado","Identificación de oportunidades de diferenciación","Desarrollo de ventajas competitivas defensables","Análisis de la intensidad competitiva"],"fr":["Analyse des cinq forces de Porter","Stratégies de positionnement de marché","Identification des opportunités de différenciation","Développement d''avantages concurrentiels défensables","Analyse de l''intensité concurrentielle"],"de":["Analyse der fünf Kräfte von Porter","Strategien für den Marktauftritt","Identifizierung von Differenzierungschancen","Entwicklung von verteidigungsfähigen Wettbewerbsvorteilen","Analyse der Wettbewerbsintensität"],"pt":["Análise de forças de Porter","Estratégia do Oceano Azul","Mapas de posicionamento","Identificação de oportunidades","Desenvolvimento de vantagens competitivas"],"ru":["Анализ сил Портера","Стратегия Синего Океана","Карты позиционирования","Выявление возможностей","Разработка конкурентных преимуществ"],"ar":["تحليل قوى بورتر","استراتيجية المحيط الأزرق","خرائط الموضع","تحديد الفرص","تطوير المزايا التنافسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["竞争格局分析","Porter五力分析","蓝海战略","竞争地图","市场定位","差异化"],"ja":["競合環境分析","ポーターの五力分析","ブルーオーシャン戦略","競争マップ","マーケットポジショニング","差別化"],"ko":["경쟁 시장 분석","포터의 5가지 힘 분석","블루 오션 전략","경쟁 지도","시장 포지셔닝","차별화"],"es":["análisis de paisaje competitivo","estrategias de posicionamiento de mercado","cinco fuerzas de Porter","intensidad competitiva","ventajas competitivas","diferenciación","análisis de competencia","desarrollo de estrategias","marktanalyse"],"fr":["analyse du paysage concurrentiel","stratégies de positionnement de marché","cinq forces de Porter","intensité concurrentielle","avantages concurrentiels","différenciation","analyse de la concurrence","développement de stratégies","analyse de marché"],"de":["Wettbewerbslandschaftsanalyse","Strategien für den Marktauftritt","fünf Kräfte von Porter","Wettbewerbsintensität","Wettbewerbsvorteile","Differenzierung","Konkurrenzanalyse","Entwicklung von Strategien","Marktanalyse"],"pt":["análise de paisagem competitiva","estratégia de mercado","posicionamento de mercado","vantagens competitivas","análise de forças de porter","estratégia do oceano azul"],"ru":["анализ конкурентной среды","стратегия рынка","позиционирование на рынке","конкурентные преимущества","анализ сил Портера","стратегия Синего Океана"],"ar":["تحليل المشهد التنافسي","استراتيجية السوق","موقف السوق","المزايا التنافسية","تحليل قوى بورتر","استراتيجية المحيط الأزرق"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"competitive-landscape","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to analyze competitors, assess competitive landscape, identify differentiation, evaluate market positioning, apply Porters Five Forces, or requests competitive strategy analysis.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Competitive Landscape Analysis\n\nComprehensive frameworks for analyzing competition, identifying differentiation opportunities, and developing winning market positioning strategies.\n\n## Overview\n\nUnderstand competitive dynamics using proven frameworks (Porter''s Five Forces, Blue Ocean Strategy, positioning maps) to identify opportunities and craft defensible competitive advantages.\n\n## Porter''s Five Forces\n\nAnalyze industry attractiveness and competitive intensity.\n\n### Force 1: Threat of New E","body":"# Competitive Landscape Analysis\n\nComprehensive frameworks for analyzing competition, identifying differentiation opportunities, and developing winning market positioning strategies.\n\n## Overview\n\nUnderstand competitive dynamics using proven frameworks (Porter''s Five Forces, Blue Ocean Strategy, positioning maps) to identify opportunities and craft defensible competitive advantages.\n\n## Porter''s Five Forces\n\nAnalyze industry attractiveness and competitive intensity.\n\n### Force 1: Threat of New Entrants\n\n**Barriers to Entry:**\n\n- Capital requirements\n- Economies of scale\n- Switching costs\n- Brand loyalty\n- Regulatory barriers\n- Access to distribution\n- Network effects\n\n**High Threat:** Low barriers, easy to enter (e.g., simple SaaS tools)\n**Low Threat:** High barriers (e.g., regulated industries, hardware)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- How easy is it for new competitors to enter?\n- What would it cost to launch a competing product?\n- Are there network effects or switching costs protecting incumbents?\n\n### Force 2: Bargaining Power of Suppliers\n\n**Supplier Power Factors:**\n\n- Supplier concentration\n- Availability of substitutes\n- Importance to supplier\n- Switching costs\n- Forward integration threat\n\n**High Power:** Few suppliers, critical inputs (e.g., cloud infrastructure providers)\n**Low Power:** Many alternatives, commoditized (e.g., generic services)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- Who are our critical suppliers?\n- Could they raise prices or reduce quality?\n- Can we switch suppliers easily?\n\n### Force 3: Bargaining Power of Buyers\n\n**Buyer Power Factors:**\n\n- Buyer concentration\n- Volume purchased\n- Product differentiation\n- Price sensitivity\n- Backward integration threat\n\n**High Power:** Few large customers, standardized products (e.g., enterprise deals)\n**Low Power:** Many small customers, differentiated product (e.g., consumer subscriptions)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- Can customers easily switch to competitors?\n- Do few customers generate most revenue?\n- How price-sensitive are buyers?\n\n### Force 4: Threat of Substitutes\n\n**Substitute Considerations:**\n\n- Alternative solutions\n- Price-performance tradeoff\n- Switching costs\n- Buyer propensity to substitute\n\n**High Threat:** Many alternatives, low switching cost (e.g., productivity software)\n**Low Threat:** Unique solution, high switching cost (e.g., ERP systems)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- What alternative ways can customers solve this problem?\n- How do substitutes compare on price and performance?\n- What''s the cost to switch to a substitute?\n\n### Force 5: Competitive Rivalry\n\n**Rivalry Intensity Factors:**\n\n- Number of competitors\n- Industry growth rate\n- Product differentiation\n- Exit barriers\n- Strategic stakes\n\n**High Rivalry:** Many competitors, slow growth, commoditized (e.g., email marketing)\n**Low Rivalry:** Few competitors, fast growth, differentiated (e.g., emerging AI tools)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- How many direct competitors exist?\n- Is the market growing or stagnant?\n- How differentiated are offerings?\n- Are competitors competing on price or value?\n\n### Forces Analysis Summary\n\nCreate a scorecard:\n\n| Force          | Intensity (1-5) | Impact | Key Factors                       |\n| -------------- | --------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| New Entrants   | 3               | Medium | Low barriers but network effects  |\n| Supplier Power | 2               | Low    | Many cloud providers              |\n| Buyer Power    | 4               | High   | Enterprise customers concentrated |\n| Substitutes    | 3               | Medium | Manual processes alternative      |\n| Rivalry        | 4               | High   | 10+ direct competitors            |\n\n**Overall Assessment:** Moderate industry attractiveness with high rivalry and buyer power\n\n## Blue Ocean Strategy\n\nIdentify uncontested market space through value innovation.\n\n### Four Actions Framework\n\n**Eliminate:**\nWhat factors can be eliminated that the industry takes for granted?\n\n**Reduce:**\nWhat factors can be reduced well below industry standard?\n\n**Raise:**\nWhat factors can be raised well above industry standard?\n\n**Create:**\nWhat factors can be created that the industry never offered?\n\n### Strategy Canvas\n\nMap your offering vs. competitors on key factors.\n\n**Example: Budget Hotels**\n\n```\nHigh |                    ★ Traditional Hotels\n     |          ★ Budget Hotels (new)\n     |\nLow  |___________________________________\n     Price  Luxury  Convenience  Cleanliness\n\nBudget Hotel Strategy:\n- Eliminate: Luxury amenities, room service\n- Reduce: Lobby size, staff\n- Raise: Cleanliness, online booking\n- Create: Self-service kiosks, mobile app\n```\n\n### Value Innovation\n\nFind the sweet spot: Lower cost + higher value\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Map industry competing factors\n2. Identify factors to eliminate/reduce (cost savings)\n3. Identify factors to raise/create (differentiation)\n4. Validate that combination creates new market space\n\n## Competitive Positioning\n\n### Positioning Map\n\nPlot competitors on 2-3 key dimensions.\n\n**Example Dimensions:**\n\n- Price vs. Features\n- Complexity vs. Ease of Use\n- Enterprise vs. SMB Focus\n- Self-Service vs. High-Touch\n- Generalist vs. Specialist\n\n**How to Create:**\n\n1. Choose 2 dimensions most important to customers\n2. Plot all competitors\n3. Identify gaps (white space)\n4. Validate gap represents real customer need\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nHigh Price\n    |\n    |  ★ Enterprise A      ★ Enterprise B\n    |\n    |          ● Our Position (gap)\n    |\n    |  ★ Competitor C      ★ Competitor D\n    |\nLow Price |____________________________________________\n        Simple                           Complex\n```\n\n### Differentiation Strategy\n\n**How to Differentiate:**\n\n1. **Product Differentiation**\n   - Unique features\n   - Superior performance\n   - Better design/UX\n   - Integration ecosystem\n\n2. **Service Differentiation**\n   - Customer support quality\n   - Onboarding experience\n   - Response time\n   - Success programs\n\n3. **Brand Differentiation**\n   - Trust and reputation\n   - Thought leadership\n   - Community\n   - Values alignment\n\n4. **Price Differentiation**\n   - Premium positioning\n   - Value positioning\n   - Transparent pricing\n   - Flexible packaging\n\n### Positioning Statement Framework\n\n```\nFor [target customer]\nWho [statement of need or opportunity]\nOur product is [product category]\nThat [statement of key benefit]\nUnlike [primary competitive alternative]\nOur product [statement of primary differentiation]\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nFor e-commerce companies\nWho struggle with email marketing automation\nOur product is an AI-powered email platform\nThat increases conversion rates by 40%\nUnlike Klaviyo and Mailchimp\nOur product uses AI to personalize at scale\n```\n\n## Competitive Intelligence\n\n### Information Gathering\n\n**Public Sources:**\n\n- Company websites and blogs\n- Press releases and news\n- Job postings (hint at strategy)\n- Customer reviews (G2, Capterra)\n- Social media and forums\n- Glassdoor (employee insights)\n- SEC filings (public companies)\n- Patent filings\n\n**Direct Research:**\n\n- Customer interviews\n- Win/loss analysis\n- Sales team feedback\n- Product demos and trials\n- Conference attendance\n\n### Competitor Profile Template\n\nFor each key competitor, document:\n\n**Company Overview:**\n\n- Founded, HQ, funding, size\n- Leadership team\n- Company stage and trajectory\n\n**Product:**\n\n- Core features\n- Target customers\n- Pricing and packaging\n- Technology stack\n- Recent launches\n\n**Go-to-Market:**\n\n- Sales model (self-serve, sales-led)\n- Marketing strategy\n- Distribution channels\n- Partnerships\n\n**Strengths:**\n\n- What they do better than anyone\n- Key competitive advantages\n- Market position\n\n**Weaknesses:**\n\n- Gaps in product\n- Customer complaints\n- Operational challenges\n\n**Strategy:**\n\n- Stated direction\n- Inferred priorities\n- Likely next moves\n\n## Competitive Pricing Analysis\n\n### Price Positioning\n\n**Premium (Top 25%):**\n\n- Superior product/service\n- Strong brand\n- High-touch sales\n- Enterprise focus\n\n**Mid-Market (Middle 50%):**\n\n- Balanced value\n- Standard features\n- Mixed sales model\n- Broad market\n\n**Value (Bottom 25%):**\n\n- Basic functionality\n- Self-service\n- Cost leadership\n- High volume, low margin\n\n### Pricing Comparison Matrix\n\n| Competitor   | Entry Price | Mid Tier | Enterprise | Model        |\n| ------------ | ----------- | -------- | ---------- | ------------ |\n| Competitor A | $29/mo      | $99/mo   | Custom     | Subscription |\n| Competitor B | $49/mo      | $199/mo  | $499/mo    | Subscription |\n| Us           | $39/mo      | $129/mo  | Custom     | Subscription |\n\n**Analysis:**\n\n- Are we priced competitively?\n- What does our pricing signal?\n- Are there gaps in our packaging?\n\n## Go-to-Market Strategy\n\n### Market Entry Strategies\n\n**Direct Competition:**\n\n- Head-to-head against established players\n- Requires differentiation and resources\n- Example: Better features at lower price\n\n**Niche Focus:**\n\n- Target underserved segment\n- Become specialist vs. generalist\n- Example: \"Salesforce for real estate\"\n\n**Disruptive Innovation:**\n\n- Target non-consumers or low end\n- Improve over time to move upmarket\n- Example: Freemium model disrupting enterprise\n\n**Platform Play:**\n\n- Build ecosystem and network effects\n- Aggregate complementary services\n- Example: Marketplace or API platform\n\n### Beachhead Market\n\n**Characteristics of Good Beachhead:**\n\n- Specific, reachable segment\n- Acute pain you solve well\n- Limited competition\n- Willing to pay\n- Can lead to expansion\n\n**Example:**\nInstead of \"project management software\", target \"project management for construction teams\"\n\n## Competitive Advantage\n\n### Sustainable Advantages\n\n**Network Effects:**\n\n- Value increases with users\n- Example: Slack, marketplaces\n\n**Switching Costs:**\n\n- High cost to change\n- Example: CRM systems with data\n\n**Economies of Scale:**\n\n- Unit costs decrease with volume\n- Example: Cloud infrastructure\n\n**Brand:**\n\n- Trust and reputation\n- Example: Security software\n\n**Proprietary Technology:**\n\n- Patents or trade secrets\n- Example: Algorithms, data\n\n**Regulatory:**\n\n- Licenses or approvals\n- Example: Fintech, healthcare\n\n### Testing Your Advantage\n\nAsk:\n\n- Can competitors copy this in < 2 years?\n- Does this matter to customers?\n- Do we execute this better than anyone?\n- Is this advantage durable?\n\nIf \"no\" to any, it''s not a sustainable advantage.\n\n## Competitive Monitoring\n\n### What to Track\n\n**Product Changes:**\n\n- New features\n- Pricing changes\n- Packaging adjustments\n\n**Market Signals:**\n\n- Funding announcements\n- Key hires (especially leadership)\n- Customer wins/losses\n- Partnerships\n\n**Performance Metrics:**\n\n- Revenue (if public or disclosed)\n- Customer count\n- Growth rate\n- Market share estimates\n\n### Monitoring Cadence\n\n**Weekly:**\n\n- Product release notes\n- News mentions\n\n**Monthly:**\n\n- Win/loss analysis review\n- Positioning map updates\n\n**Quarterly:**\n\n- Deep competitive review\n- Strategy adjustment\n\n**Annually:**\n\n- Major strategy reassessment\n- Market trends analysis\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\n- **`references/frameworks-deep-dive.md`** - Detailed application of each framework with worksheets\n- **`references/intel-sources.md`** - Comprehensive list of competitive intelligence sources\n\n### Example Files\n\n- **`examples/competitor-analysis.md`** - Complete competitive analysis for a SaaS startup\n- **`examples/positioning-workshop.md`** - Step-by-step positioning development process\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo analyze competitive landscape:\n\n1. **Identify competitors** - Direct, indirect, and future threats\n2. **Apply Porter''s Five Forces** - Assess industry attractiveness\n3. **Create positioning map** - Visualize competitive space\n4. **Profile top 3-5 competitors** - Deep dive on key rivals\n5. **Identify differentiation** - What makes you unique\n6. **Analyze pricing** - Where do you fit?\n7. **Assess advantages** - What''s defensible?\n8. **Develop strategy** - How to win\n\nFor detailed frameworks and examples, see `references/` and `examples/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:40.294Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Strategic Analysis Agents needing advanced competitive dynamics modeling with Porter''s Five Forces and Blue Ocean Strategy.","zh":"非常适合需要使用波特五力模型和蓝海战略进行高级竞争动态建模的战略分析代理","ja":"戦略分析エージェントがポーターの五力分析とブルーオーシャン戦略を使用した高度な競争力動態モデリングを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 경쟁 역학 모델링을 위해 포터의 5가지 힘과 블루 오션 전략이 필요한 전략 분석 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Estratégico que necesitan modelado de dinámicas competitivas avanzadas con las Cinco Fuerzas de Porter y la Estrategia del Océano Azul.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Stratégique ayant besoin de modélisation de dynamiques concurrentielles avancées avec les Cinq Forces de Porter et la Stratégie de l''Océan Bleu.","de":"Perfekt für Strategische Analyseagenten, die ein fortgeschrittenes Modellieren von Wettbewerbsdynamiken mit Porters Fünf Kräften und der Blue Ocean Strategy benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Estratégica que precisam de modelagem de dinâmica competitiva avançada com as Cinco Forças de Porter e a Estratégia do Oceano Azul.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов стратегического анализа, которым требуется продвинутая модель конкурентной динамики с помощью пяти сил Портера и стратегии Синего океана.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل استراتيجي يحتاج إلى نمذجة ديناميكية تنافسية متقدمة باستخدام قوى بورتر الخمس واستراتيجية المحيط الأزرق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze industry attractiveness and competitive intensity using proven frameworks, identifying opportunities and crafting defensible competitive advantages with positioning maps and market positioning strategies.","zh":"赋予代理分析行业吸引力和竞争强度的能力，使用成熟的框架，识别机会并利用位置图和市场定位策略制定可防御的竞争优势","ja":"業界の魅力と競争の強さを分析する能力をエージェントに与え、確立されたフレームワークを使用して機会を特定し、ポジショニングマップと市場ポジショニング戦略を使用して守りやすい競争上の優位性を確立","ko":"에이전트가 산업의 매력과 경쟁 강도를 분석할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 성숙한 프레임워크를 사용하여 기회를 식별하고 위치 지도와 시장 위치 전략을 사용하여 방어 가능한 경쟁 우위를 창출","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar la atractividad de la industria y la intensidad competitiva utilizando marcos probados, identificando oportunidades y creando ventajas competitivas defensables con mapas de posicionamiento y estrategias de posicionamiento en el mercado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser l''attractivité de l''industrie et l''intensité concurrentielle en utilisant des cadres éprouvés, en identifiant des opportunités et en créant des avantages concurrentiels défendables avec des cartes de positionnement et des stratégies de positionnement sur le marché.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Attraktivität der Branche und die Wettbewerbsintensität unter Verwendung bewährter Rahmenbedingungen zu analysieren, Chancen zu identifizieren und verteidigungsfähige Wettbewerbsvorteile mit Positionierungsmaps und Marktpositionierungsstrategien zu schaffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar a atratividade da indústria e a intensidade competitiva usando estruturas comprovadas, identificando oportunidades e criando vantagens competitivas defensáveis com mapas de posicionamento e estratégias de posicionamento de mercado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать привлекательность отрасли и конкурентную интенсивность с помощью проверенных рамок, выявления возможностей и создания оборонительных конкурентных преимуществ с помощью карт позиционирования и стратегий рыночной позиции.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية分析 جاذبية الصناعة والكثافة التنافسية باستخدام إطارات مثبتة، وتحديد الفرص وإنشاء مزايا تنافسية قابلة للدفاع مع خرائط التموضع واستراتيجيات تحديد موقع السوق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing threat of new entrants in a given market","Developing winning market positioning strategies using Blue Ocean Strategy","Identifying differentiation opportunities with competitive landscape mapping"],"zh":["分析特定市场中新进入者的威胁","使用蓝海战略制定赢得市场的位置战略","使用竞争格局映射来识别差异化机会"],"ja":["特定の市場における新規参入者の脅威を分析する","ブルーオーシャン戦略を使用して勝利する市場のポジショニング戦略を開発する","競争の風景マッピングを使用して差別化の機会を特定する"],"ko":["특정 시장에서 새로운 진입자의 위협 분석","블루 오션 전략을 사용하여 승리하는 시장 위치 전략 개발","경쟁 풍경 매핑을 사용하여 차별화 기회 식별"],"es":["Análisis de la amenaza de nuevos entrantes en un mercado determinado","Desarrollo de estrategias de posicionamiento en el mercado ganadoras utilizando la Estrategia del Océano Azul","Identificación de oportunidades de diferenciación con mapeo de paisaje competitivo"],"fr":["Analyse de la menace de nouveaux entrants sur un marché donné","Développement de stratégies de positionnement sur le marché gagnantes en utilisant la Stratégie de l''Océan Bleu","Identification des opportunités de différenciation avec la cartographie du paysage concurrentiel"],"de":["Analyse der Bedrohung durch neue Marktteilnehmer in einem bestimmten Markt","Entwicklung gewinnender Marktpositionierungsstrategien unter Verwendung der Blue Ocean Strategy","Identifizierung von Differenzierungschancen mit Wettbewerbslandschaftskartierung"],"pt":["Analisar a ameaça de novos entrantes em um mercado determinado","Desenvolver estratégias de posicionamento de mercado vencedoras usando a Estratégia do Oceano Azul","Identificar oportunidades de diferenciação com mapeamento da paisagem competitiva"],"ru":["Анализ угрозы новых участников на определенном рынке","Разработка выигрышных стратегий рыночной позиции с помощью стратегии Синего океана","Определение возможностей дифференциации с помощью картографирования конкурентной среды"],"ar":["تحليل تهديد الدخول الجديدة في سوق معين","تطوير استراتيجيات تحديد موقع السوق الفائزة باستخدام استراتيجية المحيط الأزرق","تحديد فرص التمايز عن طريق تخطيط المناظر الطبيعية التنافسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires industry and market data for accurate analysis","Limited to frameworks such as Porter''s Five Forces and Blue Ocean Strategy"],"zh":["需要行业和市场数据进行准确分析","仅限于波特五力模型和蓝海战略等框架"],"ja":["正確な分析のために業界と市場データが必要","ポーターの五力分析やブルーオーシャン戦略などのフレームワークに限定"],"ko":["정확한 분석을 위해 산업 및 시장 데이터가 필요","포터의 5가지 힘 또는 블루 오션 전략과 같은 프레임워크로 제한"],"es":["Requiere datos de industria y mercado para un análisis preciso","Limitado a marcos como las Cinco Fuerzas de Porter y la Estrategia del Océano Azul"],"fr":["Nécessite des données d''industrie et de marché pour une analyse précise","Limité à des cadres tels que les Cinq Forces de Porter et la Stratégie de l''Océan Bleu"],"de":["Benötigt Branchen- und Marktdaten für eine genaue Analyse","Begrenzt auf Rahmenbedingungen wie Porters Fünf Kräfte und die Blue Ocean Strategy"],"pt":["Requer dados de indústria e mercado para análise precisa","Limitado a estruturas como as Cinco Forças de Porter e a Estratégia do Oceano Azul"],"ru":["Требует данных об отрасли и рынке для точного анализа","Ограничен рамками, такими как пять сил Портера и стратегия Синего океана"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات الصناعة والسوق للتحليل الدقيق","محدود بالإطارات مثل قوى بورتر الخمس واستراتيجية المحيط الأزرق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
