tests","Automatisation des tests avec Playwright"],"de":["Python-Skript für Webanwendungstests","Verwaltung des Server-Lebenszyklus","Unterstützung für mehrere Server","Hilfs-Skript für vereinfachte Tests","Automatisierung von Tests mit Playwright"],"pt":["Teste de aplicativos web locais","Scripts Python Playwright","Gerenciamento do ciclo de vida do servidor","Suporte a múltiplos servidores","Scripts de ajuda disponíveis"],"ru":["Тестирование локальных веб-приложений","Скрипты Python Playwright","Управление циклом жизни сервера","Поддержка нескольких серверов","Доступные вспомогательные скрипты"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية","سكربتات Python Playwright","إدارة دورة حياة الخادم","دعم خوادم متعددة","سكربتات مساعدة متاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web应用程序测试","Python Playwright","自动化测试","Web开发","测试工具","开发效率","helper脚本"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","Python Playwright","自動化テスト","Web開発","テストツール","開発効率","ヘルパースクリプト"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 테스트","파이썬 Playwright","자동화 테스트","웹 개발","테스트 도구","개발 효율성","헬퍼 스크립트"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","playwright","python","automatización de pruebas","gestión del ciclo de vida del servidor","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","testing","qa","calidad del código"],"fr":["test d''applications web","playwright","python","automatisation des tests","gestion du cycle de vie du serveur","développement d''applications web","testing","qa","qualité du code"],"de":["webanwendungstests","playwright","python","automatisierung von tests","verwaltung des server-lebenszyklus","entwicklung von webanwendungen","testing","qa","code-qualität"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","playwright","python","teste de software","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de software","estabilidade de software"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","playwright","python","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","стабильность программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","playwright","python","اختبار البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","استقرار البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"maskelog","repo":"Daegu_bus_flutter_app","repoPath":"maskelog/Daegu_bus_flutter_app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as bl","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as black-box scripts rather than ingested into your context window.\n\n## Decision Tree: Choosing Your Approach\n\n```\nUser task → Is it static HTML?\n    ├─ Yes → Read HTML file directly to identify selectors\n    │         ├─ Success → Write Playwright script using selectors\n    │         └─ Fails/Incomplete → Treat as dynamic (below)\n    │\n    └─ No (dynamic webapp) → Is the server already running?\n        ├─ No → Run: python scripts/with_server.py --help\n        │        Then use the helper + write simplified Playwright script\n        │\n        └─ Yes → Reconnaissance-then-action:\n            1. Navigate and wait for networkidle\n            2. Take screenshot or inspect DOM\n            3. Identify selectors from rendered state\n            4. Execute actions with discovered selectors\n```\n\n## Example: Using with_server.py\n\nTo start a server, run `--help` first, then use the helper:\n\n**Single server:**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py --server \"npm run dev\" --port 5173 -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\n**Multiple servers (e.g., backend + frontend):**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py \\\n  --server \"cd backend && python server.py\" --port 3000 \\\n  --server \"cd frontend && npm run dev\" --port 5173 \\\n  -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\nTo create an automation script, include only Playwright logic (servers are managed automatically):\n```python\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True) # Always launch chromium in headless mode\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    page.goto(''http://localhost:5173'') # Server already running and ready\n    page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'') # CRITICAL: Wait for JS to execute\n    # ... your automation logic\n    browser.close()\n```\n\n## Reconnaissance-Then-Action Pattern\n\n1. **Inspect rendered DOM**:\n   ```python\n   page.screenshot(path=''/tmp/inspect.png'', full_page=True)\n   content = page.content()\n   page.locator(''button'').all()\n   ```\n\n2. **Identify selectors** from inspection results\n\n3. **Execute actions** using discovered selectors\n\n## Common Pitfall\n\n❌ **Don''t** inspect the DOM before waiting for `networkidle` on dynamic apps\n✅ **Do** wait for `page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'')` before inspection\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Use bundled scripts as black boxes** - To accomplish a task, consider whether one of the scripts available in `scripts/` can help. These scripts handle common, complex workflows reliably without cluttering the context window. Use `--help` to see usage, then invoke directly. \n- Use `sync_playwright()` for synchronous scripts\n- Always close the browser when done\n- Use descriptive selectors: `text=`, `role=`, CSS selectors, or IDs\n- Add appropriate waits: `page.wait_for_selector()` or `page.wait_for_timeout()`\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **examples/** - Examples showing common patterns:\n  - `element_discovery.py` - Discovering buttons, links, and inputs on a page\n  - `static_html_automation.py` - Using file:// URLs for local HTML\n  - `console_logging.py` - Capturing console logs during automation"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:40.434Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents needing advanced web application testing capabilities with Python Playwright scripts.","zh":"适用于需要使用Python Playwright脚本进行高级Web应用程序测试的自动化代理。","ja":"Python Playwright スクリプトを使用した高度な Web アプリケーション テスト機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba de aplicaciones web con scripts de Python Playwright.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant des capacités avancées de test d''applications Web avec des scripts Python Playwright.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Webanwendungstestfunktionen mit Python-Playwright-Skripten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que precisam de capacidades avançadas de teste de aplicações web com scripts Python Playwright.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности тестирования веб-приложений с помощью скриптов Python Playwright.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختبار التطبيقات الويب باستخدام نصوص Python Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate testing of local web applications using native Python Playwright scripts, managing server lifecycles with scripts like `with_server.py`, and supporting multiple servers through protocols like HTTP.","zh":"赋予代理使用本地Python Playwright脚本自动化测试本地Web应用程序的能力，使用类似`with_server.py`的脚本管理服务器生命周期，并通过HTTP等协议支持多个服务器。","ja":"エージェントに、ネイティブ Python Playwright スクリプトを使用してローカル Web アプリケーションのテストを自動化し、`with_server.py` のようなスクリプトを使用してサーバー ライフサイクルを管理し、HTTP などのプロトコルを介して複数のサーバーをサポートする機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 Python Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 로컬 웹 애플리케이션의 테스트를 자동화하고, `with_server.py`와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 서버 라이프사이클을 관리하며, HTTP와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 여러 서버를 지원할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas de aplicaciones web locales utilizando scripts de Python Playwright nativos, gestionar los ciclos de vida del servidor con scripts como `with_server.py` y admitir varios servidores a través de protocolos como HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests d''applications Web locales en utilisant des scripts Python Playwright natifs, gérer les cycles de vie du serveur avec des scripts comme `with_server.py` et prendre en charge plusieurs serveurs via des protocoles comme HTTP.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Testen lokaler Webanwendungen mit nativen Python-Playwright-Skripten zu automatisieren, Serverlebenszyklen mit Skripten wie `with_server.py` zu verwalten und mehrere Server über Protokolle wie HTTP zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de aplicações web locais usando scripts Python Playwright nativos, gerenciando ciclos de vida do servidor com scripts como `with_server.py`, e suportando vários servidores por meio de protocolos como HTTP.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать тестирование локальных веб-приложений с помощью родных скриптов Python Playwright, управлять жизненным циклом сервера с помощью скриптов типа `with_server.py` и поддерживать несколько серверов через протоколы, такие как HTTP.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تلقين اختبار التطبيقات الويب المحلية باستخدام نصوص Python Playwright الأصلية، وإدارة دورة حياة الخادم مع نصوص مثل `with_server.py`، ودعم خوادم متعددة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web application testing with Playwright","Debugging local web applications using Python scripts","Managing multiple server lifecycles for complex testing scenarios"],"zh":["使用Playwright进行Web应用程序测试的自动化","使用Python脚本调试本地Web应用程序","管理多个服务器生命周期以适应复杂的测试场景"],"ja":["Playwrightを使用したWebアプリケーションのテスト自動化","Pythonスクリプトを使用したローカルWebアプリケーションのデバッグ","複数のサーバーライフサイクルの管理による複雑なテストシナリオのサポート"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 자동화","Python 스크립트를 사용한 로컬 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","複数의 서버 라이프사이클 관리를 통한 복잡한 테스트 시나리오 지원"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de aplicaciones web con Playwright","Depurar aplicaciones web locales con scripts de Python","Gestionar varios ciclos de vida del servidor para escenarios de prueba complejos"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''applications Web avec Playwright","Déboguer les applications Web locales avec des scripts Python","Gérer plusieurs cycles de vie du serveur pour des scénarios de test complexes"],"de":["Automatisieren von Webanwendungstests mit Playwright","Debuggen lokaler Webanwendungen mit Python-Skripten","Verwalten mehrerer Serverlebenszyklen für komplexe Testsszenarien"],"pt":["Automação de teste de aplicações web com Playwright","Depuração de aplicações web locais usando scripts Python","Gerenciamento de vários ciclos de vida do servidor para cenários de teste complexos"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования веб-приложений с помощью Playwright","Отладка локальных веб-приложений с помощью скриптов Python","Управление несколькими циклами жизни сервера для сложных сценариев тестирования"],"ar":["تلقين اختبار التطبيقات الويب مع Playwright","تصحيح الأخطاء في التطبيقات الويب المحلية باستخدام نصوص Python","إدارة دورات حياة الخادم المتعددة لسيناريوهات اختبار معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to local web applications","Needs direct script execution with `--help` for usage"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限本地Web应用程序","需要使用`--help`直接执行脚本以获取使用方法"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","ローカルWebアプリケーションに限定される","使用方法を取得するために`--help`で直接スクリプトを実行する必要がある"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","로컬 웹 애플리케이션에만 국한됩니다.","사용 방법을 얻으려면 `--help`로 직접 스크립트를 실행해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a aplicaciones web locales","Necesita ejecución directa de scripts con `--help` para su uso"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux applications Web locales","Nécessite une exécution directe de scripts avec `--help` pour l''utilisation"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungen","Benötigt direkte Skriptausführung mit `--help` für die Verwendung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Limitado a aplicações web locais","Necessita execução direta de script com `--help` para utilização"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен локальными веб-приложениями","Требует прямого выполнения скрипта с `--help` для использования"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بالتطبيقات الويب المحلية","يحتاج تنفيذ مباشر للنص البرمجي مع `--help` للاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
