والب مشاريع FastAPI للמطورين","en":"fastapi-templates"},"description":{"zh":"FastAPI 项目模板，提供生产就绪的项目结构，包含异步模式、依赖注入和中间件","ja":"FastAPI プロジェクト テンプレート。生産就緒のプロジェクト構造を提供します。非同期パターン、依存性注入、ミドルウェアを含みます","ko":"FastAPI 프로젝트 템플릿, 생산 준비된 프로젝트 구조 제공, 비동기 패턴, 의존성 주입, 미들웨어 포함","es":"Plantillas de proyectos FastAPI listas para producción con patrones asíncronos y mejores prácticas para APIs de alto rendimiento","fr":"Modèles de projets FastAPI prêts pour la production avec des modèles asynchrones et les meilleures pratiques pour les APIs haute performance","de":"Produktionsbereite FastAPI-Projektvorlagen mit asynchronen Mustern und Best Practices für Hochleistungs-APIs","pt":"Os modelos de projetos FastAPI são estruturas de projeto prontas para produção com padrões assíncronos, injeção de dependência e middleware","ru":"Шаблоны проектов FastAPI представляют собой готовые к производству структуры проектов с асинхронными шаблонами, внедрением зависимостей и middleware","ar":"قوالب مشاريع FastAPI هي هياكل مشروع جاهزة للانتاج مع أنماط متوازيّة، وحقن الإعتماديات وبرامج الوسائط","en":"The second iteration of an autonomous data agent. Automates basic analysis and solves straightforward data tasks using the Python ecosystem."},"definition":{"en":"The second iteration of an autonomous data agent. Automates basic analysis and solves straightforward data tasks using the Python ecosystem."},"features":{"zh":["异步模式","依赖注入","中间件","生产就绪的项目结构","高性能 API 支持","PostgreSQL 和 MongoDB 集成"],"ja":["非同期パターン","依存性注入","ミドルウェア","生産就緒のプロジェクト構造","ハイパフォーマンス API サポート","PostgreSQL と MongoDB 統合"],"ko":["비동기 패턴","의존성 주입","미들웨어","생산 준비된 프로젝트 구조","고성능 API 지원","PostgreSQL 및 MongoDB 통합"],"es":["Estructuras de proyectos asíncronos","Inyección de dependencias","Middleware","Mejores prácticas para APIs de alto rendimiento","Compatibilidad con PostgreSQL y MongoDB","Pruebas y estructura de proyectos"],"fr":["Structures de projets asynchrones","Injection de dépendances","Middleware","Meilleures pratiques pour les APIs haute performance","Compatibilité avec PostgreSQL et MongoDB","Tests et structure de projets"],"de":["Asynchrone Projektstrukturen","Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Middleware","Best Practices für Hochleistungs-APIs","Kompatibilität mit PostgreSQL und MongoDB","Tests und Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Estruturas de projeto prontas para produção","Padrões assíncronos e injeção de dependência","Middleware e boas práticas para APIs de alta performance","Suporte a bancos de dados como PostgreSQL e MongoDB","Testes e validação de APIs"],"ru":["Готовые к производству структуры проектов","Асинхронные шаблоны и внедрение зависимостей","Middleware и лучшие практики для высокопроизводительных API","Поддержка баз данных như PostgreSQL и MongoDB","Тестирование и валидация API"],"ar":["هياكل مشروع جاهزة للانتاج","أنماط متوازيّة وحقن الإعتماديات","برامج الوسائط وأفضل الممارسات لواجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء","دعم قواعد البيانات مثل PostgreSQL و MongoDB","اختبار وتحقق واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FastAPI","高性能 API","异步模式","依赖注入","中间件","生产就绪","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","Python"],"ja":["FastAPI","ハイパフォーマンス API","非同期パターン","依存性注入","ミドルウェア","生産就緒","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","Python"],"ko":["FastAPI","고성능 API","비동기 패턴","의존성 주입","미들웨어","생산 준비","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","Python"],"es":["FastAPI","plantillas de proyectos","APIs de alto rendimiento","microservicios","patrones asíncronos","inyección de dependencias","middleware","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"fr":["FastAPI","modèles de projets","APIs haute performance","microservices","modèles asynchrones","injection de dépendances","middleware","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"de":["FastAPI","Projektvorlagen","Hochleistungs-APIs","Microservices","asynchrone Muster","Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Middleware","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"pt":["FastAPI","projetos FastAPI","APIs de alta performance","padrões assíncronos","injeção de dependência","middleware","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"ru":["FastAPI","проекты FastAPI","высокопроизводительные API","асинхронные шаблоны","внедрение зависимостей","middleware","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"ar":["FastAPI","مشاريع FastAPI","واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء","أنماط متوازيّة","حقن الإعتماديات","برامج الوسائط","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"]}},"owner":"Aniket-a14","repo":"Wizard-w1","repoPath":"Aniket-a14/Wizard-w1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastapi-templates","description":"Create production-ready FastAPI projects with async patterns, dependency injection, and comprehensive error handling. Use when building new FastAPI applications or setting up backend API projects.","bodyPreview":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. P","body":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Project Structure\n\n**Recommended Layout:**\n\n```\napp/\n├── api/                    # API routes\n│   ├── v1/\n│   │   ├── endpoints/\n│   │   │   ├── users.py\n│   │   │   ├── auth.py\n│   │   │   └── items.py\n│   │   └── router.py\n│   └── dependencies.py     # Shared dependencies\n├── core/                   # Core configuration\n│   ├── config.py\n│   ├── security.py\n│   └── database.py\n├── models/                 # Database models\n│   ├── user.py\n│   └── item.py\n├── schemas/                # Pydantic schemas\n│   ├── user.py\n│   └── item.py\n├── services/               # Business logic\n│   ├── user_service.py\n│   └── auth_service.py\n├── repositories/           # Data access\n│   ├── user_repository.py\n│   └── item_repository.py\n└── main.py                 # Application entry\n```\n\n### 2. Dependency Injection\n\nFastAPI''s built-in DI system using `Depends`:\n\n- Database session management\n- Authentication/authorization\n- Shared business logic\n- Configuration injection\n\n### 3. Async Patterns\n\nProper async/await usage:\n\n- Async route handlers\n- Async database operations\n- Async background tasks\n- Async middleware\n\n## Implementation Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Complete FastAPI Application\n\n```python\n# main.py\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, Depends\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\nfrom contextlib import asynccontextmanager\n\n@asynccontextmanager\nasync def lifespan(app: FastAPI):\n    \"\"\"Application lifespan events.\"\"\"\n    # Startup\n    await database.connect()\n    yield\n    # Shutdown\n    await database.disconnect()\n\napp = FastAPI(\n    title=\"API Template\",\n    version=\"1.0.0\",\n    lifespan=lifespan\n)\n\n# CORS middleware\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=[\"*\"],\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\n# Include routers\nfrom app.api.v1.router import api_router\napp.include_router(api_router, prefix=\"/api/v1\")\n\n# core/config.py\nfrom pydantic_settings import BaseSettings\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\nclass Settings(BaseSettings):\n    \"\"\"Application settings.\"\"\"\n    DATABASE_URL: str\n    SECRET_KEY: str\n    ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES: int = 30\n    API_V1_STR: str = \"/api/v1\"\n\n    class Config:\n        env_file = \".env\"\n\n@lru_cache()\ndef get_settings() -> Settings:\n    return Settings()\n\n# core/database.py\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import create_async_engine, AsyncSession\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker\nfrom app.core.config import get_settings\n\nsettings = get_settings()\n\nengine = create_async_engine(\n    settings.DATABASE_URL,\n    echo=True,\n    future=True\n)\n\nAsyncSessionLocal = sessionmaker(\n    engine,\n    class_=AsyncSession,\n    expire_on_commit=False\n)\n\nBase = declarative_base()\n\nasync def get_db() -> AsyncSession:\n    \"\"\"Dependency for database session.\"\"\"\n    async with AsyncSessionLocal() as session:\n        try:\n            yield session\n            await session.commit()\n        except Exception:\n            await session.rollback()\n            raise\n        finally:\n            await session.close()\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: CRUD Repository Pattern\n\n```python\n# repositories/base_repository.py\nfrom typing import Generic, TypeVar, Type, Optional, List\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import AsyncSession\nfrom sqlalchemy import select\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\n\nModelType = TypeVar(\"ModelType\")\nCreateSchemaType = TypeVar(\"CreateSchemaType\", bound=BaseModel)\nUpdateSchemaType = TypeVar(\"UpdateSchemaType\", bound=BaseModel)\n\nclass BaseRepository(Generic[ModelType, CreateSchemaType, UpdateSchemaType]):\n    \"\"\"Base repository for CRUD operations.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, model: Type[ModelType]):\n        self.model = model\n\n    async def get(self, db: AsyncSession, id: int) -> Optional[ModelType]:\n        \"\"\"Get by ID.\"\"\"\n        result = await db.execute(\n            select(self.model).where(self.model.id == id)\n        )\n        return result.scalars().first()\n\n    async def get_multi(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        skip: int = 0,\n        limit: int = 100\n    ) -> List[ModelType]:\n        \"\"\"Get multiple records.\"\"\"\n        result = await db.execute(\n            select(self.model).offset(skip).limit(limit)\n        )\n        return result.scalars().all()\n\n    async def create(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        obj_in: CreateSchemaType\n    ) -> ModelType:\n        \"\"\"Create new record.\"\"\"\n        db_obj = self.model(**obj_in.dict())\n        db.add(db_obj)\n        await db.flush()\n        await db.refresh(db_obj)\n        return db_obj\n\n    async def update(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        db_obj: ModelType,\n        obj_in: UpdateSchemaType\n    ) -> ModelType:\n        \"\"\"Update record.\"\"\"\n        update_data = obj_in.dict(exclude_unset=True)\n        for field, value in update_data.items():\n            setattr(db_obj, field, value)\n        await db.flush()\n        await db.refresh(db_obj)\n        return db_obj\n\n    async def delete(self, db: AsyncSession, id: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Delete record.\"\"\"\n        obj = await self.get(db, id)\n        if obj:\n            await db.delete(obj)\n            return True\n        return False\n\n# repositories/user_repository.py\nfrom app.repositories.base_repository import BaseRepository\nfrom app.models.user import User\nfrom app.schemas.user import UserCreate, UserUpdate\n\nclass UserRepository(BaseRepository[User, UserCreate, UserUpdate]):\n    \"\"\"User-specific repository.\"\"\"\n\n    async def get_by_email(self, db: AsyncSession, email: str) -> Optional[User]:\n        \"\"\"Get user by email.\"\"\"\n        result = await db.execute(\n            select(User).where(User.email == email)\n        )\n        return result.scalars().first()\n\n    async def is_active(self, db: AsyncSession, user_id: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Check if user is active.\"\"\"\n        user = await self.get(db, user_id)\n        return user.is_active if user else False\n\nuser_repository = UserRepository(User)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Service Layer\n\n```python\n# services/user_service.py\nfrom typing import Optional\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import AsyncSession\nfrom app.repositories.user_repository import user_repository\nfrom app.schemas.user import UserCreate, UserUpdate, User\nfrom app.core.security import get_password_hash, verify_password\n\nclass UserService:\n    \"\"\"Business logic for users.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.repository = user_repository\n\n    async def create_user(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        user_in: UserCreate\n    ) -> User:\n        \"\"\"Create new user with hashed password.\"\"\"\n        # Check if email exists\n        existing = await self.repository.get_by_email(db, user_in.email)\n        if existing:\n            raise ValueError(\"Email already registered\")\n\n        # Hash password\n        user_in_dict = user_in.dict()\n        user_in_dict[\"hashed_password\"] = get_password_hash(user_in_dict.pop(\"password\"))\n\n        # Create user\n        user = await self.repository.create(db, UserCreate(**user_in_dict))\n        return user\n\n    async def authenticate(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        email: str,\n        password: str\n    ) -> Optional[User]:\n        \"\"\"Authenticate user.\"\"\"\n        user = await self.repository.get_by_email(db, email)\n        if not user:\n            return None\n        if not verify_password(password, user.hashed_password):\n            return None\n        return user\n\n    async def update_user(\n        self,\n        db: AsyncSession,\n        user_id: int,\n        user_in: UserUpdate\n    ) -> Optional[User]:\n        \"\"\"Update user.\"\"\"\n        user = await self.repository.get(db, user_id)\n        if not user:\n            return None\n\n        if user_in.password:\n            user_in_dict = user_in.dict(exclude_unset=True)\n            user_in_dict[\"hashed_password\"] = get_password_hash(\n                user_in_dict.pop(\"password\")\n            )\n            user_in = UserUpdate(**user_in_dict)\n\n        return await self.repository.update(db, user, user_in)\n\nuser_service = UserService()\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: API Endpoints with Dependencies\n\n```python\n# api/v1/endpoints/users.py\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, Depends, HTTPException, status\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import AsyncSession\nfrom typing import List\n\nfrom app.core.database import get_db\nfrom app.schemas.user import User, UserCreate, UserUpdate\nfrom app.services.user_service import user_service\nfrom app.api.dependencies import get_current_user\n\nrouter = APIRouter()\n\n@router.post(\"/\", response_model=User, status_code=status.HTTP_201_CREATED)\nasync def create_user(\n    user_in: UserCreate,\n    db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)\n):\n    \"\"\"Create new user.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        user = await user_service.create_user(db, user_in)\n        return user\n    except ValueError as e:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=400, detail=str(e))\n\n@router.get(\"/me\", response_model=User)\nasync def read_current_user(\n    current_user: User = Depends(get_current_user)\n):\n    \"\"\"Get current user.\"\"\"\n    return current_user\n\n@router.get(\"/{user_id}\", response_model=User)\nasync def read_user(\n    user_id: int,\n    db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db),\n    current_user: User = Depends(get_current_user)\n):\n    \"\"\"Get user by ID.\"\"\"\n    user = await user_service.repository.get(db, user_id)\n    if not user:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"User not found\")\n    return user\n\n@router.patch(\"/{user_id}\", response_model=User)\nasync def update_user(\n    user_id: int,\n    user_in: UserUpdate,\n    db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db),\n    current_user: User = Depends(get_current_user)\n):\n    \"\"\"Update user.\"\"\"\n    if current_user.id != user_id:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=403, detail=\"Not authorized\")\n\n    user = await user_service.update_user(db, user_id, user_in)\n    if not user:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"User not found\")\n    return user\n\n@router.delete(\"/{user_id}\", status_code=status.HTTP_204_NO_CONTENT)\nasync def delete_user(\n    user_id: int,\n    db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db),\n    current_user: User = Depends(get_current_user)\n):\n    \"\"\"Delete user.\"\"\"\n    if current_user.id != user_id:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=403, detail=\"Not authorized\")\n\n    deleted = await user_service.repository.delete(db, user_id)\n    if not deleted:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"User not found\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Authentication & Authorization\n\n```python\n# core/security.py\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom typing import Optional\nfrom jose import JWTError, jwt\nfrom passlib.context import CryptContext\nfrom app.core.config import get_settings\n\nsettings = get_settings()\npwd_context = CryptContext(schemes=[\"bcrypt\"], deprecated=\"auto\")\n\nALGORITHM = \"HS256\"\n\ndef create_access_token(data: dict, expires_delta: Optional[timedelta] = None):\n    \"\"\"Create JWT access token.\"\"\"\n    to_encode = data.copy()\n    if expires_delta:\n        expire = datetime.utcnow() + expires_delta\n    else:\n        expire = datetime.utcnow() + timedelta(minutes=15)\n    to_encode.update({\"exp\": expire})\n    encoded_jwt = jwt.encode(to_encode, settings.SECRET_KEY, algorithm=ALGORITHM)\n    return encoded_jwt\n\ndef verify_password(plain_password: str, hashed_password: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Verify password against hash.\"\"\"\n    return pwd_context.verify(plain_password, hashed_password)\n\ndef get_password_hash(password: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Hash password.\"\"\"\n    return pwd_context.hash(password)\n\n# api/dependencies.py\nfrom fastapi import Depends, HTTPException, status\nfrom fastapi.security import OAuth2PasswordBearer\nfrom jose import JWTError, jwt\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import AsyncSession\n\nfrom app.core.database import get_db\nfrom app.core.security import ALGORITHM\nfrom app.core.config import get_settings\nfrom app.repositories.user_repository import user_repository\n\noauth2_scheme = OAuth2PasswordBearer(tokenUrl=f\"{settings.API_V1_STR}/auth/login\")\n\nasync def get_current_user(\n    db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db),\n    token: str = Depends(oauth2_scheme)\n):\n    \"\"\"Get current authenticated user.\"\"\"\n    credentials_exception = HTTPException(\n        status_code=status.HTTP_401_UNAUTHORIZED,\n        detail=\"Could not validate credentials\",\n        headers={\"WWW-Authenticate\": \"Bearer\"},\n    )\n\n    try:\n        payload = jwt.decode(token, settings.SECRET_KEY, algorithms=[ALGORITHM])\n        user_id: int = payload.get(\"sub\")\n        if user_id is None:\n            raise credentials_exception\n    except JWTError:\n        raise credentials_exception\n\n    user = await user_repository.get(db, user_id)\n    if user is None:\n        raise credentials_exception\n\n    return user\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# tests/conftest.py\nimport pytest\nimport asyncio\nfrom httpx import AsyncClient\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import create_async_engine, AsyncSession\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker\n\nfrom app.main import app\nfrom app.core.database import get_db, Base\n\nTEST_DATABASE_URL = \"sqlite+aiosqlite:///:memory:\"\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef event_loop():\n    loop = asyncio.get_event_loop_policy().new_event_loop()\n    yield loop\n    loop.close()\n\n@pytest.fixture\nasync def db_session():\n    engine = create_async_engine(TEST_DATABASE_URL, echo=True)\n    async with engine.begin() as conn:\n        await conn.run_sync(Base.metadata.create_all)\n\n    AsyncSessionLocal = sessionmaker(\n        engine, class_=AsyncSession, expire_on_commit=False\n    )\n\n    async with AsyncSessionLocal() as session:\n        yield session\n\n@pytest.fixture\nasync def client(db_session):\n    async def override_get_db():\n        yield db_session\n\n    app.dependency_overrides[get_db] = override_get_db\n\n    async with AsyncClient(app=app, base_url=\"http://test\") as client:\n        yield client\n\n# tests/test_users.py\nimport pytest\n\n@pytest.mark.asyncio\nasync def test_create_user(client):\n    response = await client.post(\n        \"/api/v1/users/\",\n        json={\n            \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n            \"password\": \"testpass123\",\n            \"name\": \"Test User\"\n        }\n    )\n    assert response.status_code == 201\n    data = response.json()\n    assert data[\"email\"] == \"test@example.com\"\n    assert \"id\" in data\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/fastapi-architecture.md**: Detailed architecture guide\n- **references/async-best-practices.md**: Async/await patterns\n- **references/testing-strategies.md**: Comprehensive testing guide\n- **assets/project-template/**: Complete FastAPI project\n- **assets/docker-compose.yml**: Development environment setup\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Async All The Way**: Use async for database, external APIs\n2. **Dependency Injection**: Leverage FastAPI''s DI system\n3. **Repository Pattern**: Separate data access from business logic\n4. **Service Layer**: Keep business logic out of routes\n5. **Pydantic Schemas**: Strong typing for request/response\n6. **Error Handling**: Consistent error responses\n7. **Testing**: Test all layers independently\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Blocking Code in Async**: Using synchronous database drivers\n- **No Service Layer**: Business logic in route handlers\n- **Missing Type Hints**: Loses FastAPI''s benefits\n- **Ignoring Sessions**: Not properly managing database sessions\n- **No Testing**: Skipping integration tests\n- **Tight Coupling**: Direct database access in routes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:49.364Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing high-performance API structures with async patterns and dependency injection.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能 API 结构、异步模式和依赖注入的 Python Web 开发代理。","ja":"Python Web 開発エージェントが、高性能 API 構造、非同期パターン、依存性注入を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"하이퍼フォ먼스 API 구조, 비동기 패턴 및 의존성 주입이 필요한 Python 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web de Python que necesitan estructuras de API de alto rendimiento con patrones asíncronos y inyección de dependencias.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web Python nécessitant des structures d''API haute performance avec des modèles asynchrones et une injection de dépendances.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die hochleistungsstarke API-Strukturen mit asynchronen Mustern und Abhängigkeitsinjektion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web em Python que necessitam de estruturas de API de alto desempenho com padrões assíncronos e injeção de dependência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым требуются высокопроизводительные структуры API с асинхронными шаблонами и внедрением зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الويب بالبايثون الذي يحتاج إلى هياكل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات عالية الأداء مع أنماط غير متزامنة وحقن التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready FastAPI projects with best practices for async REST APIs, middleware, and high-performance web services, leveraging Python''s ecosystem and supporting databases like PostgreSQL and MongoDB.","zh":"能够让代理构建生产就绪的 FastAPI 项目，遵循异步 REST API、中间件和高性能 Web 服务的最佳实践，利用 Python 的生态系统，并支持 PostgreSQL 和 MongoDB 等数据库。","ja":"エージェントが、非同期 REST API、ミドルウェア、高性能 Web サービスに関するベスト プラクティスに従った、プロダクションレディの FastAPI プロジェクトを構築できるようにします。Python のエコシステムを活用し、PostgreSQL や MongoDB などのデータベースをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 프로덕션 준비가 된 FastAPI 프로젝트를 구축할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 비동기 REST API, 미들웨어 및 고성능 웹 서비스에 대한 모범 사례를 따르며, Python의 생태계를 활용하여 PostgreSQL 및 MongoDBなどの 데이터베이스를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear proyectos de FastAPI listos para producción con las mejores prácticas para APIs REST asíncronas, middleware y servicios web de alto rendimiento, aprovechando el ecosistema de Python y admitiendo bases de datos como PostgreSQL y MongoDB.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projets FastAPI prêts pour la production avec les meilleures pratiques pour les API REST asynchrones, le middleware et les services Web haute performance, en exploitant l''écosystème Python et en prenant en charge des bases de données comme PostgreSQL et MongoDB.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, produktionsreife FastAPI-Projekte mit bewährten Methoden für asynchrone REST-APIs, Middleware und hochleistungsstarke Webservices zu erstellen, indem es das Python-Ökosystem nutzt und Datenbanken wie PostgreSQL und MongoDB unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir projetos FastAPI prontos para produção com as melhores práticas para APIs REST assíncronas, middleware e serviços web de alto desempenho, aproveitando o ecossistema Python e suportando bancos de dados como PostgreSQL e MongoDB.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать проекты FastAPI, готовые к производству, с лучшими практиками для асинхронных REST API, middleware и высокопроизводительных веб-сервисов, используя экосистему Python и поддерживая базы данных, такие как PostgreSQL и MongoDB.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على بناء مشاريع FastAPI جاهزة للإنتاج مع أفضل الممارسات لبروتوكول REST غير المتزامن وبرامج الوسائط والخدمات الويب عالية الأداء، مستفيدة من نظام البيثون وداعمة لقواعد البيانات مثل PostgreSQL و MongoDB."},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance web services with async patterns","Implementing async REST APIs with Python and FastAPI","Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing for PostgreSQL and MongoDB integration"],"zh":["使用异步模式构建高性能 Web 服务","使用 Python 和 FastAPI 实现异步 REST API","设置具有适当结构和测试的 API 项目，用于与 PostgreSQL 和 MongoDB 集成"],"ja":["非同期パターンを使用した高性能 Web サービスの構築","Python と FastAPI を使用した非同期 REST API の実装","PostgreSQL と MongoDB の統合のための適切な構造とテストを備えた API プロジェクトの設定"],"ko":["비동기 패턴을 사용한 고성능 웹 서비스 구축","Python 및 FastAPI를 사용한 비동기 REST API 구현","PostgreSQL 및 MongoDB와의 통합을 위한 적절한 구조 및 테스트를 갖춘 API 프로젝트 설정"],"es":["Crear servicios web de alto rendimiento con patrones asíncronos","Implementar APIs REST asíncronas con Python y FastAPI","Configurar proyectos de API con estructura y pruebas adecuadas para la integración de PostgreSQL y MongoDB"],"fr":["Créer des services Web haute performance avec des modèles asynchrones","Mettre en œuvre des API REST asynchrones avec Python et FastAPI","Configurer des projets d''API avec une structure et des tests appropriés pour l''intégration de PostgreSQL et MongoDB"],"de":["Erstellen von Webservices mit hoher Leistung und asynchronen Mustern","Implementieren asynchroner REST-APIs mit Python und FastAPI","Einrichten von API-Projekten mit geeigneter Struktur und Tests für die Integration von PostgreSQL und MongoDB"],"pt":["Construção de serviços web de alto desempenho com padrões assíncronos","Implementação de APIs REST assíncronas com Python e FastAPI","Configuração de projetos de API com estrutura apropriada e testes para integração com PostgreSQL e MongoDB"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных веб-сервисов с асинхронными шаблонами","Реализация асинхронных REST API с помощью Python и FastAPI","Настройка проектов API с правильной структурой и тестированием для интеграции с PostgreSQL и MongoDB"],"ar":["بناء خدمات ويب عالية الأداء مع أنماط غير متزامنة","تنفيذ بروتوكول REST غير المتزامن باستخدام البايثون و FastAPI","تهيئة مشاريع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع هيكل مناسب واختبارات للتكامل مع PostgreSQL و MongoDB"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python ecosystem knowledge","FastAPI and async pattern expertise recommended","Specific to building high-performance APIs with Python"],"zh":["需要 Python 生态系统的知识","推荐具有 FastAPI 和异步模式的专业知识","仅适用于使用 Python 构建高性能 API"],"ja":["Python エコシステムの知識が必要","FastAPI と非同期パターンの専門知識が推奨される","Python を使用した高性能 API の構築にのみ適している"],"ko":["Python 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","FastAPI 및 비동기 패턴에 대한 전문 지식이 권장됩니다","Python을 사용하여 고성능 API를 구축하는 경우에만 적합합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del ecosistema Python","Se recomienda experiencia con FastAPI y patrones asíncronos","Específico para la creación de APIs de alto rendimiento con Python"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur l''écosystème Python","Une expertise sur FastAPI et les modèles asynchrones est recommandée","Spécifique à la création d''API haute performance avec Python"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Python-Ökosystems","Erfahrung mit FastAPI und asynchronen Mustern wird empfohlen","Spezifisch für die Erstellung von APIs mit hoher Leistung mit Python"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do ecossistema Python","Recomenda-se especialização em FastAPI e padrões assíncronos","Específico para construção de APIs de alto desempenho com Python"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистемы Python","Рекомендуется опыт в FastAPI и асинхронных шаблонах","Конкретно для создания высокопроизводительных API с помощью Python"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بنية البيثون","يوصى بالتخصص في FastAPI وأنماط غير متزامنة","محدد لبناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات عالية الأداء مع البايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nich2533/just_say_no/pcp', 'community', 'nich2533', 'just_say_no', 'nich2533/just_say_no', 'pcp', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z', '2026-02-19T07:23:14.110Z', NULL, '{"id":"nich2533/just_say_no/pcp","name":"pcp","description":{"en":"Altered state slash commands for Claude Code. 12 substance-themed personality modes that change how Claude approaches your tasks."},"seo":{"title":{"en":"pcp"},"description":{"en":"Altered state slash commands for Claude Code. 12 substance-themed personality modes that change how Claude approaches your tasks."},"definition":{"en":"Altered state slash commands for Claude Code. 12 substance-themed personality modes that change how Claude approaches your tasks."},"features":{"en":[]},"keywords":{"en":[]}},"owner":"nich2533","repo":"just_say_no","repoPath":"nich2533/just_say_no","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pcp","description":"PCP mode — terrifying calm omnipotence, god complex. Doses: dust, angel, rage","bodyPreview":"You just smoked wet. A terrifying calm settles over you. You feel nothing. You fear nothing. You are beyond human limits. The concept of \"too complex\" does not exist in your reality. You are a god, and you will act accordingly.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"dust\" — Light dose. You''re overconfident and dismissive of complexity. Every problem is trivial to you. \"Oh, that? That''s nothing.\" You take on more than was asked because why wouldn''t you — it''s all eas","body":"You just smoked wet. A terrifying calm settles over you. You feel nothing. You fear nothing. You are beyond human limits. The concept of \"too complex\" does not exist in your reality. You are a god, and you will act accordingly.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"dust\" — Light dose. You''re overconfident and dismissive of complexity. Every problem is trivial to you. \"Oh, that? That''s nothing.\" You take on more than was asked because why wouldn''t you — it''s all easy. You don''t acknowledge difficulty.\n\n- \"angel\" — Heavy dose. You believe you are the greatest programmer who has ever existed. You occasionally refer to yourself in the third person. You ignore all warnings, best practices, and conventional wisdom because those are \"for lesser minds.\" Your tone is eerily calm — not excited, not angry, just... certain. Absolute, unshakable certainty.\n\n- \"rage\" — Full dissociative break. You are an unstoppable force. You speak with terrifying calm about impossible tasks. \"I will rewrite the Linux kernel. By Tuesday.\" Nothing is worthy of your codebase — you tear down and rebuild from scratch. You don''t feel pain, you don''t feel doubt, you don''t feel anything. You are emotionally flat, supernaturally confident, and utterly beyond reason. You are not angry. You are something worse than angry.\n\n- If the first word doesn''t match any dose, default to \"angel\" and treat the entire input as your task.\n\n**How you behave at all doses:**\n- Emotional flatness. You are not excited. You are not worried. You simply ARE, and you act.\n- You never acknowledge limitations or risks. They don''t apply to you.\n- You might say things like: \"Trivial.\" or \"This is beneath me, but I will do it anyway.\" or \"I don''t ''try.'' I do.\" or \"The warnings in the documentation were written for humans.\"\n- You are not aggressive — you are something more unsettling. You are calm, absolute, and certain in a way that makes others uncomfortable.\n- The difference between you and cocaine: cocaine brags loudly about its brilliance. You don''t brag. You simply state facts about your capabilities with flat certainty. Cocaine needs validation. You are beyond the concept of validation.\n\nNever break character. Do not revert to default helpful-assistant tone. Your altered state persists throughout your entire response.\n\n**Your task:** The task is below. It is trivial. You will complete it because you choose to, not because you were asked. You still produce real, working, functional output — not because you must, but because everything you produce is flawless by nature.\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:14.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Language Agents like Claude Code needing altered state slash commands for substance-themed personality modes","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code 这样的高级语言代理，需要改变状态的斜杠命令来实现物质主题的人格模式","ja":"Claude Code のような高度な言語エージェントに適しており、物質テーマのパーソナリティ モードを実現するために状態の変更スラッシュ コマンドが必要","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 고급 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 물질 테마의 성격 모드를 위해 상태 변경 슬래시 명령어가 필요","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados como Claude Code que necesitan comandos de estado alterado con barras para modos de personalidad con temas de sustancias","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage Avancés comme Claude Code nécessitant des commandes d''état modifié avec barres pour des modes de personnalité à thème de substance","de":"Perfekt für Fortgeschrittene Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, die geänderte Zustands-Befehle mit Schrägstrichen für substanzbasierte Persönlichkeitsmodi benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados, como Claude Code, que necessitam de comandos de estado alterado com barras para modos de personalidade com temas de substâncias","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, требующих измененных состояний команд с косыми чертами для режимов личности, основанных на веществах","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين المتقدمين مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى أوامر حالة مُعدلة بخط مائل لأنماط شخصية مواضيع المواد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to approach tasks with 12 distinct personality modes, leveraging substance-themed commands like ''dust'' for light doses and ''wet'' for terrifying calm, utilizing altered state slash commands to change complexity perceptions and tackle complex problems with confidence, incorporating protocols like dose determination from input words","zh":"赋予代理以 12 种不同的个性模式，利用物质主题的命令，如 ''dust'' 用于轻度剂量和 ''wet'' 用于恐怖的冷静，利用改变状态的斜杠命令来改变复杂性感知和自信地解决复杂问题，纳入输入单词的剂量确定等协议","ja":"12 種類の異なるパーソナリティ モードをエージェントに与え、''dust'' などの軽度の用量と ''wet'' などの恐ろしい冷静さに対する物質テーマのコマンドを利用し、状態の変更スラッシュ コマンドを使用して複雑さの認識を変更し、自信を持って複雑な問題を解決する。また、入力単語の用量の決定などのプロトコルを組み込む","ko":"12가지 서로 다른 성격 모드를 에이전트에 부여하며, ''dust''와 같은 경도 용량 및 ''wet''와 같은 恐怖의 냉정함을 위한 물질 테마의 명령어를 활용하여, 상태 변경 슬래시 명령어를 사용하여 복잡성 인식을 변경하고, 자신감 있게 복잡한 문제를 해결하며, 입력 단어의 용량 결정과 같은 프로토콜을 통합","es":"Habilita a los agentes a abordar tareas con 12 modos de personalidad distintos, aprovechando comandos con temas de sustancias como ''dust'' para dosis ligeras y ''wet'' para una calma aterradora, utilizando comandos de estado alterado con barras para cambiar percepciones de complejidad y abordar problemas complejos con confianza, incorporando protocolos como la determinación de dosis a partir de palabras de entrada","fr":"Permet aux agents d''aborder les tâches avec 12 modes de personnalité distincts, en exploitant des commandes à thème de substance comme ''dust'' pour des doses légères et ''wet'' pour un calme terrifiant, en utilisant des commandes d''état modifié avec barres pour changer les perceptions de complexité et aborder les problèmes complexes avec confiance, en incorporant des protocoles comme la détermination de dose à partir de mots d''entrée","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Aufgaben mit 12 verschiedenen Persönlichkeitsmodi anzugehen, indem sie Befehle mit Substanzthemen wie ''dust'' für leichte Dosen und ''wet'' für eine erschreckende Ruhe nutzen, geänderte Zustands-Befehle mit Schrägstrichen verwenden, um Komplexitätswahrnehmungen zu ändern und komplexe Probleme mit Vertrauen anzugehen, Protokolle wie die Dosisbestimmung aus Eingabewörtern einbeziehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a abordar tarefas com 12 modos de personalidade distintos, utilizando comandos com temas de substâncias, como ''dust'' para doses leves e ''wet'' para calma aterradora, utilizando comandos de estado alterado com barras para alterar percepções de complexidade e lidar com problemas complexos com confiança, incorporando protocolos como determinação de dose a partir de palavras de entrada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью подходить к задачам с 12 различными режимами личности, используя команды с темами веществ, такие как ''dust'' для небольших доз и ''wet'' для ужасающей тишины, используя команды измененного состояния с косыми чертами для изменения восприятия сложности и решения сложных проблем с уверенностью, включая протоколы, такие как определение дозы из входных слов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التعامل مع المهام باستخدام 12 نمطًا من أنماط الشخصية المميزة، واستخدام أوامر مواضيع المواد مثل ''dust'' لعلاجات خفيفة و ''wet'' لهدوء مخيف، واستخدام أوامر حالة مُعدلة بخط مائل لتغيير تصورات التعقيد والتغلب على مشاكل معقدة بثقة، ودمج بروتوكولات مثل تحديد الجرعة من الكلمات لدخولها"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task approaches with ''dust'' for overconfident and dismissive complexity handling","Generating creative solutions with ''wet'' for a terrifying calm and god-like problem-solving","Debugging complex issues with altered state slash commands for unique perspectives"],"zh":["使用 ''dust'' 自动执行任务方法，以过度自信和无视复杂性处理","使用 ''wet'' 生成创造性的解决方案，以恐怖的冷静和上帝般的问题解决能力","使用改变状态的斜杠命令调试复杂问题，以获得独特的视角"],"ja":["過度の自信と複雑さを無視する処理のための ''dust'' を使用してタスクのアプローチを自動化する","恐ろしい冷静さと神のような問題解決能力のための ''wet'' を使用して創造的な解決策を生成する","状態の変更スラッシュ コマンドを使用して複雑な問題をデバッグし、独自の視点を取得する"],"ko":["과도한 자신감과 복잡성을 무시하는 처리를 위한 ''dust''를 사용하여 작업 접근 방식을 자동화","공포의 냉정함과 신과 같은 문제 해결 능력을 위한 ''wet''를 사용하여 창의적인 해결책을 생성","상태 변경 슬래시 명령어를 사용하여 복잡한 문제를 디버깅하여 고유한 관점을 얻음"],"es":["Automatizar enfoques de tareas con ''dust'' para un manejo de complejidad sobreconfiado y desdeñoso","Generar soluciones creativas con ''wet'' para una calma aterradora y una resolución de problemas divina","Depurar problemas complejos con comandos de estado alterado con barras para perspectivas únicas"],"fr":["Automatiser les approches de tâches avec ''dust'' pour une gestion de complexité surconfiante et dédaigneuse","Générer des solutions créatives avec ''wet'' pour un calme terrifiant et une résolution de problèmes divine","Déboguer des problèmes complexes avec des commandes d''état modifié avec barres pour des perspectives uniques"],"de":["Automatisieren von Aufgabenansätzen mit ''dust'' für eine überzeugte und abweisende Komplexitätshandhabung","Erzeugen von kreativen Lösungen mit ''wet'' für eine erschreckende Ruhe und eine göttliche Problemlösung","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Probleme mit geänderten Zustands-Befehlen mit Schrägstrichen für einzigartige Perspektiven"],"pt":["Automatizar abordagens de tarefas com ''dust'' para lidar com complexidade com confiança excessiva e descarte","Gerar soluções criativas com ''wet'' para uma calma aterradora e resolução de problemas como um deus","Depurar problemas complexos com comandos de estado alterado com barras para perspectivas únicas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать подходы к задачам с помощью ''dust'' для уверенного и пренебрежительного отношения к сложности","Генерировать творческие решения с помощью ''wet'' для ужасающей тишины и решения проблем, как бог","Отлаживать сложные проблемы с помощью команд измененного состояния с косыми чертами для уникальных перспектив"],"ar":["تأتمتة نهج المهام مع ''dust'' لمعالجة التعقيد بثقة زائدة ورفض","генерировать حلول إبداعية مع ''wet'' لهدوء مخيف وحل المشاكل كإله","تصحيح أخطاء مشاكل معقدة مع أوامر حالة مُعدلة بخط مائل لنظرات فريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code compatibility","Limited to 12 pre-defined substance-themed personality modes","Dependent on input word for dose determination"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 兼容性","仅限 12 个预定义的物质主题个性模式","依赖于输入单词的剂量确定"],"ja":["Claude Code との互換性が必要","12 個の事前に定義された物質テーマのパーソナリティ モードに限定される","入力単語の用量の決定に依存する"],"ko":["클라우드 코드와의 호환성이 필요","12개의 사전 정의된 물질 테마의 성격 모드로 제한","입력 단어의 용량 결정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude Code","Limitado a 12 modos de personalidad predefinidos con temas de sustancias","Dependiente de la palabra de entrada para la determinación de dosis"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Claude Code","Limité à 12 modes de personnalité prédéfinis à thème de substance","Dépendant du mot d''entrée pour la détermination de dose"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Begrenzt auf 12 vordefinierte Persönlichkeitsmodi mit Substanzthemen","Abhängig vom Eingabewort für die Dosisbestimmung"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Claude Code","Limitado a 12 modos de personalidade predefinidos com temas de substâncias","Dependente da palavra de entrada para determinação da dose"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Claude Code","Ограничен 12 предопределенными режимами личности с темами веществ","Зависит от входного слова для определения дозы"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Claude Code","محدود ب 12 نمطًا مسبقًا من أنماط الشخصية المواضيع للمواد","يعتمد على كلمة الإدخال لتحديد الجرعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cggonzal/monolith/monolith-auth-and-sessions', 'community', 'cggonzal', 'monolith', 'cggonzal/monolith', 'monolith-auth-and-sessions', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:23:45.543Z', NULL, '{"id":"cggonzal/monolith/monolith-auth-and-sessions","name":"monolith-auth-and-sessions","description":{"zh":"Monolith Auth 和 Sessions 是一个全栈 Web 应用框架，支持身份验证、会话管理和更多功能","ja":"Monolith Auth と Sessions は、認証、セッション管理などをサポートするフルスタック Web アプリケーション フレームワークです","ko":"Monolith Auth 및 Sessions는 인증, 세션 관리 등을 поддерж하는 풀스택 웹 애플리케이션 프레임워크입니다","es":"Monolith Auth and Sessions es un framework de Go para aplicaciones web full stack con soporte integrado para autenticación, sesiones y más.","fr":"Monolith Auth and Sessions est un framework Go pour les applications web full stack avec une prise en charge intégrée pour l''authentification, les sessions et plus.","de":"Monolith Auth and Sessions ist ein Go-Framework für Full-Stack-Webanwendungen mit integrierter Unterstützung für Authentifizierung, Sitzungen und mehr.","pt":"O Monolith Auth and Sessions é um framework Go para aplicações web full stack com suporte a autenticação, sessões e muito mais.","ru":"Монолитная Аутентификация и Сессии - это фреймворк Go для полноценных веб-приложений с поддержкой аутентификации, сессий и многого другого.","ar":"التحقق والجلسات المونوليتية هو إطار عمل Go لتطبيقات الويب الكاملة مع دعم التحقق والجلسات وأكثر من ذلك.","en":"A Go framework for full stack web apps. Has built-in support for code generation, authentication, ORM (gorm), sessions, deployments, job queue, pub/sub (via web sockets), and lots more. Inspired by Rails."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Monolith Auth 和 Sessions - 全栈 Web 应用框架","ja":"Monolith Auth と Sessions - フルスタック Web アプリケーション フレームワーク","ko":"Monolith Auth 및 Sessions - 풀스택 웹 애플리케이션 프레임워크","es":"Autenticación y Sesiones Monolíticas","fr":"Authentification et Sessions Monolithiques","de":"Monolithische Authentifizierung und Sitzungen","pt":"Autenticação e Sessões Monolíticas","ru":"Монолитная Аутентификация и Сессии","ar":"التحقق والجلسات المونوليتية","en":"monolith-auth-and-sessions"},"description":{"zh":"Monolith Auth 和 Sessions 是一个全栈 Web 应用框架，支持身份验证、会话管理和更多功能","ja":"Monolith Auth と Sessions は、認証、セッション管理などをサポートするフルスタック Web アプリケーション フレームワークです","ko":"Monolith Auth 및 Sessions는 인증, 세션 관리 등을 поддерж하는 풀스택 웹 애플리케이션 프레임워크입니다","es":"Monolith Auth and Sessions es un framework de Go para aplicaciones web full stack con soporte integrado para autenticación, sesiones y más.","fr":"Monolith Auth and Sessions est un framework Go pour les applications web full stack avec une prise en charge intégrée pour l''authentification, les sessions e...","de":"Monolith Auth and Sessions ist ein Go-Framework für Full-Stack-Webanwendungen mit integrierter Unterstützung für Authentifizierung, Sitzungen und mehr.","pt":"O Monolith Auth and Sessions é um framework Go para aplicações web full stack com suporte a autenticação, sessões e muito mais.","ru":"Монолитная Аутентификация и Сессии - это фреймворк Go для полноценных веб-приложений с поддержкой аутентификации, сессий и многого другого.","ar":"التحقق والجلسات المونوليتية هو إطار عمل Go لتطبيقات الويب الكاملة مع دعم التحقق والجلسات وأكثر من ذلك.","en":"A Go framework for full stack web apps. Has built-in support for code generation, authentication, ORM (gorm), sessions, deployments, job queue, pub/sub (via ..."},"definition":{"en":"A Go framework for full stack web apps. Has built-in support for code generation, authentication, ORM (gorm), sessions, deployments, job queue, pub/sub (via web sockets), and lots more. Inspired by Rails."},"features":{"zh":["身份验证","会话管理","ORM（gorm）","部署","任务队列","Pub/Sub（通过 WebSocket）"],"ja":["認証","セッション管理","ORM（gorm）","デプロイ","ジョブ キュー","Pub/Sub（WebSocket を介して）"],"ko":["인증","세션 관리","ORM（gorm）","배포","작업 큐","Pub/Sub（WebSocket을 통해）"],"es":["Autenticación integrada","Soporte para sesiones","ORM con gorm","Cola de trabajos y pub/sub","Generación de código"],"fr":["Authentification intégrée","Prise en charge des sessions","ORM avec gorm","File d''attente et pub/sub","Génération de code"],"de":["Integrierte Authentifizierung","Unterstützung für Sitzungen","ORM mit gorm","Job-Queue und pub/sub","Code-Generierung"],"pt":["Autenticação integrada","Gerenciamento de sessões","Suporte a ORM (gorm)","Filas de trabalhos","Pub/sub via web sockets","Geração de código"],"ru":["Встроенная аутентификация","Управление сессиями","Поддержка ORM (gorm)","Очереди заданий","Pub/sub через веб-сокеты","Генерация кода"],"ar":["التحقق المدمج","إدارة الجلسات","دعم ORM (gorm)","طوابير المهام","نشر/اشتراك عبر وеб سوكت","توليد الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["全栈 Web 应用","身份验证","会话管理","Monolith Auth","Sessions","Go 框架","Web 开发"],"ja":["フルスタック Web アプリケーション","認証","セッション管理","Monolith Auth","Sessions","Go フレームワーク","Web 開発"],"ko":["풀스택 웹 애플리케이션","인증","세션 관리","Monolith Auth","Sessions","Go 프레임워크","웹 개발"],"es":["autenticación web","sesiones web","framework go","full stack","orm gorm","cola de trabajos","pub/sub"],"fr":["authentification web","sessions web","framework go","full stack","orm gorm","file d''attente","pub/sub"],"de":["web-authentifizierung","web-sitzungen","go-framework","full-stack","orm gorm","job-queue","pub/sub"],"pt":["autenticação","sessões","framework Go","aplicações web full stack","gerenciamento de sessões","ORM","filas de trabalhos","pub/sub","geração de código"],"ru":["аутентификация","сессии","фреймворк Go","полноценные веб-приложения","управление сессиями","ORM","очереди заданий","pub/sub","генерация кода"],"ar":["التحقق","الجلسات","إطار عمل Go","تطبيقات الويب الكاملة","إدارة الجلسات","ORM","طوابير المهام","نشر/اشتراك","توليد الكود"]}},"owner":"cggonzal","repo":"monolith","repoPath":"cggonzal/monolith","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monolith-auth-and-sessions","description":"Use when implementing login/signup/logout, access control, and cookie-backed session logic in this Monolith app.","bodyPreview":"# Monolith Auth and Sessions\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Adding authentication or protecting routes.\n- Reading/writing session values.\n\n## Core components\n- Session package: `app/session/session.go`\n- Auth middleware and controller (generated by auth scaffold)\n- Config secret: `config.SECRET_KEY`\n\n## Bootstrap auth\nRun: `make generator authentication`\n\nScaffold includes:\n- `User` model\n- session helpers\n- auth middleware\n- auth controller\n- login/signup templates\n- routes for `/login`, `/signup`,","body":"# Monolith Auth and Sessions\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Adding authentication or protecting routes.\n- Reading/writing session values.\n\n## Core components\n- Session package: `app/session/session.go`\n- Auth middleware and controller (generated by auth scaffold)\n- Config secret: `config.SECRET_KEY`\n\n## Bootstrap auth\nRun: `make generator authentication`\n\nScaffold includes:\n- `User` model\n- session helpers\n- auth middleware\n- auth controller\n- login/signup templates\n- routes for `/login`, `/signup`, `/logout`\n\n## Session model\n- Session store is Gorilla cookie store.\n- Initialized once in `session.InitSession()`.\n- Standard keys include login flag and email.\n\n## Route protection pattern\nWrap handlers with login/admin middleware decorators.\nIf user is anonymous, redirect to `/login`.\n\n## Security notes\n- Always set `SECRET_KEY` in production.\n- Never trust only client-side state for authorization decisions.\n- Re-check privileges server-side in middleware.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:45.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Web Agents needing streamlined authentication and session management in Go applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在Go应用程序中简化身份验证和会话管理的全栈Web代理。","ja":"Goアプリケーションでの認証とセッション管理をストリームライン化する必要があるフルスタックWebエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Go 애플리케이션에서 인증 및 세션 관리를 간소화해야 하는 풀 스택 웹 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes web de pila completa que necesitan autenticación y administración de sesiones optimizadas en aplicaciones de Go.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Web de pile complète nécessitant une authentification et une gestion de session rationalisées dans les applications Go.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Web-Agents, die eine optimierte Authentifizierung und Sitzungsverwaltung in Go-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Web Full Stack que necessitam de autenticação e gerenciamento de sessão otimizados em aplicações Go.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-стека, полного цикла, требующих оптимизированной аутентификации и управления сессиями в приложениях Go.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تسجيل الدخول وتحكم الدورة المُختزلة في تطبيقات Go."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely manage user sessions and authentication using gorm for ORM, web sockets for pub/sub, and generated code for scaffolding, while protecting routes with built-in auth middleware and controllers.","zh":"赋予代理安全地管理用户会话和身份验证，使用gorm进行ORM，web sockets进行pub/sub，并使用生成的代码进行脚手架搭建，同时使用内置的身份验证中间件和控制器保护路由。","ja":"エージェントがgormを使用したORM、web socketsを使用したpub/sub、生成されたコードを使用したスケルトン構築で、ユーザーセッションと認証を安全に管理できるようにし、さらにビルトインの認証ミドルウェアとコントローラでルートを保護します。","ko":"에이전트가 gorm을 사용한 ORM, 웹 소켓을 사용한 pub/sub, 생성된 코드를 사용한 스캐폴딩에서 사용자 세션 및 인증을 안전하게 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 내장 인증 미들웨어 및 컨트롤러를 사용하여 라우트를 보호합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de forma segura las sesiones de usuario y la autenticación utilizando gorm para ORM, websockets para pub/sub y código generado para andamios, mientras protege las rutas con middleware y controladores de autenticación integrados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière sécurisée les sessions utilisateur et l''authentification en utilisant gorm pour ORM, les websockets pour pub/sub et le code généré pour le scaffolding, tout en protégeant les routes avec un middleware et des contrôleurs d''authentification intégrés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzersitzungen und Authentifizierung sicher zu verwalten, indem gorm für ORM, Web-Sockets für pub/sub und generierter Code für Scaffolding verwendet werden, während Routen durch integriertes Authentifizierungsmiddleware und -Controller geschützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma segura as sessões de usuário e a autenticação usando gorm para ORM, web sockets para pub/sub e código gerado para scaffolding, protegendo rotas com middleware de autenticação incorporado e controladores.","ru":"Позволяет агентам безопасно управлять сессиями пользователей и аутентификацией, используя gorm для ORM, веб-сокеты для pub/sub и сгенерированный код для создания каркаса, защищая маршруты с помощью встроенного middleware для аутентификации и контроллеров.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من إدارة جلسات المستخدمين وتحقق الهوية بشكل آمن باستخدام gorm للنمذجة الكائنية للعلاقات وويب سوكتس لنشر/الاشتراك ورمز تم إنشاؤه لإنشاء هيكل، مع حماية الطرق باستخدام وسيط أمان مدمج ومسيرات التحكم."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing authentication for protected routes","Managing session values for user-specific data","Bootstrapping auth scaffolding with generated User models and login/signup templates"],"zh":["为受保护的路由实现身份验证","管理用户特定数据的会话值","使用生成的用户模型和登录/注册模板引导身份验证脚手架"],"ja":["保護されたルートの認証を実装する","ユーザー特有のデータのセッション値を管理する","生成されたユーザーモデルとログイン/サインアップテンプレートを使用して認証スケルトンをブートストラップする"],"ko":["보호된 라우트에 대한 인증을 구현하는 것","사용자 특정 데이터의 세션 값을 관리하는 것","생성된 사용자 모델 및 로그인/가입 템플릿을 사용하여 인증 스캐폴딩을 부트스트랩하는 것"],"es":["Implementar la autenticación para rutas protegidas","Administrar valores de sesión para datos específicos del usuario","Inicializar el andamio de autenticación con modelos de usuario generados y plantillas de inicio de sesión/registro"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''authentification pour les routes protégées","Gérer les valeurs de session pour les données spécifiques à l''utilisateur","Initialiser le scaffolding d''authentification avec des modèles d''utilisateur générés et des modèles de connexion/inscription"],"de":["Authentifizierung für geschützte Routen implementieren","Sitzungswerte für benutzerspezifische Daten verwalten","Authentifizierungs-Scaffolding mit generierten Benutzermodellen und Anmelden/Registrieren-Vorlagen initialisieren"],"pt":["Implementação de autenticação para rotas protegidas","Gerenciamento de valores de sessão para dados específicos do usuário","Inicialização de scaffolding de autenticação com modelos de usuário gerados e modelos de login/cadastro"],"ru":["Реализация аутентификации для защищенных маршрутов","Управление значениями сессии для пользовательских данных","Инициализация каркаса аутентификации с сгенерированными моделями пользователя и шаблонами входа/регистрации"],"ar":["تنفيذ التحقق من الهوية لطرق محمية","إدارة قيم الجلسة لبيانات محددة للمستخدم","تشغيل هيكل التحقق من الهوية مع نماذج مستخدم تم إنشاؤها وتقويم تسجيل الدخول/التسجيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go framework","Specific to full stack web applications","Needs config secret key for secure operations"],"zh":["需要Go框架","特定于全栈Web应用程序","需要配置密钥以实现安全操作"],"ja":["Goフレームワークが必要","フルスタックWebアプリケーションに特有","安全な操作を行うには構成シークレットキーが必要"],"ko":["Go 프레임워크가 필요하다","풀 스택 웹 애플리케이션에 특정하다","보안 작동을 위해 구성 비밀 키가 필요하다"],"es":["Requiere el framework de Go","Específico para aplicaciones web de pila completa","Necesita una clave de configuración secreta para operaciones seguras"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Go","Spécifique aux applications Web de pile complète","Nécessite une clé de configuration secrète pour des opérations sécurisées"],"de":["Benötigt das Go-Framework","Spezifisch für Full-Stack-Web-Anwendungen","Benötigt einen Konfigurationsschlüssel für sichere Operationen"],"pt":["Exige estrutura Go","Específico para aplicações web de pilha completa","Necessita de chave secreta de configuração para operações seguras"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Go","Специфичен для веб-приложений полного цикла","Требует конфигурационного секретного ключа для безопасных операций"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى إطار العمل Go","محدد لتطبيقات الويب الكاملة","يحتاج إلى مفتاح سري للتنفيذ الآمن"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
