 benutzerdefinierten Themes","Erstellung von Plugins","Entwicklung von Gutenberg-Blöcken","Anpassung von WooCommerce","Leistungsoptimierung","Integration von REST API"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de temas personalizados","Criação de plugins","Desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg","Customização do WooCommerce","Otimização de desempenho","Integração com a API REST"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных тем","Разработка плагинов","Создание блоков Gutenberg","Настройка WooCommerce","Оптимизация производительности","Интеграция с REST API"],"ar":["تطوير السمات المخصصة","إنشاء الإضافات","تطوير بلوكات جوتنبرج","تخصيص ووكومرس","تحسين الأداء","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress","自定义主题","插件开发","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","性能优化","PHP 8.1+","REST API"],"ja":["WordPress","カスタムテーマ","プラグイン開発","ガーテンベルク","WooCommerce","パフォーマンス最適化","PHP 8.1+","REST API"],"ko":["워드프레스","커스텀 테마","플러그인 개발","구텐베르크","우커머스","성능 최적화","PHP 8.1+","REST API"],"es":["WordPress Pro","desarrollo de WordPress","temas personalizados","plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","optimización de rendimiento","PHP 8.1+","REST API"],"fr":["Expert WordPress Pro","développement de WordPress","thèmes personnalisés","plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","optimisation des performances","PHP 8.1+","API REST"],"de":["WordPress Pro Experte","WordPress-Entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Themes","Plugins","Gutenberg","WooCommerce","Leistungsoptimierung","PHP 8.1+","REST API"],"pt":["desenvolvedor wordpress","temas personalizados","plugins","blocos gutenberg","woocommerce","otimização de desempenho","api rest","desenvolvimento de soluções wordpress"],"ru":["разработчик wordpress","индивидуальные темы","плагины","блоки gutenberg","woocommerce","оптимизация производительности","rest api","создание решений на основе wordpress"],"ar":["مطور ووردبريس","السمات المخصصة","الإضافات","بلوكات جوتنبرج","ووكومرس","تحسين الأداء","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST","تطوير حلول ووردبريس"]}},"owner":"latelierkiyose","repo":"wp-theme-v2","repoPath":"latelierkiyose/wp-theme-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:51.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Web Development Agents specializing in WordPress theme and plugin customization.","zh":"适用于专门从事WordPress主题和插件定制的Web开发代理。","ja":"WordPressテーマとプラグインのカスタマイズを専門とするWeb開発エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"워드프레스 테마 및 플러그인 사용자 정의에 전문적인 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de desarrollo web especializados en personalización de temas y plugins de WordPress.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement web spécialisés dans la personnalisation de thèmes et de plugins WordPress.","de":"Wesentlich für Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Anpassung von WordPress-Themen und -Plug-ins spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web especializados em personalização de temas e plugins do WordPress.","ru":"Необходим для агентов по разработке веб-сайтов, специализирующихся на настройке тем и плагинов WordPress.","ar":"أساسي لموكلات تطوير الويب المتخصصة في تخصيص السمات وإضافات ووردبريس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to develop custom Gutenberg blocks, optimize WordPress performance, and build secure WooCommerce solutions using PHP 8.1+ and REST API integrations.","zh":"使代理能够使用PHP 8.1+和REST API集成开发自定义Gutenberg块，优化WordPress性能，并构建安全的WooCommerce解决方案。","ja":"エージェントがPHP 8.1+とREST API統合を使用してカスタムのGutenbergブロックを開発し、WordPressのパフォーマンスを最適化し、安全なWooCommerceソリューションを構築できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 PHP 8.1+ 및 REST API 통합을 사용하여 사용자 지정 Gutenberg 블록을 개발하고 워드프레스 성능을 최적화하며 보안 WooCommerce 솔루션을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar bloques personalizados de Gutenberg, optimizar el rendimiento de WordPress y crear soluciones de WooCommerce seguras utilizando PHP 8.1+ y integraciones de API REST.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des blocs Gutenberg personnalisés, d''optimiser les performances de WordPress et de créer des solutions WooCommerce sécurisées en utilisant PHP 8.1+ et des intégrations d''API REST.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Gutenberg-Blöcke zu entwickeln, die WordPress-Leistung zu optimieren und sichere WooCommerce-Lösungen unter Verwendung von PHP 8.1+ und REST-API-Integrationen zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam blocos personalizados do Gutenberg, otimizem o desempenho do WordPress e criem soluções seguras do WooCommerce usando PHP 8.1+ e integrações da API REST.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать пользовательские блоки Gutenberg, оптимизировать производительность WordPress и создавать безопасные решения WooCommerce с использованием PHP 8.1+ и интеграций REST API.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير كتل جوتنبرج المخصصة وتحسين أداء ووردبريس وبناء حلول ووكومرس آمنة باستخدام PHP 8.1+ ودمج API REST."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom WordPress themes","Creating Gutenberg block plugins","Optimizing WordPress site performance","Implementing WooCommerce customizations","Building REST API integrations"],"zh":["开发自定义WordPress主题","创建Gutenberg块插件","优化WordPress站点性能","实施WooCommerce自定义","构建REST API集成"],"ja":["カスタムのWordPressテーマを開発する","Gutenbergブロックプラグインを作成する","WordPressサイトのパフォーマンスを最適化する","WooCommerceのカスタマイズを実装する","REST API統合を構築する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 워드프레스 테마 개발","Gutenberg 블록 플러그인 생성","워드프레스 사이트 성능 최적화","WooCommerce 사용자 정의 구현","REST API 통합 구축"],"es":["Desarrollar temas personalizados de WordPress","Crear plugins de bloques de Gutenberg","Optimizar el rendimiento del sitio web de WordPress","Implementar personalizaciones de WooCommerce","Crear integraciones de API REST"],"fr":["Développer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés","Créer des plugins de blocs Gutenberg","Optimiser les performances du site web WordPress","Mettre en œuvre des personnalisation de WooCommerce","Créer des intégrations d''API REST"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themen entwickeln","Gutenberg-Block-Plugins erstellen","WordPress-Website-Leistung optimieren","WooCommerce-Anpassungen implementieren","REST-API-Integrationen erstellen"],"pt":["Desenvolver temas personalizados do WordPress","Criar plugins de blocos do Gutenberg","Otimizar o desempenho do site do WordPress","Implementar personalizações do WooCommerce","Construir integrações da API REST"],"ru":["Разработка пользовательских тем WordPress","Создание плагинов блоков Gutenberg","Оптимизация производительности сайта WordPress","Реализация пользовательских настроек WooCommerce","Postroenie интеграций REST API"],"ar":["تطوير سمات ووردبريس المخصصة","إنشاء إضافات كتل جوتنبرج","تحسين أداء موقع ووردبريس","تنفيذ تخصيصات ووكومرس","بناء دمج API REST"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment","PHP 8.1+ compatibility needed","Focuses exclusively on WordPress ecosystem"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境","需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","专注于WordPress生态系统"],"ja":["WordPress環境が必要","PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPressエコシステムにのみ焦点を当てている"],"ko":["워드프레스 환경 필요","PHP 8.1+ 호환성 필요","워드프레스 생태계에만 중점을 두고 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de WordPress","Se necesita compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Se centra exclusivamente en el ecosistema de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress","La compatibilité PHP 8.1+ est nécessaire","Se concentre exclusivement sur l''écosystème WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebung","PHP 8.1+-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf das WordPress-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer ambiente do WordPress","Compatibilidade com PHP 8.1+ necessária","Focado exclusivamente no ecossistema do WordPress"],"ru":["Требуется среда WordPress","Необходима совместимость с PHP 8.1+","Фокусируется исключительно на экосистеме WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس","مطلوب توافق مع PHP 8.1+","يركز حصريًا على نظام ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
