安全的发布的关键，涉及CI/CD架构、部署门和多环境管道","ja":"デプロイパイプライン設計は、安全性と速度のバランスをとったデプロイを実現するための重要な概念です","ko":"배포 파이프라인 디자인은 안정적이고 빠른 배포를 위한 중요한概念으로, CI/CD 아키텍처와 배포 게이트를 포함합니다","es":"El diseño de pipeline de despliegue implica la creación de arquitecturas de CI/CD robustas y seguras para implementar software de manera eficiente","fr":"La conception de pipeline de déploiement consiste à créer des architectures CI/CD robustes et sécurisées pour déployer des logiciels de manière efficace","de":"Der Entwurf von Deployment-Pipelines beinhaltet die Erstellung robuster und sicherer CI/CD-Architekturen für eine effiziente Software-Implementierung","pt":"Desenho de pipelines de implantação para equilibrar velocidade e segurança","ru":"Проектирование конвейеров развертывания для балансировки скорости и безопасности","ar":"تصميم أنابيب النشر لتحقيق توازن بين السرعة والأمان","en":"Das SVA Studio soll als Headless- und API-first-System sowohl die Smart Village App versorgen als auch als Stadt-CMS bzw. Content-Hub für externe Kanäle dien..."},"definition":{"en":"Das SVA Studio soll als Headless- und API-first-System sowohl die Smart Village App versorgen als auch als Stadt-CMS bzw. Content-Hub für externe Kanäle dienen (Websites, Stelen, Fachsoftware)."},"features":{"zh":["CI/CD架构设计","部署门和多环境管道","进阶的发布策略","自动化的发布工作流","安全和合规的部署"],"ja":["CI/CDアーキテクチャ設計","デプロイゲートとマルチ環境パイプライン","進歩的なデプロイ戦略","自動化されたデプロイワークフロー","セキュリティとコンプライアンスのデプロイ"],"ko":["CI/CD 아키텍처 설계","배포 게이트와 멀티 환경 파이프라인","진보적인 배포 전략","자동화된 배포 워크플로","보안과 컴플라이언スの 배포"],"es":["Arquitecturas de CI/CD","Estrategias de despliegue","Puertas de aprobación","Pipelines multietapa","Implementación progresiva","Mejores prácticas de despliegue"],"fr":["Architectures CI/CD","Stratégies de déploiement","Portes d''approbation","Pipelines multistages","Déploiement progressif","Meilleures pratiques de déploiement"],"de":["CI/CD-Architekturen","Deployment-Strategien","Genehmigungsschwellen","Mehrstufige Pipelines","Schrittweiser Einsatz","Best Practices für Deployment"],"pt":["Arquiteturas de CI/CD multi-estágio","Portões de aprovação","Estratégias de implantação","Configuração de pipelines multi-ambiente","Implementação de entrega progressiva"],"ru":["Многостадийные архитектуры CI/CD","Ворота утверждения","Стратегии развертывания","Конфигурация многосредовых конвейеров","Реализация постепенной доставки"],"ar":["هياكل متكاملة متعددة المراحل","بوابات الموافقة","استراتيجيات النشر","تكوين أنابيب متعددة البيئات","تنفيذ تسليم渐ي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["部署流水线设计","CI/CD","自动化发布","安全发布","多环境管道","进阶发布策略"],"ja":["デプロイパイプライン設計","CI/CD","自動化されたリリース","セキュリティのリリース","マルチ環境パイプライン","進歩的なリリース戦略"],"ko":["배포 파이프라인 디자인","CI/CD","자동화된 배포","보안 배포","멀티 환경 파이프라인","진보적인 배포 전략"],"es":["diseño de pipeline de despliegue","arquitecturas de CI/CD","estrategias de despliegue","puertas de aprobación","pipelines multietapa","implementación progresiva","mejores prácticas de despliegue","desarrollo de software","automatización de despliegue"],"fr":["conception de pipeline de déploiement","architectures CI/CD","stratégies de déploiement","portes d''approbation","pipelines multistages","déploiement progressif","meilleures pratiques de déploiement","développement de logiciels","automatisation de déploiement"],"de":["Entwurf von Deployment-Pipelines","CI/CD-Architekturen","Deployment-Strategien","Genehmigungsschwellen","mehrstufige Pipelines","schrittweiser Einsatz","Best Practices für Deployment","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Deployment"],"pt":["desenho de pipeline de implantação","arquiteturas de CI/CD","portões de aprovação","estratégias de implantação","configuração de pipelines","entrega progressiva"],"ru":["проектирование конвейера развертывания","архитектуры CI/CD","ворота утверждения","стратегии развертывания","конфигурация конвейеров","постепенная доставка"],"ar":["تصميم أنابيب النشر","هياكل متكاملة","بوابات الموافقة","استراتيجيات النشر","تكوين أنابيب","تسليم渐ي"]}},"owner":"smart-village-solutions","repo":"sva-studio","repoPath":"smart-village-solutions/sva-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deployment-pipeline-design","description":"Design multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates, security checks, and deployment orchestration. Use when architecting deployment workflows, setting up continuous delivery, or implementing GitOps practices.","bodyPreview":"# Deployment Pipeline Design\n\nArchitecture patterns for multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates and deployment strategies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign robust, secure deployment pipelines that balance speed with safety through proper stage organization and approval workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design CI/CD architecture\n- Implement deployment gates\n- Configure multi-environment pipelines\n- Establish deployment best practices\n- Implement progressive delivery\n\n## Repo-Konventionen (SVA Studio)\n\n- W","body":"# Deployment Pipeline Design\n\nArchitecture patterns for multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates and deployment strategies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign robust, secure deployment pipelines that balance speed with safety through proper stage organization and approval workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design CI/CD architecture\n- Implement deployment gates\n- Configure multi-environment pipelines\n- Establish deployment best practices\n- Implement progressive delivery\n\n## Repo-Konventionen (SVA Studio)\n\n- Wenn Pipeline-/Deployment-Aenderungen die Laufzeit- oder Deployment-Sicht wesentlich veraendern, dokumentiere die betroffenen arc42-Abschnitte unter `docs/architecture/` (Einstiegspunkt: `docs/architecture/README.md`) und halte Entscheidungen als ADRs unter `docs/architecture/decisions/` fest.\n\n## Pipeline Stages\n\n### Standard Pipeline Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────┐   ┌──────┐   ┌─────────┐   ┌────────┐   ┌──────────┐\n│  Build  │ → │ Test │ → │ Staging │ → │ Approve│ → │Production│\n└─────────┘   └──────┘   └─────────┘   └────────┘   └──────────┘\n```\n\n### Detailed Stage Breakdown\n\n1. **Source** - Code checkout\n2. **Build** - Compile, package, containerize\n3. **Test** - Unit, integration, security scans\n4. **Staging Deploy** - Deploy to staging environment\n5. **Integration Tests** - E2E, smoke tests\n6. **Approval Gate** - Manual approval required\n7. **Production Deploy** - Canary, blue-green, rolling\n8. **Verification** - Health checks, monitoring\n9. **Rollback** - Automated rollback on failure\n\n## Approval Gate Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Manual Approval\n\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions\nproduction-deploy:\n  needs: staging-deploy\n  environment:\n    name: production\n    url: https://app.example.com\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  steps:\n    - name: Deploy to production\n      run: |\n        # Deployment commands\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Time-Based Approval\n\n```yaml\n# GitLab CI\ndeploy:production:\n  stage: deploy\n  script:\n    - deploy.sh production\n  environment:\n    name: production\n  when: delayed\n  start_in: 30 minutes\n  only:\n    - main\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Approver\n\n```yaml\n# Azure Pipelines\nstages:\n  - stage: Production\n    dependsOn: Staging\n    jobs:\n      - deployment: Deploy\n        environment:\n          name: production\n          resourceType: Kubernetes\n        strategy:\n          runOnce:\n            preDeploy:\n              steps:\n                - task: ManualValidation@0\n                  inputs:\n                    notifyUsers: \"team-leads@example.com\"\n                    instructions: \"Review staging metrics before approving\"\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/approval-gate-template.yml`\n\n## Deployment Strategies\n\n### 1. Rolling Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\nspec:\n  replicas: 10\n  strategy:\n    type: RollingUpdate\n    rollingUpdate:\n      maxSurge: 2\n      maxUnavailable: 1\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Gradual rollout\n- Zero downtime\n- Easy rollback\n- Best for most applications\n\n### 2. Blue-Green Deployment\n\n```yaml\n# Blue (current)\nkubectl apply -f blue-deployment.yaml\nkubectl label service my-app version=blue\n\n# Green (new)\nkubectl apply -f green-deployment.yaml\n# Test green environment\nkubectl label service my-app version=green\n\n# Rollback if needed\nkubectl label service my-app version=blue\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Instant switchover\n- Easy rollback\n- Doubles infrastructure cost temporarily\n- Good for high-risk deployments\n\n### 3. Canary Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Rollout\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\nspec:\n  replicas: 10\n  strategy:\n    canary:\n      steps:\n        - setWeight: 10\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 25\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 50\n        - pause: { duration: 5m }\n        - setWeight: 100\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Gradual traffic shift\n- Risk mitigation\n- Real user testing\n- Requires service mesh or similar\n\n### 4. Feature Flags\n\n```python\nfrom flagsmith import Flagsmith\n\nflagsmith = Flagsmith(environment_key=\"API_KEY\")\n\nif flagsmith.has_feature(\"new_checkout_flow\"):\n    # New code path\n    process_checkout_v2()\nelse:\n    # Existing code path\n    process_checkout_v1()\n```\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Deploy without releasing\n- A/B testing\n- Instant rollback\n- Granular control\n\n## Pipeline Orchestration\n\n### Multi-Stage Pipeline Example\n\n```yaml\nname: Production Pipeline\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Build application\n        run: make build\n      - name: Build Docker image\n        run: docker build -t myapp:${{ github.sha }} .\n      - name: Push to registry\n        run: docker push myapp:${{ github.sha }}\n\n  test:\n    needs: build\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Unit tests\n        run: make test\n      - name: Security scan\n        run: trivy image myapp:${{ github.sha }}\n\n  deploy-staging:\n    needs: test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: staging\n    steps:\n      - name: Deploy to staging\n        run: kubectl apply -f k8s/staging/\n\n  integration-test:\n    needs: deploy-staging\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Run E2E tests\n        run: npm run test:e2e\n\n  deploy-production:\n    needs: integration-test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: production\n    steps:\n      - name: Canary deployment\n        run: |\n          kubectl apply -f k8s/production/\n          kubectl argo rollouts promote my-app\n\n  verify:\n    needs: deploy-production\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Health check\n        run: curl -f https://app.example.com/health\n      - name: Notify team\n        run: |\n          curl -X POST ${{ secrets.SLACK_WEBHOOK }} \\\n            -d ''{\"text\":\"Production deployment successful!\"}''\n```\n\n## Pipeline Best Practices\n\n1. **Fail fast** - Run quick tests first\n2. **Parallel execution** - Run independent jobs concurrently\n3. **Caching** - Cache dependencies between runs\n4. **Artifact management** - Store build artifacts\n5. **Environment parity** - Keep environments consistent\n6. **Secrets management** - Use secret stores (Vault, etc.)\n7. **Deployment windows** - Schedule deployments appropriately\n8. **Monitoring integration** - Track deployment metrics\n9. **Rollback automation** - Auto-rollback on failures\n10. **Documentation** - Document pipeline stages\n\n## Rollback Strategies\n\n### Automated Rollback\n\n```yaml\ndeploy-and-verify:\n  steps:\n    - name: Deploy new version\n      run: kubectl apply -f k8s/\n\n    - name: Wait for rollout\n      run: kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app\n\n    - name: Health check\n      id: health\n      run: |\n        for i in {1..10}; do\n          if curl -sf https://app.example.com/health; then\n            exit 0\n          fi\n          sleep 10\n        done\n        exit 1\n\n    - name: Rollback on failure\n      if: failure()\n      run: kubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app\n```\n\n### Manual Rollback\n\n```bash\n# List revision history\nkubectl rollout history deployment/my-app\n\n# Rollback to previous version\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app\n\n# Rollback to specific revision\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/my-app --to-revision=3\n```\n\n## Monitoring and Metrics\n\n### Key Pipeline Metrics\n\n- **Deployment Frequency** - How often deployments occur\n- **Lead Time** - Time from commit to production\n- **Change Failure Rate** - Percentage of failed deployments\n- **Mean Time to Recovery (MTTR)** - Time to recover from failure\n- **Pipeline Success Rate** - Percentage of successful runs\n- **Average Pipeline Duration** - Time to complete pipeline\n\n### Integration with Monitoring\n\n```yaml\n- name: Post-deployment verification\n  run: |\n    # Wait for metrics stabilization\n    sleep 60\n\n    # Check error rate\n    ERROR_RATE=$(curl -s \"$PROMETHEUS_URL/api/v1/query?query=rate(http_errors_total[5m])\" | jq ''.data.result[0].value[1]'')\n\n    if (( $(echo \"$ERROR_RATE > 0.01\" | bc -l) )); then\n      echo \"Error rate too high: $ERROR_RATE\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/pipeline-orchestration.md` - Complex pipeline patterns\n- `assets/approval-gate-template.yml` - Approval workflow templates\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `github-actions-templates` - For GitHub Actions implementation\n- `gitlab-ci-patterns` - For GitLab CI implementation\n- `secrets-management` - For secrets handling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:43.877Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring robust CI/CD pipeline design with approval gates and multi-stage deployment strategies.","zh":"适合需要强大的CI/CD流水线设计、具有审批门控和多阶段部署策略的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが強力なCI/CDパイプライン設計、承認ゲート、及びマルチステージのデプロイ戦略を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"DevOps 에이전트가 강력한 CI/CD 파이프라인 설계, 승인 게이트 및 멀티 스테이지 배포 전략이 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren un diseño robusto de tuberías de CI/CD con puertas de aprobación y estrategias de implementación multietapa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une conception robuste de pipelines CI/CD avec des portes d''approbation et des stratégies de déploiement mult étapes.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine robuste CI/CD-Pipeline-Design mit Genehmigungstoren und Multi-Stage-Implementierungsstrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes DevOps que requerem um projeto de pipeline de CI/CD robusto com portões de aprovação e estratégias de implantação em várias etapas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих надежного проектирования конвейера CI/CD с шлюзами утверждения и стратегиями многоэтапной развертки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤوبس الذي يتطلب تصميم أنابيب CI/CD قوي مع بوابات موافقة واستراتيجيات نشر متعددة المراحل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design secure and efficient deployment pipelines using architecture patterns, implementing deployment gates, and configuring multi-environment pipelines with approval workflows, leveraging CI/CD architecture and progressive delivery protocols.","zh":"赋予代理设计安全高效的部署流水线的能力，使用架构模式、实现部署门控、配置多环境流水线的审批工作流，利用CI/CD架构和渐进式交付协议。","ja":"エージェントが安全で効率的なデプロイパイプラインを設計できるようにし、Architectureパターンを使用してデプロイゲートを実装し、承認ワークフローを備えたマルチ環境パイプラインを構成し、CI/CDアーキテクチャとプログレッシブデリバリープロトコルを活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 보안 및 효율적인 배포 파이프라인을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, 아키텍처 패턴을 사용하여 배포 게이트를 구현하고 승인 워크플로우가 있는 멀티 환경 파이프라인을 구성하며, CI/CD 아키텍처 및 점진적 배포 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar tuberías de implementación seguras y eficientes utilizando patrones de arquitectura, implementando puertas de implementación y configurando tuberías multiambiente con flujos de trabajo de aprobación, aprovechando la arquitectura CI/CD y los protocolos de entrega progresiva.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des pipelines de déploiement sécurisés et efficaces en utilisant des modèles d''architecture, en mettant en œuvre des portes de déploiement et en configurant des pipelines multi-environnement avec des flux de travail d''approbation, en exploitant l''architecture CI/CD et les protocoles de livraison progressive.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere und effiziente Bereitstellungspipelines mithilfe von Architekturmuster zu entwerfen, Implementierungs-Tore zu implementieren und Multi-Umgebungspipelines mit Genehmigungs-Workflows zu konfigurieren, die CI/CD-Architektur und progressive Lieferprotokolle nutzend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar pipelines de implantação seguros e eficientes usando padrões de arquitetura, implementando portões de implantação e configurando pipelines multi-ambiente com fluxos de trabalho de aprovação, aproveitando a arquitetura CI/CD e os protocolos de entrega progressiva.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать безопасные и эффективные конвейеры развертки, используя шаблоны архитектуры, реализуя шлюзы развертки и настраивая многосредовые конвейеры с рабочими процессами утверждения, используя архитектуру CI/CD и протоколы постепенной доставки.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تصميم أنابيب نشر آمنة وفعالة باستخدام أنماط الهندسة المعمارية وتنفيذ بوابات النشر وتهيئة أنابيب متعددة البيئات مع سير عمل الموافقة، واستخدام هندسة CI/CD وبروتوكولات التسليم المتدرج."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-stage CI/CD pipelines with approval gates","Implementing deployment strategies for secure and efficient releases","Configuring multi-environment pipelines for streamlined testing and deployment","Establishing deployment best practices for robust and reliable delivery","Implementing progressive delivery for controlled and phased rollouts"],"zh":["设计具有审批门控的多阶段CI/CD流水线","实现安全高效的发布部署策略","配置多环境流水线以简化测试和部署","建立强大的可靠交付的部署最佳实践","实现渐进式交付以控制和分阶段推出"],"ja":["承認ゲートを備えたマルチステージのCI/CDパイプラインを設計する","安全で効率的なリリースデプロイ戦略を実装する","テストとデプロイを簡素化するためのマルチ環境パイプラインを構成する","強固で信頼性の高いデリバリーのためのデプロイベストプラクティスを確立する","コントロールされたフェーズドロールアウトのためにプログレッシブデリバリーを実装する"],"ko":["승인 게이트가 있는 멀티 스테이지 CI/CD 파이프라인을 설계합니다.","보안 및 효율적인 릴리스 배포 전략을 구현합니다.","테스트 및 배포를 간소화하기 위한 멀티 환경 파이프라인을 구성합니다.","강력하고 신뢰할 수 있는 배포를 위한 배포 모범 사례를 수립합니다.","제어되고 점진적인 롤아웃을 위해 점진적 배포를 구현합니다."],"es":["Diseñar tuberías de CI/CD multietapa con puertas de aprobación","Implementar estrategias de implementación para lanzamientos seguros y eficientes","Configurar tuberías multiambiente para pruebas y implementación optimizadas","Establecer las mejores prácticas de implementación para una entrega robusta y confiable","Implementar la entrega progresiva para implementaciones controladas y por fases"],"fr":["Concevoir des pipelines CI/CD mult étapes avec des portes d''approbation","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de déploiement pour des versions sécurisées et efficaces","Configurer des pipelines multi-environnement pour des tests et des déploiements optimisés","Établir les meilleures pratiques de déploiement pour une livraison robuste et fiable","Mettre en œuvre la livraison progressive pour des déploiements contrôlés et par phases"],"de":["Entwerfen von CI/CD-Pipelines mit mehreren Stufen und Genehmigungstoren","Implementierung von Implementierungsstrategien für sichere und effiziente Veröffentlichungen","Konfigurieren von Multi-Umgebungspipelines für optimierte Tests und Implementierung","Festlegen von Implementierungsbest-Practices für eine robuste und zuverlässige Lieferung","Implementierung der progressiven Lieferung für kontrollierte und phasenweise Rollouts"],"pt":["Projetando pipelines de CI/CD em várias etapas com portões de aprovação","Implementando estratégias de implantação para lançamentos seguros e eficientes","Configurando pipelines multi-ambiente para testes e implantação otimizados","Estabelecendo as melhores práticas de implantação para entrega robusta e confiável","Implementando entrega progressiva para rollouts controlados e faseados"],"ru":["Проектирование многоэтапных конвейеров CI/CD с шлюзами утверждения","Реализация стратегий развертки для безопасных и эффективных релизов","Настройка многосредовых конвейеров для оптимизированного тестирования и развертки","Установление лучших практик развертки для надежной и отказоустойчивой доставки","Реализация постепенной доставки для контролируемых и пошаговых роллаутов"],"ar":["تصميم أنابيب CI/CD متعددة المراحل مع بوابات موافقة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات نشر للحصول على إصدارات آمنة وفعالة","تهيئة أنابيب متعددة البيئات لاختبارات ونشر محسّن","إنشاء أفضل الممارسات لنشر لتحقيق تسليم قوي وموثوق","تنفيذ التسليم المتدرج لنشرات خاضعة للرقابة والمرحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of CI/CD architecture and pipeline design principles","May need additional tools or services for implementation, such as Jenkins or GitLab CI/CD"],"zh":["需要了解CI/CD架构和流水线设计原则","可能需要额外的工具或服务来实现，例如Jenkins或GitLab CI/CD"],"ja":["CI/CDアーキテクチャとパイプライン設計の原則を理解する必要がある","実装するために追加のツールまたはサービスを必要とする場合がある、たとえばJenkinsまたはGitLab CI/CD"],"ko":["CI/CD 아키텍처 및 파이프라인 설계 원리를 이해해야 합니다.","구현하기 위해 추가 도구 또는 서비스가 필요할 수 있습니다. 예를 들어 Jenkins 또는 GitLab CI/CD"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura CI/CD y los principios de diseño de tuberías","Puede necesitar herramientas o servicios adicionales para la implementación, como Jenkins o GitLab CI/CD"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture CI/CD et des principes de conception de pipelines","Peut nécessiter des outils ou des services supplémentaires pour la mise en œuvre, tels que Jenkins ou GitLab CI/CD"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der CI/CD-Architektur und der Pipeline-Design-Prinzipien","Benötigt möglicherweise zusätzliche Tools oder Dienste für die Implementierung, wie z.B. Jenkins oder GitLab CI/CD"],"pt":["Requer entendimento da arquitetura CI/CD e dos princípios de projeto de pipeline","Pode precisar de ferramentas ou serviços adicionais para implementação, como Jenkins ou GitLab CI/CD"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры CI/CD и принципов проектирования конвейера","Может потребовать дополнительных инструментов или сервисов для реализации, таких как Jenkins или GitLab CI/CD"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم هندسة CI/CD ومبادئ تصميم الأنابيب","قد يحتاج إلى أدوات أو خدمات إضافية لتنفيذها، مثل جينكينز أو جيت لاب CI/CD"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
