erung und Codegenerierung","Leitfaden für die Implementierung von Datenabfragen","Optimierung von Bundles und Code","Best Practices für React und Next.js"],"pt":["57 regras de otimização","8 categorias de melhorias","Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","Guia para refatoração de código","Melhorias para busca de dados"],"ru":["57 правил оптимизации","8 категорий улучшений","Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","Руководство для рефакторинга кода","Улучшения для поиска данных"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات من التحسينات","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","دليل لإعادة هيكلة الكود","تحسينات للبحث عن البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React最佳实践","React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","应用性能优化","用户体验优化"],"ja":["Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","アプリパフォーマンス最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化"],"ko":["버셀 리액트 최적화","리액트 성능 최적화","넥스트_js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","애플리케이션 성능 최적화","사용자 경험 최적화"],"es":["Vercel","React","Next.js","optimización de rendimiento","refactorización","generación de código","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Vercel","React","Next.js","optimisation des performances","réfacturation","génération de code","meilleures pratiques","développement web","applications web"],"de":["Vercel","React","Next.js","Leistungsoptimierung","Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Vercel React","otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento web","refatoração de código","busca de dados"],"ru":["Vercel React","оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","лучшие практики","веб-разработка","рефакторинг кода","поиск данных"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","إعادة هيكلة الكود","بحث البيانات"]}},"owner":"tearingItUp786","repo":"blog","repoPath":"tearingItUp786/blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications,\nmaintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by\nimpact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications,\nmaintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by\nimpact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:33.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance tuning.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js의 성능 최적화가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan una optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une optimisation des performances de React et Next.js","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte Leistung von React und Next.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуется оптимизация производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を行い、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含みます。","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개의 카테고리에서 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 수행하며, Vercel 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들링 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la creación de paquetes utilizando las directrices de Vercel","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives Vercel","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung genutzt werden, einschließlich der Optimierung der Datenabruf und Bündelung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для комплексной оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования с использованием рекомендаций Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تutomation إعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين أداء شامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized code for data fetching in Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Reviewing code for performance issues and applying best practices"],"zh":["自动化新 React 组件的性能优化","为 Next.js 页面的数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能","审查代码中的性能问题并应用最佳实践"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンス最適化の自動化","Next.js ページのデータ取得のための最適化コード生成","既存の React と Next.js コードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスの向上","コードのパフォーマンス問題のレビューとベストプラクティスの適用"],"ko":["新的 리액트 컴포넌트의 성능 최적화를 자동화","Next.js 페이지의 데이터 가져오기를 위한 최적화 코드 생성","既存의 리액트와 Next.js 코드의 리팩토링을 통한 성능 향상","코드의 성능 문제에 대한 검토 및 최선의 관행 적용"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos en páginas de Next.js","Reorganizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento y aplicar las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données dans les pages Next.js","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Réviser le code pour les problèmes de performances et appliquer les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für den Datenabruf in Next.js-Seiten","Umstrukturieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung","Überprüfen des Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und Anwenden der besten Praktiken"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados em páginas Next.js","Refatorar código existente do React e Next.js para melhor desempenho","Revisar código para problemas de desempenho e aplicar práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для извлечения данных на страницах Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Проверять код на наличие проблем с производительностью и применять лучшие практики"],"ar":["توفير تautomation لتحسين الأداء لمكونات React الجديدة","إنشاء رمز محسّن لاسترجاع البيانات في صفحات Next.js","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","مراجعة الرمز لتحديد مشاكل الأداء وتطبيق أفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to Vercel maintained guidelines","May require additional setup for automated refactoring and code generation"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js","仅限 Vercel 维护的指南","可能需要额外的设置以进行自动重构和代码生成"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel がメンテナンスするガイドラインのみ","自動リファクタリングとコード生成のために追加の設定が必要になる可能性"],"ko":["리액트와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요","Vercel이 유지하는 가이드라인에만 محدود","자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 위해 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a las directrices mantenidas por Vercel","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para la refactorización y generación de código automatizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux directives maintenues par Vercel","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour la refactoring et la génération de code automatisées"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf die von Vercel gepflegten Richtlinien","Kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung für die automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado às diretrizes mantidas pelo Vercel","Pode exigir configuração adicional para refatoração e geração de código automatizadas"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен рекомендациями, поддерживаемыми Vercel","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для автоматизированного рефакторинга и генерации кода"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بال-react و Next.js","محدود بإرشادات Vercel المحفوظة","قد يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا للتعديل والتحويل التلقائي للرمز"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cmnemoi/intrusion/tdd', 'community', 'cmnemoi', 'intrusion', 'cmnemoi/intrusion', 'tdd', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:24:38.193Z', NULL, '{"id":"cmnemoi/intrusion/tdd","name":"tdd","description":{"zh":"TDD是测试驱动开发的简称，通过编写测试来驱动开发过程，确保代码质量和可靠性","ja":"TDDはテスト駆動開発の略称で、テストを書くことで開発プロセスを推進し、コード品質と信頼性を確保する","ko":"TDD는 테스트 주도 개발의 약자로, 테스트를 작성함으로써 개발 프로세스를 주도하고 코드 품질 및 신뢰성을 확보한다","es":"TDD es una metodología de desarrollo de software que se centra en la creación de pruebas automatizadas antes de escribir el código de producción. Aprende a trabajar con TDD","fr":"Le TDD est une méthodologie de développement de logiciels qui se concentre sur la création de tests automatisés avant d''écrire le code de production. Découvrez comment travailler avec le TDD","de":"TDD ist eine Software-Entwicklungs-Methode, die sich auf die Erstellung automatisierter Tests vor dem Schreiben des Produktionscodes konzentriert. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie mit TDD arbeiten","pt":"TDD é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento de software que prioriza a escrita de testes antes do código de produção. Aprenda a trabalhar com TDD.","ru":"TDD - это подход к разработке программного обеспечения, который отдает приоритет написанию тестов перед кодом производства. Узнайте, как работать с TDD.","ar":"TDD هو نهج لتطوير البرمجيات يأتي في مقدمته كتابة الاختبارات قبل كود الإنتاج. تعلم كيفية العمل مع TDD.","en":"A web game about hacking"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TDD 测试驱动开发实践","ja":"TDDテスト駆動開発の実践","ko":"TDD 테스트 주도 개발 실践","es":"TDD: Desarrollo de Software con Pruebas Automatizadas","fr":"TDD: Développement de Logiciels avec Tests Automatisés","de":"TDD: Softwareentwicklung mit automatisierten Tests","pt":"TDD: Desenvolvimento de Software com Testes","ru":"TDD: Разработка программного обеспечения с тестированием","ar":"TDD: تطوير البرمجيات مع الاختبارات",