зависимостей"],"ar":["تحليل التوافق","استراتيجيات التحديث التدريجي","مناهج اختبار شاملة","تأتمة تحديثات الإعتماديات","تخطيط مسارات التحديث المتدرجة","حل النزاعات الإعتماديات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["依赖升级","版本升级","兼容性分析","分阶段升级","测试方法","自动化升级","依赖冲突解决","软件开发","依赖管理"],"ja":["依存関係アップグレード","バージョンアップグレード","互換性分析","ステージアップグレード","テスト方法","自動アップグレード","依存関係の衝突解決","ソフトウェア開発","依存関係管理"],"ko":["의존성 업그레이드","버전 업그레이드","호환성 분석","단계적 업그레이드","테스트 방법","자동 업그레이드","의존성 충돌 해결","소프트웨어 개발","의존성 관리"],"es":["actualización de dependencias","análisis de compatibilidad","estrategias de actualización","testing de dependencias","automatización de actualizaciones","resolución de conflictos de dependencias","versiones de dependencias","seguridad de dependencias"],"fr":["mise à jour des dépendances","analyse de compatibilité","stratégies d''actualisation","testing des dépendances","automatisation des mises à jour","résolution des conflits de dépendances","versions de dépendances","sécurité des dépendances"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsaktualisierung","Kompatibilitätsanalyse","Strategien zur Aktualisierung","Testing von Abhängigkeiten","Automatisierung von Abhängigkeitsaktualisierungen","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten","Abhängigkeitsversionen","Sicherheit von Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["atualização de dependências","análise de compatibilidade","estratégias de atualização","teste de software","automação de atualizações","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","gerenciamento de dependências"],"ru":["обновление зависимостей","анализ совместимости","стратегии обновления","тестирование программного обеспечения","автоматизация обновлений","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","управление зависимостями"],"ar":["ترقية الإعتماديات","تحليل التوافق","استراتيجيات التحديث","اختبار البرمجيات","تأتمة التحديثات","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","إدارة الإعتماديات"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dependency-upgrade","description":"Manage major dependency version upgrades with compatibility analysis, staged rollout, and comprehensive testing. Use when upgrading framework versions, updating major dependencies, or managing breaking changes in libraries.","bodyPreview":"# Dependency Upgrade\n\nMaster major dependency version upgrades, compatibility analysis, staged upgrade strategies, and comprehensive testing approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Upgrading major framework versions\n- Updating security-vulnerable dependencies\n- Modernizing legacy dependencies\n- Resolving dependency conflicts\n- Planning incremental upgrade paths\n- Testing compatibility matrices\n- Automating dependency updates\n\n## Semantic Versioning Review\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH (e.g., 2.3.1)","body":"# Dependency Upgrade\n\nMaster major dependency version upgrades, compatibility analysis, staged upgrade strategies, and comprehensive testing approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Upgrading major framework versions\n- Updating security-vulnerable dependencies\n- Modernizing legacy dependencies\n- Resolving dependency conflicts\n- Planning incremental upgrade paths\n- Testing compatibility matrices\n- Automating dependency updates\n\n## Semantic Versioning Review\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH (e.g., 2.3.1)\n\nMAJOR: Breaking changes\nMINOR: New features, backward compatible\nPATCH: Bug fixes, backward compatible\n\n^2.3.1 = >=2.3.1 <3.0.0 (minor updates)\n~2.3.1 = >=2.3.1 <2.4.0 (patch updates)\n2.3.1 = exact version\n```\n\n## Dependency Analysis\n\n### Audit Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# npm\nnpm outdated\nnpm audit\nnpm audit fix\n\n# yarn\nyarn outdated\nyarn audit\n\n# Check for major updates\nnpx npm-check-updates\nnpx npm-check-updates -u  # Update package.json\n```\n\n### Analyze Dependency Tree\n\n```bash\n# See why a package is installed\nnpm ls package-name\nyarn why package-name\n\n# Find duplicate packages\nnpm dedupe\nyarn dedupe\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnpx madge --image graph.png src/\n```\n\n## Compatibility Matrix\n\n```javascript\n// compatibility-matrix.js\nconst compatibilityMatrix = {\n  react: {\n    \"16.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^16.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^5.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^11.0.0\",\n    },\n    \"17.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^17.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^5.0.0 || ^6.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^12.0.0\",\n    },\n    \"18.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^18.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^6.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^13.0.0\",\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nfunction checkCompatibility(packages) {\n  // Validate package versions against matrix\n}\n```\n\n## Staged Upgrade Strategy\n\n### Phase 1: Planning\n\n```bash\n# 1. Identify current versions\nnpm list --depth=0\n\n# 2. Check for breaking changes\n# Read CHANGELOG.md and MIGRATION.md\n\n# 3. Create upgrade plan\necho \"Upgrade order:\n1. TypeScript\n2. React\n3. React Router\n4. Testing libraries\n5. Build tools\" > UPGRADE_PLAN.md\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Incremental Updates\n\n```bash\n# Don''t upgrade everything at once!\n\n# Step 1: Update TypeScript\nnpm install typescript@latest\n\n# Test\nnpm run test\nnpm run build\n\n# Step 2: Update React (one major version at a time)\nnpm install react@17 react-dom@17\n\n# Test again\nnpm run test\n\n# Step 3: Continue with other packages\nnpm install react-router-dom@6\n\n# And so on...\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Validation\n\n```javascript\n// tests/compatibility.test.js\ndescribe(\"Dependency Compatibility\", () => {\n  it(\"should have compatible React versions\", () => {\n    const reactVersion = require(\"react/package.json\").version;\n    const reactDomVersion = require(\"react-dom/package.json\").version;\n\n    expect(reactVersion).toBe(reactDomVersion);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should not have peer dependency warnings\", () => {\n    // Run npm ls and check for warnings\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Breaking Change Handling\n\n### Identifying Breaking Changes\n\n```bash\n# Use changelog parsers\nnpx changelog-parser react 16.0.0 17.0.0\n\n# Or manually check\ncurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/facebook/react/main/CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n### Codemod for Automated Fixes\n\n```bash\n# React upgrade codemods\nnpx react-codeshift <transform> <path>\n\n# Example: Update lifecycle methods\nnpx react-codeshift \\\n  --parser tsx \\\n  --transform react-codeshift/transforms/rename-unsafe-lifecycles.js \\\n  src/\n```\n\n### Custom Migration Script\n\n```javascript\n// migration-script.js\nconst fs = require(\"fs\");\nconst glob = require(\"glob\");\n\nglob(\"src/**/*.tsx\", (err, files) => {\n  files.forEach((file) => {\n    let content = fs.readFileSync(file, \"utf8\");\n\n    // Replace old API with new API\n    content = content.replace(\n      /componentWillMount/g,\n      \"UNSAFE_componentWillMount\",\n    );\n\n    // Update imports\n    content = content.replace(\n      /import { Component } from ''react''/g,\n      \"import React, { Component } from ''react''\",\n    );\n\n    fs.writeFileSync(file, content);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Unit Tests\n\n```javascript\n// Ensure tests pass before and after upgrade\nnpm run test\n\n// Update test utilities if needed\nnpm install @testing-library/react@latest\n```\n\n### Integration Tests\n\n```javascript\n// tests/integration/app.test.js\ndescribe(\"App Integration\", () => {\n  it(\"should render without crashing\", () => {\n    render(<App />);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should handle navigation\", () => {\n    const { getByText } = render(<App />);\n    fireEvent.click(getByText(\"Navigate\"));\n    expect(screen.getByText(\"New Page\")).toBeInTheDocument();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Visual Regression Tests\n\n```javascript\n// visual-regression.test.js\ndescribe(\"Visual Regression\", () => {\n  it(\"should match snapshot\", () => {\n    const { container } = render(<App />);\n    expect(container.firstChild).toMatchSnapshot();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### E2E Tests\n\n```javascript\n// cypress/e2e/app.cy.js\ndescribe(\"E2E Tests\", () => {\n  it(\"should complete user flow\", () => {\n    cy.visit(\"/\");\n    cy.get(''[data-testid=\"login\"]'').click();\n    cy.get(''input[name=\"email\"]'').type(\"user@example.com\");\n    cy.get(''button[type=\"submit\"]'').click();\n    cy.url().should(\"include\", \"/dashboard\");\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Automated Dependency Updates\n\n### Renovate Configuration\n\n```json\n// renovate.json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"config:base\"],\n  \"packageRules\": [\n    {\n      \"matchUpdateTypes\": [\"minor\", \"patch\"],\n      \"automerge\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"matchUpdateTypes\": [\"major\"],\n      \"automerge\": false,\n      \"labels\": [\"major-update\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"schedule\": [\"before 3am on Monday\"],\n  \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\"\n}\n```\n\n### Dependabot Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/dependabot.yml\nversion: 2\nupdates:\n  - package-ecosystem: \"npm\"\n    directory: \"/\"\n    schedule:\n      interval: \"weekly\"\n    open-pull-requests-limit: 5\n    reviewers:\n      - \"team-leads\"\n    commit-message:\n      prefix: \"chore\"\n      include: \"scope\"\n```\n\n## Rollback Plan\n\n```javascript\n// rollback.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Save current state\ngit stash\ngit checkout -b upgrade-branch\n\n# Attempt upgrade\nnpm install package@latest\n\n# Run tests\nif npm run test; then\n  echo \"Upgrade successful\"\n  git add package.json package-lock.json\n  git commit -m \"chore: upgrade package\"\nelse\n  echo \"Upgrade failed, rolling back\"\n  git checkout main\n  git branch -D upgrade-branch\n  npm install  # Restore from package-lock.json\nfi\n```\n\n## Common Upgrade Patterns\n\n### Lock File Management\n\n```bash\n# npm\nnpm install --package-lock-only  # Update lock file only\nnpm ci  # Clean install from lock file\n\n# yarn\nyarn install --frozen-lockfile  # CI mode\nyarn upgrade-interactive  # Interactive upgrades\n```\n\n### Peer Dependency Resolution\n\n```bash\n# npm 7+: strict peer dependencies\nnpm install --legacy-peer-deps  # Ignore peer deps\n\n# npm 8+: override peer dependencies\nnpm install --force\n```\n\n### Workspace Upgrades\n\n```bash\n# Update all workspace packages\nnpm install --workspaces\n\n# Update specific workspace\nnpm install package@latest --workspace=packages/app\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/semver.md**: Semantic versioning guide\n- **references/compatibility-matrix.md**: Common compatibility issues\n- **references/staged-upgrades.md**: Incremental upgrade strategies\n- **references/testing-strategy.md**: Comprehensive testing approaches\n- **assets/upgrade-checklist.md**: Step-by-step checklist\n- **assets/compatibility-matrix.csv**: Version compatibility table\n- **scripts/audit-dependencies.sh**: Dependency audit script\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Read Changelogs**: Understand what changed\n2. **Upgrade Incrementally**: One major version at a time\n3. **Test Thoroughly**: Unit, integration, E2E tests\n4. **Check Peer Dependencies**: Resolve conflicts early\n5. **Use Lock Files**: Ensure reproducible installs\n6. **Automate Updates**: Use Renovate or Dependabot\n7. **Monitor**: Watch for runtime errors post-upgrade\n8. **Document**: Keep upgrade notes\n\n## Upgrade Checklist\n\n```markdown\nPre-Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Review current dependency versions\n- [ ] Read changelogs for breaking changes\n- [ ] Create feature branch\n- [ ] Backup current state (git tag)\n- [ ] Run full test suite (baseline)\n\nDuring Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Upgrade one dependency at a time\n- [ ] Update peer dependencies\n- [ ] Fix TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Update tests if needed\n- [ ] Run test suite after each upgrade\n- [ ] Check bundle size impact\n\nPost-Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Full regression testing\n- [ ] Performance testing\n- [ ] Update documentation\n- [ ] Deploy to staging\n- [ ] Monitor for errors\n- [ ] Deploy to production\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Upgrading all dependencies at once\n- Not testing after each upgrade\n- Ignoring peer dependency warnings\n- Forgetting to update lock file\n- Not reading breaking change notes\n- Skipping major versions\n- Not having rollback plan\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:23:42.126Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Maintenance Agents needing advanced dependency management capabilities for seamless version upgrades and compatibility analysis.","zh":"适用于需要高级依赖管理能力的维护代理，以实现无缝版本升级和兼容性分析。","ja":"メンテナンスエージェントが高度な依存関係管理機能を必要とする場合に適しています。バージョンのアップグレードと互換性分析をスムーズに行うことができます。","ko":"고급 종속성 관리 기능이 필요한 유지 보수 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 버전 업그레이드 및 호환성 분석을 무중단으로 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Mantenimiento que necesitan capacidades de gestión de dependencias avanzadas para actualizaciones de versión y análisis de compatibilidad sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Maintenance nécessitant des capacités de gestion de dépendances avancées pour des mises à jour de version et des analyses de compatibilité sans heurts.","de":"Perfekt für Wartungsagenten, die erweiterte Abhängigkeitsverwaltungsfunktionen für nahtlose Versionsupgrades und Kompatibilitätsanalysen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de dependências para atualizações de versão sem interrupção e análise de compatibilidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по техническому обслуживанию, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления зависимостями для бесшовных обновлений версий и анализа совместимости.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الصيانة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة التبعيات لتحديثات الإصدارات بدون انقطاع وتحليل التوافق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master major dependency version upgrades, analyze compatibility matrices, and automate staged upgrade strategies using semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for efficient dependency conflict resolution and security-vulnerable dependency updates.","zh":"赋予代理掌握主要依赖版本升级、分析兼容性矩阵和使用语义版本控制（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）自动执行分阶段升级策略的能力，从而实现高效的依赖冲突解决和安全漏洞依赖更新。","ja":"エージェントが主要な依存関係バージョンのアップグレードをマスターし、互換性マトリックスを分析し、セマンティックバージョニング（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）を使用して段階的なアップグレード戦略を自動化することを可能にします。依存関係のコンフリクトを効率的に解決し、セキュリティの脆弱性のある依存関係を更新します。","ko":"에이전트가 주요 종속성 버전 업그레이드를 마스터하고 호환성 매트릭스를 분석하고 의미 체계 버전 관리(MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)를 사용하여 단계적 업그레이드 전략을 자동화 할 수 있도록 합니다. 종속성 충돌을 효율적으로 해결하고 보안 취약성 종속성을 업데이트합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar las actualizaciones principales de versiones de dependencias, analizar matrices de compatibilidad y automatizar estrategias de actualización por etapas utilizando versiones semánticas (MAYOR.MENOR.REVISIÓN) para una resolución eficiente de conflictos de dependencias y actualizaciones de dependencias vulnerables a la seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les mises à jour majeures de versions de dépendances, d''analyser les matrices de compatibilité et d''automatiser les stratégies de mise à jour échelonnée en utilisant la version sémantique (Majeure.Mineure.Correction) pour une résolution efficace des conflits de dépendances et des mises à jour de dépendances vulnérables à la sécurité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wichtige Abhängigkeitsversionsupgrades zu meistern, Kompatibilitätsmatrizen zu analysieren und gestaffelte Upgradestrategien unter Verwendung von semantischer Versionierung (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) für eine effiziente Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten und sicherheitsanfälligen Abhängigkeitsupdates zu automatisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as principais atualizações de versão de dependência, analisar matrizes de compatibilidade e automatizar estratégias de atualização em fases usando versionamento semântico (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) para resolução eficiente de conflitos de dependência e atualizações de dependência vulneráveis à segurança.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить основные обновления версий зависимостей, анализировать матрицы совместимости и автоматизировать поэтапные стратегии обновления с использованием семантического версионирования (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) для эффективного разрешения конфликтов зависимостей и обновления уязвимых зависимостей.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إتقان تحديثات الإصدارات الرئيسية للتبعيات ، وتحليل مصفوفات التوافق ، وتأتمة استراتيجيات التحديث المرحلية باستخدام إصدار معنوي (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) لحل النزاعات التبعية بكفاءة وتحديث التبعيات المعرضة للاختراق الأمني."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading major framework versions with incremental testing approaches","Automating security-vulnerable dependency updates with comprehensive testing","Resolving dependency conflicts using compatibility analysis and staged upgrade strategies"],"zh":["使用增量测试方法升级主要框架版本","使用全面测试自动执行安全漏洞依赖更新","使用兼容性分析和分阶段升级策略解决依赖冲突"],"ja":["インクリメンタルテストアプローチを使用してメジャーフレームワークバージョンをアップグレードする","包括的なテストを使用してセキュリティの脆弱性のある依存関係を自動更新する","互換性分析と段階的なアップグレード戦略を使用して依存関係のコンフリクトを解決する"],"ko":["증분 테스트 접근 방식을 사용하여 주요 프레임워크 버전을 업그레이드하는 것","전체 테스트를 사용하여 보안 취약성 종속성을 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","호환성 분석 및 단계적 업그레이드 전략을 사용하여 종속성 충돌을 해결하는 것"],"es":["Actualización de versiones principales de marcos con enfoques de prueba incrementales","Automatización de actualizaciones de dependencias vulnerables a la seguridad con pruebas exhaustivas","Resolución de conflictos de dependencias mediante análisis de compatibilidad y estrategias de actualización por etapas"],"fr":["Mise à jour des versions principales de frameworks avec des approches de test incrémentales","Automatisation des mises à jour de dépendances vulnérables à la sécurité avec des tests exhaustifs","Résolution des conflits de dépendances en utilisant l''analyse de compatibilité et les stratégies de mise à jour échelonnée"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Hauptframeworkversionen mit inkrementellen Testansätzen","Automatisierung von sicherheitsanfälligen Abhängigkeitsupdates mit umfassenden Tests","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten unter Verwendung von Kompatibilitätsanalysen und gestaffelten Upgradestrategien"],"pt":["Atualizando versões principais de estruturas com abordagens de teste incrementais","Automatizando atualizações de dependências vulneráveis à segurança com testes abrangentes","Resolvendo conflitos de dependência usando análise de compatibilidade e estratégias de atualização em fases"],"ru":["Обновление основных версий фреймворков с инкрементными подходами к тестированию","Автоматизация обновления уязвимых зависимостей с полным тестированием","Разрешение конфликтов зависимостей с помощью анализа совместимости и поэтапных стратегий обновления"],"ar":["تحديث إصدارات الإطار الرئيسية باستخدام مناهج اختبار متزايدة","تأتمة تحديث التبعيات المعرضة للاختراق الأمني مع الاختبارات الشاملة","حل النزاعات التبعية باستخدام تحليل التوافق و استراتيجيات التحديث المرحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to dependency manifests (e.g., package.json, requirements.txt)","Limited to semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) format","May require manual intervention for complex dependency conflicts"],"zh":["需要访问依赖清单（例如package.json、requirements.txt）","仅限语义版本控制（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）格式","复杂依赖冲突可能需要手动干预"],"ja":["依存関係マニフェスト（例：package.json、requirements.txt）へのアクセスが必要","セマンティックバージョニング（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）形式に限定される","複雑な依存関係のコンフリクトには手動での介入が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["종속성 매니페스트(예: package.json, requirements.txt)への 액세스가 필요함","의미 체계 버전 관리(MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) 형식으로 제한됨","복잡한 종속성 충돌의 경우 수동 개입이 필요한 경우가 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a manifiestos de dependencias (por ejemplo, package.json, requirements.txt)","Limitado al formato de versionado semántico (MAYOR.MENOR.REVISIÓN)","Puede requerir intervención manual para conflictos de dependencias complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux manifestes de dépendances (par exemple, package.json, requirements.txt)","Limité au format de version sémantique (Majeure.Mineure.Correction)","Peut nécessiter une intervention manuelle pour les conflits de dépendances complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Abhängigkeitsmanifeste (z. B. package.json, requirements.txt)","Begrenzt auf das Format der semantischen Versionierung (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)","Kann manuelles Eingreifen für komplexe Abhängigkeitskonflikte erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a manifestos de dependência (por exemplo, package.json, requirements.txt)","Limitado ao formato de versionamento semântico (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)","Pode exigir intervenção manual para conflitos de dependência complexos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к манифестам зависимостей (например, package.json, requirements.txt)","Ограничен форматом семантического версионирования (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)","Может потребовать ручного вмешательства для сложных конфликтов зависимостей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مаниفستات التبعية (على سبيل المثال ، package.json ، requirements.txt)","محدود بتنسيق الإصدار المعنوي (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)","يمكن أن يتطلب التدخل اليدوي للنزاعات التبعية المعقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('deadronos/gpu-conway-life/openspec-archive-change', 'community', 'deadronos', 'gpu-conway-life', 'deadronos/gpu-conway-life', 'openspec-archive-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z', '2026-02-19T07:24:27.001Z', NULL, '{"id":"deadronos/gpu-conway-life/openspec-archive-change","name":"openspec-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change技能用于实验工作流中归档完成的更改，提高开发效率。该技能可以根据对话上下文推断更改名称，或者提示用户选择","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキルは、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブして開発効率を向上させる。スキルは、会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測するか、ユーザーに選択を促す","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬은 실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경 사항을 보관하여 개발 효율성을 높입니다. 이 스킬은 대화의 contexto에서 변경 이름을 추론하거나 사용자에게 선택을 요청할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-archive-change te permite archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental.","fr":"La compétence openspec-archive-change vous permet d''archiver les modifications terminées dans le flux de travail expérimental.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change ermöglicht es Ihnen, abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Arbeitsablauf zu archivieren.","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta que arquiva alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental. Ela permite que os desenvolvedores gerenciem alterações de forma eficiente.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change — это инструмент, который архивирует завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе. Он позволяет разработчикам эффективно управлять изменениями.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة تؤرشف التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي. يسمح للمطورين بإدارة التغييرات بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change技能：实验工作流中归档更改","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキル：実験ワークフローで変更をアーカイブする","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬: 실험 워크플로에서 변경 사항을 보관","es":"Archivar cambios en openspec","fr":"Archiver les modifications openspec","de":"Ändern Sie ope