 تخطيط التنفيذ الفني","en":"speckit-plan"},"description":{"zh":"Speckit-Plan是一个创建技术实现计划的技能，用于描述如何构建特性，包括架构、技术选择、数据模型和API契约","ja":"Speckit-Planは、機能を構築する方法を記述した技術実装計画を作成するスキルです。アーキテクチャ、技術選択、データモデル、API契約などを含みます","ko":"Speckit-Plan은 기능을 구축하는 방법을 설명하는 기술 구현 계획을 생성하는 스킬입니다. 아키텍처, 기술 선택, 데이터 모델, API 계약 등을 포함합니다","es":"Speckit-Plan es una habilidad que permite crear planes de implementación técnica detallados para proyectos de desarrollo de software.","fr":"Speckit-Plan est une compétence qui permet de créer des plans de mise en œuvre technique détaillés pour les projets de développement de logiciels.","de":"Speckit-Plan ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung detaillierter technischer Implementierungspläne für Software-Entwicklungsprojekte ermöglicht.","pt":"Speckit-Plan é uma ferramenta para criar planos de implementação técnicos que descrevem como construir recursos com base em especificações.","ru":"Speckit-Plan — это инструмент для создания технических планов реализации, которые описывают, как построить функции на основе спецификаций.","ar":"Speckit-Plan هو أداة لإنشاء خطط تنفيذ تقنية تصف كيفية بناء الميزات بناءً على المواصفات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["加载规范和项目上下文","研究技术方法和最佳实践","创建技术实现计划","包括架构、技术选择、数据模型和API契约","支持项目构建和开发"],"ja":["仕様とプロジェクトコンテキストをロード","技術アプローチとベストプラクティスを研究","技術実装計画を作成","アーキテクチャ、技術選択、データモデル、API契約を含む","プロジェクト構築と開発をサポート"],"ko":["규격과 프로젝트 컨텍스트 로딩","기술 접근 방식과 최고 실践 연구","기술 구현 계획 생성","아키텍처, 기술 선택, 데이터 모델, API 계약 포함","프로젝트 구축 및 개발 지원"],"es":["Carga de especificaciones y contexto de proyecto","Investigación de enfoques técnicos y mejores prácticas","Descripción de la arquitectura y tecnologías","Definición de modelos de datos y contratos de API","Creación de un plan de implementación técnica detallado"],"fr":["Chargement des spécifications et du contexte du projet","Recherche d''approches techniques et de meilleures pratiques","Description de l''architecture et des technologies","Définition des modèles de données et des contrats d''API","Création d''un plan de mise en œuvre technique détaillé"],"de":["Laden von Spezifikationen und Projekt-Kontext","Recherche von technischen Ansätzen und Best Practices","Beschreibung der Architektur und Technologien","Definition von Datenmodellen und API-Verträgen","Erstellung eines detaillierten technischen Implementierungsplans"],"pt":["Criação de planos de implementação técnicos","Análise de abordagens técnicas e melhores práticas","Definição de arquitetura e tecnologias","Desenvolvimento de modelos de dados e contratos de API"],"ru":["Создание технических планов реализации","Анализ технических подходов и лучших практик","Определение архитектуры и технологий","Разработка моделей данных и контрактов API"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط تنفيذ تقنية","تحليل النهج الفنية وأفضل الممارسات","تحديد الهندسة المعمارية والتكنولوجيا","تطوير نماذج البيانات وعهود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术实现规划","Speckit-Plan","构建特性","架构","技术选择","数据模型","API契约","项目构建","开发"],"ja":["技術実装計画","Speckit-Plan","機能構築","アーキテクチャ","技術選択","データモデル","API契約","プロジェクト構築","開発"],"ko":["기술 구현 계획","Speckit-Plan","기능 구축","아키텍처","기술 선택","데이터 모델","API 계약","프로젝트 구축","개발"],"es":["planificación de implementación técnica","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de software","tecnologías de desarrollo","modelos de datos","contratos de API","mejores prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["planification de mise en œuvre technique","développement de logiciels","architecture de logiciels","technologies de développement","modèles de données","contrats d''API","meilleures pratiques de développement"],"de":["technische Implementierungsplanung","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Architektur","Entwicklungstechnologien","Datenmodelle","API-Verträge","Best Practices für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["planejamento de implementação técnica","desenvolvimento de software","arquitetura de software","tecnologias de desenvolvimento","modelos de dados","contratos de API"],"ru":["планирование технической реализации","разработка программного обеспечения","архитектура программного обеспечения","технологии разработки","модели данных","контракты API"],"ar":["تخطيط التنفيذ الفني","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا التطوير","نماذج البيانات","عهود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"KyteApp","repo":"growth-agents-and-skills","repoPath":"KyteApp/growth-agents-and-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"speckit-plan","description":"Execute implementation planning workflow using the plan template to generate design artifacts","bodyPreview":"# Speckit-Plan: Technical Implementation Planning\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate technical implementation plan that describes **HOW** to build the feature defined in the specification, including architecture, technology choices, data models, and API contracts.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Completed specification (`spec.md` exists)\n- Project constitution loaded (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Loads specification and project context\n2. Researches technical approaches and best practic","body":"# Speckit-Plan: Technical Implementation Planning\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate technical implementation plan that describes **HOW** to build the feature defined in the specification, including architecture, technology choices, data models, and API contracts.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Completed specification (`spec.md` exists)\n- Project constitution loaded (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Loads specification and project context\n2. Researches technical approaches and best practices\n3. Designs system architecture and technology stack\n4. Creates data models and API contracts\n5. Documents technology choices with rationale\n6. Generates integration scenarios (quickstart)\n7. Updates agent context with new technologies\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### Specification is Immutable\n- Don''t change WHAT while designing HOW\n- Technical decisions must serve specification requirements\n- If spec gaps found, note them but don''t modify spec\n\n### Constitution Authority\n- Project constitution principles are non-negotiable\n- Validate all choices against constitution\n- Document compliance in Constitution Check section\n\n### Design Before Tasks\n- Complete all design artifacts before task generation\n- Data models, contracts, and research must be finished\n- Provides foundation for accurate task breakdown\n\n## Template Location\n\n**IMPORTANT:** The plan template is located at:\n`.github/skills/speckit-plan/plan-template.md`\n\nThis template MUST be loaded and used as the base structure for all technical planning.\n\n## Execution Flow\n\nAll execution logic is now contained within this skill. The skill handles:\n- Setup script execution\n- Context loading\n- Planning workflow execution\n- Artifact generation\n\n### Quick Summary\n\n1. **Setup:** Run `setup-plan.sh` to get feature paths\n2. **Load template** from `.github/skills/speckit-plan/plan-template.md`\n3. **Load context:** Read spec.md and constitution.md\n4. **Execute planning workflow:**\n   - **Phase 0: Research & Outline**\n     - Identify unknowns and research needs\n     - Dispatch research agents for each unknown\n     - Consolidate findings in `research.md`\n   - **Phase 1: Design & Contracts**\n     - Extract entities → `data-model.md`\n     - Generate API contracts → `contracts/`\n     - Create integration scenarios → `quickstart.md`\n     - Update agent context (copilot-specific files)\n5. **Constitution check:** Validate design against principles\n6. **Report completion:** List all generated artifacts\n\n## Phase 0: Research & Outline\n\n**Goal:** Resolve all technical unknowns before design\n\n### What Happens\n\n1. **Extract unknowns** from Technical Context:\n   - For each NEEDS CLARIFICATION → research task\n   - For each dependency → best practices task\n   - For each integration → patterns task\n\n2. **Dispatch research agents:**\n   - \"Research {unknown} for {feature context}\"\n   - \"Find best practices for {tech} in {domain}\"\n\n3. **Consolidate findings** in `research.md`:\n   ```markdown\n   ## Decision: [what was chosen]\n   \n   **Rationale:** [why chosen]\n   \n   **Alternatives Considered:**\n   - Option A: [pros/cons]\n   - Option B: [pros/cons]\n   \n   **Selected:** Option A because...\n   ```\n\n**Output:** `research.md` with all unknowns resolved\n\n## Phase 1: Design & Contracts\n\n**Prerequisites:** research.md complete\n\n### What Happens\n\n1. **Data Model** (`data-model.md`):\n   - Extract entities from specification\n   - Define fields, types, relationships\n   - Document validation rules\n   - Describe state transitions\n\n2. **API Contracts** (`contracts/`):\n   - For each user action → endpoint\n   - Use standard REST/GraphQL patterns\n   - Generate OpenAPI or GraphQL schema\n   - Include request/response examples\n\n3. **Quickstart** (`quickstart.md`):\n   - End-to-end integration scenarios\n   - Setup instructions\n   - Sample requests/responses\n   - Common troubleshooting\n\n4. **Agent Context Update:**\n   - Run `update-agent-context.sh copilot`\n   - Add new technologies from plan\n   - Preserve manual additions between markers\n\n**Output:** \n- `data-model.md`\n- `contracts/*.yaml` (OpenAPI/GraphQL)\n- `quickstart.md`\n- Updated agent context files\n\n## Constitution Check\n\nValidate design against project principles:\n\n1. **Load constitution** from `.specify/memory/constitution.md`\n2. **Check each principle:**\n   - Does design violate any MUST rules?\n   - Are SHOULD rules followed or justified?\n3. **Document compliance** in Constitution Check section\n4. **ERROR if violations unjustified**\n\n## Success Indicators\n\nPlan is ready when:\n- ✅ All research decisions documented with rationale\n- ✅ Data model covers all entities from specification\n- ✅ API contracts map to all user actions\n- ✅ Quickstart provides working integration example\n- ✅ Constitution check passes (or violations justified)\n- ✅ Agent context updated with new technologies\n- ✅ No NEEDS CLARIFICATION markers remain\n\n## Output\n\n```\nspecs/N-feature-name/\n├── plan.md                    # Technical implementation plan (HOW)\n├── data-model.md              # Entity definitions and relationships\n├── research.md                # Technical decisions and rationale\n├── quickstart.md              # Integration scenarios\n└── contracts/                 # API specifications\n    ├── openapi.yaml\n    └── schema.graphql\n```\n\n## Next Step\n\nAfter plan is complete:\n- Use `speckit-tasks` to generate task breakdown\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### ❌ Changing Specification During Planning\n**Wrong:** \"Spec says OAuth2, but I''ll use API keys instead\" (changing WHAT)\n**Right:** \"Spec requires OAuth2, planning OAuth2 implementation\" (serving WHAT)\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Constitution\n**Wrong:** Skip constitution check, violate principles\n**Right:** Validate against constitution, justify any exceptions\n\n### ❌ Incomplete Research\n**Wrong:** Jump to design with unresolved unknowns\n**Right:** Research all unknowns first, document decisions\n\n### ❌ Vague Data Models\n**Wrong:** \"User entity has some fields\"\n**Right:** \"User entity: id (UUID), email (string, unique), createdAt (timestamp)\"\n\n### ❌ Missing Contracts\n**Wrong:** \"We''ll figure out API structure during implementation\"\n**Right:** Complete OpenAPI spec with all endpoints, schemas, examples\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **speckit-specify** - Previous step (create specification)\n- **speckit-tasks** - Next step (generate task breakdown)\n- **speckit-checklist** - Generate domain-specific quality checks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:47.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Implementation Agents needing detailed architecture and technology planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要详细架构和技术规划能力的技术实施代理","ja":"技術実装エージェントが詳細なアーキテクチャとテクノロジー計画能力を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"詳細한 아키텍처와 기술 계획 능력이 필요한 기술 구현 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación técnica que necesitan capacidades de planificación de arquitectura y tecnología detalladas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''implémentation technique ayant besoin de capacités de planification d''architecture et de technologie détaillées.","de":"Perfekt für technische Implementierungsagenten, die detaillierte Architektur- und Technologieplanungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implementação Técnica que necessitam de planejamento detalhado de arquitetura e tecnologia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической реализации, которым необходимы подробные планы архитектуры и технологического планирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تنفيذ تقني يحتاج إلى تحديد هيكل تقني وتخطيط تقني مفصلين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive technical implementation plans, including architecture, technology choices, data models, and API contracts, by loading specifications and researching best practices using files like `spec.md` and `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.","zh":"使代理能够创建全面性的技术实施计划，包括架构、技术选择、数据模型和API契约，通过加载规范和研究最佳实践，使用文件如`spec.md`和`.specify/memory/constitution.md`","ja":"エージェントが、`spec.md`や`.specify/memory/constitution.md`などのファイルを使用して、仕様をロードし、ベストプラクティスを研究することで、包括的な技術実装計画、包括アーキテクチャ、テクノロジー選択、データモデル、およびAPI契約を作成できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 `spec.md`와 `.specify/memory/constitution.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 사양을 로드하고 최선의 관행을 연구하여 포괄적인 기술 구현 계획, 아키텍처, 기술 선택, 데이터 모델 및 API 계약을 생성할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear planes de implementación técnica completos, incluyendo arquitectura, opciones tecnológicas, modelos de datos y contratos de API, cargando especificaciones y investigando las mejores prácticas utilizando archivos como `spec.md` y `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''implémentation technique complets, incluant l''architecture, les choix technologiques, les modèles de données et les contrats d''API, en chargeant les spécifications et en recherchant les meilleures pratiques à l''aide de fichiers tels que `spec.md` et `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende technische Implementierungspläne zu erstellen, einschließlich Architektur, Technologieauswahl, Datenmodellen und API-Verträgen, indem sie Spezifikationen laden und unter Verwendung von Dateien wie `spec.md` und `.specify/memory/constitution.md` nach Best Practices recherchieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de implementação técnica abrangentes, incluindo arquitetura, escolhas de tecnologia, modelos de dados e contratos de API, carregando especificações e pesquisando as melhores práticas usando arquivos como `spec.md` e `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные планы технической реализации, включая архитектуру, выбор технологий, модели данных и контракты API, загружая спецификации и изучая лучшие практики с помощью файлов типа `spec.md` и `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء خطط تنفيذ تقني شاملة، بما في ذلك الهيكل والتكنولوجيا واختيار نموذج البيانات وعقود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، عن طريق تحميل المواصفات والبحث عن أفضل الممارسات باستخدام الملفات مثل `spec.md` و `.specify/memory/constitution.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating technical implementation plans from specifications","Researching technical approaches for feature development","Creating detailed architecture and technology roadmaps"],"zh":["根据规范生成技术实施计划","研究功能开发的技术方法","创建详细的架构和技术路线图"],"ja":["仕様から技術実装計画を生成する","機能開発の技術アプローチを研究する","詳細なアーキテクチャとテクノロジーロードマップを作成する"],"ko":["사양에서 기술 구현 계획을 생성","기능 개발을 위한 기술 접근법을 연구","詳細한 아키텍처와 기술 로드맵을 생성"],"es":["Generación de planes de implementación técnica a partir de especificaciones","Investigación de enfoques técnicos para el desarrollo de funciones","Creación de mapas de arquitectura y tecnología detallados"],"fr":["Génération de plans d''implémentation technique à partir de spécifications","Recherche d''approches techniques pour le développement de fonctionnalités","Création de cartes d''architecture et de technologie détaillées"],"de":["Erstellung von technischen Implementierungsplänen aus Spezifikationen","Recherche technischer Ansätze für die Funktionsentwicklung","Erstellung detaillierter Architektur- und Technologieroadmaps"],"pt":["Geração de planos de implementação técnica a partir de especificações","Pesquisa de abordagens técnicas para desenvolvimento de recursos","Criação de planos de arquitetura e tecnologia detalhados"],"ru":["Генерация планов технической реализации на основе спецификаций","Исследование технических подходов для разработки функций","Создание подробных планов архитектуры и технологии"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط تنفيذ تقني من المواصفات","البحث في المناهج التقنية لتطوير الميزات","إنشاء خطط هيكلية وتقنية مفصلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires completed specification (`spec.md` exists)","Needs project constitution loaded (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"zh":["需要已完成的规范 (`spec.md` 存在)","需要加载项目宪法 (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"ja":["完了した仕様 (`spec.md` が存在) が必要","プロジェクト憲章 (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`) をロードする必要がある"],"ko":["완료된 사양 (`spec.md`가 존재)가 필요","프로젝트 헌장 (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)을 로드해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una especificación completada (`spec.md` existe)","Necesita la constitución del proyecto cargada (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"fr":["Nécessite une spécification complétée (`spec.md` existe)","A besoin de la constitution du projet chargée (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"de":["Benötigt eine abgeschlossene Spezifikation (`spec.md` existiert)","Benötigt die geladene Projektkonstitution (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"pt":["Requer especificação concluída (`spec.md` existe)","Necessita constituição do projeto carregada (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"ru":["Требует завершенной спецификации (`spec.md` существует)","Требует загрузки конституции проекта (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفة مكتملة (`spec.md` موجودة)","يتطلب تحميل دستور المشروع (`.specify/memory/constitution.md`)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
