ativer Leistung","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen mit Widgets","Implementierung von komplexen Animationen und visuellen Effekten","Schnelle Entwicklung von Apps mit Hot-Reload","Erstellung von konsistenten Benutzererfahrungen auf verschiedenen Plattformen"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos móveis com alta performance","Design personalizado com sistema de widgets","Implementação de animações e efeitos visuais complexos","Desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos com recarregamento a quente","Criação de experiência de usuário consistente em várias plataformas"],"ru":["Создание мобильных приложений с высокими показателями производительности","Индивидуальный дизайн с системой виджетов","Реализация сложных анимаций и визуальных эффектов","Быстрая разработка приложений с горячей перезагрузкой","Создание единообразного пользовательского опыта на нескольких платформах"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات نقالة ذات أداء عالي","تصميم مخصص باستخدام نظام الـ widgets","تنفيذ Animations و Effects المرئية المعقدة","تطوير سريع للتطبيقات مع إعادة تحميل ساخنة","إنشاء تجربة مستخدم متسقة على منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter","Dart","Mobile","UI","Hot Reload","Cross-Platform"],"ja":["Flutter","Dart","Mobile","UI","Hot Reload","Cross-Platform"],"ko":["Flutter","Dart","Mobile","UI","Hot Reload","Cross-Platform"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Flutter","Dart","aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","animaciones y efectos visuales","recarga en caliente","experiencias de usuario consistentes"],"fr":["développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter","Dart","applications mobiles hautes performances","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","animations et effets visuels","rechargement à chaud","expériences utilisateur cohérentes"],"de":["Mobile App-Entwicklung","Flutter","Dart","hochleistungsstarke Mobile Apps","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","komplexe Animationen und visuelle Effekte","Hot-Reload","konsistente Benutzererfahrungen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","flutter","dart","aplicativos móveis de alta performance","design personalizado","animações e efeitos visuais","desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos","experiência de usuário consistente"],"ru":["разработка мобильных приложений","flutter","dart","мобильные приложения с высокими показателями производительности","индивидуальный дизайн","анимации и визуальные эффекты","быстрая разработка приложений","единообразный пользовательский опыт"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات النقالة","flutter","dart","تطبيقات نقالة ذات أداء عالي","تصميم مخصص","الanimations و effects المرئية","تطوير سريع للتطبيقات","تجربة مستخدم متسقة"]}},"owner":"ddcq","repo":"personal-oracle","repoPath":"ddcq/personal-oracle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.544Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-development","description":"Build beautiful cross-platform mobile apps with Flutter and Dart. Covers widgets, state management with Provider/BLoC, navigation, API integration, and material design.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n##","body":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **Project Structure & Navigation**\n\n```dart\n// pubspec.yaml\nname: my_flutter_app\nversion: 1.0.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  provider: ^6.0.0\n  http: ^1.1.0\n  go_router: ^12.0.0\n\n// main.dart with GoRouter navigation\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:go_router/go_router.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  runApp(const MyApp());\n}\n\nclass MyApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyApp({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return MaterialApp.router(\n      title: ''Flutter App'',\n      theme: ThemeData(primarySwatch: Colors.blue, useMaterial3: true),\n      routerConfig: _router,\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nfinal GoRouter _router = GoRouter(\n  routes: <RouteBase>[\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const HomeScreen(),\n      routes: [\n        GoRoute(\n          path: ''details/:id'',\n          builder: (context, state) => DetailsScreen(\n            itemId: state.pathParameters[''id'']!\n          ),\n        ),\n      ],\n    ),\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/profile'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const ProfileScreen(),\n    ),\n  ],\n);\n```\n\n### 2. **State Management with Provider**\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:http/http.dart'' as http;\nimport ''dart:convert'';\n\nclass User {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  final String email;\n\n  User({required this.id, required this.name, required this.email});\n\n  factory User.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {\n    return User(\n      id: json[''id''],\n      name: json[''name''],\n      email: json[''email''],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass UserProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  User? _user;\n  bool _isLoading = false;\n  String? _error;\n\n  User? get user => _user;\n  bool get isLoading => _isLoading;\n  String? get error => _error;\n\n  Future<void> fetchUser(String userId) async {\n    _isLoading = true;\n    _error = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/users/$userId''),\n        headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _user = User.fromJson(jsonDecode(response.body));\n      } else {\n        _error = ''Failed to fetch user'';\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      _error = ''Error: ${e.toString()}'';\n    } finally {\n      _isLoading = false;\n      notifyListeners();\n    }\n  }\n\n  void logout() {\n    _user = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemsProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> _items = [];\n\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> get items => _items;\n\n  Future<void> fetchItems() async {\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/items''),\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _items = List<Map<String, dynamic>>.from(\n          jsonDecode(response.body) as List\n        );\n        notifyListeners();\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      print(''Error fetching items: $e'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Screens with Provider Integration**\n\n```dart\nclass HomeScreen extends StatefulWidget {\n  const HomeScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  State<HomeScreen> createState() => _HomeScreenState();\n}\n\nclass _HomeScreenState extends State<HomeScreen> {\n  @override\n  void initState() {\n    super.initState();\n    Future.microtask(() {\n      Provider.of<ItemsProvider>(context, listen: false).fetchItems();\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Home Feed'')),\n      body: Consumer<ItemsProvider>(\n        builder: (context, itemsProvider, child) {\n          if (itemsProvider.items.isEmpty) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No items found''));\n          }\n          return ListView.builder(\n            itemCount: itemsProvider.items.length,\n            itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n              final item = itemsProvider.items[index];\n              return ItemCard(item: item);\n            },\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemCard extends StatelessWidget {\n  final Map<String, dynamic> item;\n\n  const ItemCard({required this.item, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Card(\n      margin: const EdgeInsets.all(8),\n      child: ListTile(\n        title: Text(item[''title''] ?? ''Untitled''),\n        subtitle: Text(item[''description''] ?? ''''),\n        trailing: const Icon(Icons.arrow_forward),\n        onTap: () => context.go(''/details/${item[''id'']}''),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass DetailsScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  final String itemId;\n\n  const DetailsScreen({required this.itemId, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Details'')),\n      body: Center(\n        child: Column(\n          mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,\n          children: [\n            Text(''Item ID: $itemId'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n            const SizedBox(height: 16),\n            ElevatedButton(\n              onPressed: () => context.pop(),\n              child: const Text(''Go Back''),\n            ),\n          ],\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ProfileScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  const ProfileScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Profile'')),\n      body: Consumer<UserProvider>(\n        builder: (context, userProvider, child) {\n          if (userProvider.isLoading) {\n            return const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());\n          }\n          if (userProvider.error != null) {\n            return Center(child: Text(''Error: ${userProvider.error}''));\n          }\n          final user = userProvider.user;\n          if (user == null) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No user data''));\n          }\n          return Padding(\n            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(16),\n            child: Column(\n              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n              children: [\n                Text(''Name: ${user.name}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n                Text(''Email: ${user.email}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 16)),\n                const SizedBox(height: 16),\n                ElevatedButton(\n                  onPressed: () => userProvider.logout(),\n                  child: const Text(''Logout''),\n                ),\n              ],\n            ),\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Use widgets for every UI element\n- Implement proper state management\n- Use const constructors where possible\n- Dispose resources in state lifecycle\n- Test on multiple device sizes\n- Use meaningful widget names\n- Implement error handling\n- Use responsive design patterns\n- Test on both iOS and Android\n- Document custom widgets\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Build entire screens in build() method\n- Use setState for complex state logic\n- Make network calls in build()\n- Ignore platform differences\n- Create overly nested widget trees\n- Hardcode strings\n- Ignore performance warnings\n- Skip testing\n- Forget to handle edge cases\n- Deploy without thorough testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:00.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing high-performance, visually stunning mobile application development with Dart language.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能、视觉效果惊人的跨平台移动应用开发的代理，使用Dart语言。","ja":"高性能で視覚的に美しいモバイルアプリケーション開発を必要とするクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適です。Dart言語を使用します。","ko":"고성능 및 시각적으로惊艳한 모바일 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Dart 언어를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan un desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento y visualmente impresionantes con el lenguaje Dart.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plateforme croisée nécessitant un développement d''applications mobiles haute performance et visuellement époustouflant avec le langage Dart.","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke, visuell atemberaubende mobile Anwendungsentwicklung mit der Dart-Sprache benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cross-Platform que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis de alta performance e visualmente deslumbrantes com a linguagem Dart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, которым необходимы разработка мобильных приложений с высокой производительностью и визуально привлекательным дизайном с использованием языка Dart.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول عبر منصات متعددة الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول عالية الأداء ومتفوقة بصريًا باستخدام لغة دارت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-performance mobile applications using Flutter''s widget composition, state management patterns, and API integration, while leveraging Dart language for native performance on iOS and Android.","zh":"赋予代理创建高性能移动应用的能力，使用Flutter的widget组合、状态管理模式和API集成，同时利用Dart语言在iOS和Android上实现原生性能。","ja":"エージェントがFlutterのウィジェット構成、状態管理パターン、およびAPI統合を使用して高性能のモバイルアプリケーションを作成できるようにし、Dart言語を使用してiOSおよびAndroidでネイティブ性能を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Flutter의 위젯 구성, 상태 관리 패턴 및 API 통합을 사용하여 고성능 모바일 애플리케이션을 만들 수 있도록 하며, Dart 언어를 사용하여 iOS 및 Android에서 네이티브 성능을 달성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento utilizando la composición de widgets de Flutter, patrones de gestión de estado y la integración de API, aprovechando el lenguaje Dart para un rendimiento nativo en iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications mobiles haute performance en utilisant la composition de widgets de Flutter, les modèles de gestion d''état et l''intégration d''API, tout en exploitant le langage Dart pour des performances natives sur iOS et Android.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochleistungsstarke mobile Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie die Widget-Zusammensetzung von Flutter, Muster zur Statusverwaltung und API-Integration verwenden und dabei die Dart-Sprache für native Leistung auf iOS und Android nutzen.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a criar aplicativos móveis de alta performance usando a composição de widgets do Flutter, padrões de gerenciamento de estado e integração de API, aproveitando a linguagem Dart para desempenho nativo no iOS e Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мобильные приложения с высокой производительностью, используя композицию виджетов Flutter, шаблоны управления состоянием и интеграцию API, а также использует язык Dart для обеспечения родной производительности на iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول عالية الأداء باستخدام تركيبة أدوات Flutter ونماذج إدارة الحالة وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، واستغلال لغة دارت لأداء أصلي على نظامي التشغيل آي أو إس وأندرويد."},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance iOS and Android apps with native performance","Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system","Implementing complex animations and visual effects for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["使用原生性能构建高性能的iOS和Android应用","使用Flutter的widget系统设计自定义UI","实现复杂的动画和视觉效果以增强用户体验"],"ja":["ネイティブ性能で高性能のiOSおよびAndroidアプリを構築する","Flutterのウィジェットシステムを使用してカスタムUIを設計する","複雑なアニメーションや視覚効果を実装してユーザー体験を向上させる"],"ko":["네이티브 성능으로 고성능의 iOS 및 Android 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","Flutter의 위젯 시스템을 사용하여 커스텀 UI를 설계하는 것","복잡한 애니메이션 및 시각 효과를 구현하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones iOS y Android de alto rendimiento con rendimiento nativo","Diseñar interfaces de usuario personalizadas con el sistema de widgets de Flutter","Implementar animaciones y efectos visuales complejos para una experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Créer des applications iOS et Android haute performance avec des performances natives","Concevoir des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées avec le système de widgets de Flutter","Mettre en œuvre des animations et des effets visuels complexes pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Erstellen von hochleistungsstarken iOS- und Android-Apps mit nativer Leistung","Entwerfen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen mit dem Widget-System von Flutter","Implementieren komplexer Animationen und visueller Effekte für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Construção de aplicativos iOS e Android de alta performance com desempenho nativo","Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas com o sistema de widgets do Flutter","Implementação de animações complexas e efeitos visuais para uma experiência de usuário aprimorada"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных приложений iOS и Android с родной производительностью","Разработка пользовательских интерфейсов с помощью системы виджетов Flutter","Реализация сложных анимаций и визуальных эффектов для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات آي أو إس وأندرويد عالية الأداء مع أداء أصلي","تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة بنظام أدوات Flutter","تنفيذ الرسوم المتحركة المعقدة والأFFECTS المرئية لتعزيز تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart language expertise","Limited to mobile application development"],"zh":["需要Dart语言的专业知识","仅限移动应用开发"],"ja":["Dart言語の専門知識が必要","モバイルアプリケーション開発に限定される"],"ko":["Dart 언어의 전문 지식이 필요","모바일 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos del lenguaje Dart","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise du langage Dart","Limité au développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Dart-Sprachkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado em linguagem Dart","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует специализированных знаний языка Dart","Ограничен разработкой мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة متخصصة في لغة دارت","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
