nue-change","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-continue-change fortsetzen","pt":"Continue Change com OpenSpec","ru":"Продолжить изменение с OpenSpec","ar":"استمرار التغيير مع OpenSpec","en":"openspec-continue-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术允许开发者继续工作于一个变化，通过创建下一个工件，提高 JUDO Core runtime 的开发效率","ja":"openspec-continue-change の機能は、開発者が変更を続行し、次のアーティファクトを作成することで、JUDO Core runtime の開発を効率化します","ko":"openspec-continue-change는 개발자가 변경을 계속 작업하고 다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 JUDO Core runtime 개발을 효율화하는 기술입니다","es":"El skill openspec-continue-change permite continuar trabajando en cambios creando el siguiente artefacto. Puedes especificar opcionalmente un nombre de cambio.","fr":"Le skill openspec-continue-change permet de poursuivre le travail sur des modifications en créant le prochain artefact. Vous pouvez spécifier optionnellement...","de":"Der Skill openspec-continue-change ermöglicht es, Änderungen fortzusetzen, indem das nächste Artefakt erstellt wird. Sie können optional einen Änderungsnamen...","pt":"O OpenSpec é um runtime do JUDO Core que permite continuar trabalhando em uma alteração, criando o próximo artefato de forma eficiente.","ru":"OpenSpec - это runtime JUDO Core, который позволяет продолжить работу над изменением, создавая следующий артефакт эффективно.","ar":"OpenSpec هو وقت تشغيل JUDO Core يسمح بالاستمرار في العمل على تغيير، وقم بإنشاء الملف القادم بفعالية","en":"JUDO Core runtime"},"definition":{"en":"JUDO Core runtime"},"features":{"zh":["继续工作于一个变化","创建下一个工件","提高 JUDO Core runtime 的开发效率","支持选项输入","自动推断变化名称","用户交互工具"],"ja":["変更を続行する","次のアーティファクトを作成する","JUDO Core runtime の開発を効率化する","オプション入力をサポートする","変更名を自動的に推測する","ユーザーインタラクションツール"],"ko":["변경을 계속 작업한다","다음 아티팩트를 생성한다","JUDO Core runtime 개발을 효율화한다","옵션 입력을 지원한다","변경 이름을 자동으로 추측한다","사용자 상호 작용 도구"],"es":["Creación de artefactos","Selección de cambios","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de comandos openspec","Compatibilidad con JUDO Core"],"fr":["Création d''artefacts","Sélection de modifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de commandes openspec","Compatibilité avec JUDO Core"],"de":["Erstellung von Artefakten","Auswahl von Änderungen","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion","Ausführung von openspec-Befehlen","Kompatibilität mit JUDO Core"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos","Seleção de alterações","Integração com o JUDO Core","Melhoria da produtividade","Suporte à linha de comando"],"ru":["Создание артефактов","Выбор изменений","Интеграция с JUDO Core","Повышение производительности","Поддержка командной строки"],"ar":["إنشاء الملفات","اختيار التغييرات","التكامل مع JUDO Core","تحسين الإنتاجية","دعم سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core runtime","开发效率","变化管理","工件创建","选项输入","自动推断","用户交互"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core runtime","開発効率","変更管理","アーティファクト作成","オプション入力","自動推測","ユーザーインタラクション"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core runtime","개발 효율","변경 관리","아티팩트 생성","옵션 입력","자동 추측","사용자 상호 작용"],"es":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core","desarrollo de software","creación de artefactos","selección de cambios","AskUserQuestion","comandos openspec"],"fr":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core","développement de logiciels","création d''artefacts","sélection de modifications","AskUserQuestion","commandes openspec"],"de":["openspec-continue-change","JUDO Core","Softwareentwicklung","Erstellung von Artefakten","Auswahl von Änderungen","AskUserQuestion","openspec-Befehle"],"pt":["OpenSpec","JUDO Core","runtime","alterações","artefatos","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade"],"ru":["OpenSpec","JUDO Core","runtime","изменения","артефакты","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность"],"ar":["OpenSpec","JUDO Core","وقت تشغيل","التغييرات","الملفات","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"BlackBeltTechnology","repo":"judo-runtime-core","repoPath":"BlackBeltTechnology/judo-runtime-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ---\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ---\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ---\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/*.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal.\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:19.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient change management and artifact creation in JUDO Core runtime environments.","zh":"适用于需要在JUDO Core运行时环境中实现高效变更管理和构件创建的开发代理。","ja":"JUDO Coreランタイム環境で効率的な変更管理とアーティファクトの作成を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"JUDO Core 런타임 환경에서 효율적인 변경 관리 및 아티팩트 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un cambio de gestión eficiente y creación de artefactos en entornos de tiempo de ejecución de JUDO Core.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de changement efficace et une création d''artefacts dans les environnements d''exécution JUDO Core.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssysteme, die eine effiziente Änderungsverwaltung und Artefakt-Erstellung in JUDO Core-Laufzeitumgebungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de alterações eficiente e criação de artefatos em ambientes de tempo de execução JUDO Core.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного управления изменениями и создания артефактов в средах выполнения JUDO Core.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطيين الذين يتطلبون إدارة تغييرات فعالة وخلق محتوى في بيئات تشغيل JUDO Core."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command for retrieving available changes and the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling change name specifications and inference from conversation context.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建下一个构件继续处理更改，利用`openspec list --json`命令检索可用的更改，并使用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择，同时处理更改名称规范和从对话上下文推断。","ja":"エージェントが次のアーティファクトを作成して変更を続行できるようにし、使用可能な変更を取得するために`openspec list --json`コマンドを使用し、ユーザー選択のためにAskUserQuestionツールを使用し、変更名の規範と会話のコンテキストからの推論を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 변경을 계속할 수 있도록 하며, 사용 가능한 변경을检索하기 위한 `openspec list --json` 명령과 사용자 선택을 위한 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하며, 변경 이름 사양 및 대화 상텍스트에서 추론을 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes continuar trabajando en los cambios creando el siguiente artefacto, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar los cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras se manejan las especificaciones de nombres de cambios y la inferencia del contexto de conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les changements en créant le prochain artefact, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` pour récupérer les changements disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant les spécifications de noms de changements et l''inférence du contexte de conversation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, an Änderungen weiterzuarbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, wobei sie den Befehl `openspec list --json` zur Abrufung der verfügbaren Änderungen und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig die Namensspezifikationen der Änderungen und die Inferenz aus dem Konversationskontext verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando nas alterações, criando o próximo artefato, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar as alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, manipulando especificações de nomes de alterações e inferência do contexto da conversa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду `openspec list --json` для получения доступных изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, обрабатывая спецификации имен изменений и вывод из контекста разговора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي، باستخدام الأمر `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة وأداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع معالجة مواصفات أسماء التغييرات والاستدلال من سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing incomplete changes","Creating new artifacts in existing changes","Managing multiple changes through user selection"],"zh":["继续未完成的更改","在现有更改中创建新构件","通过用户选择管理多个更改"],"ja":["未完了の変更の続行","既存の変更で新しいアーティファクトを作成する","ユーザー選択によって複数の変更を管理する"],"ko":["미완성 변경을 계속함","기존 변경에서 새로운 아티팩트를 생성함","사용자 선택을 통해 여러 변경을 관리함"],"es":["Continuar cambios incompletos","Crear nuevos artefactos en cambios existentes","Administrar múltiples cambios a través de la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Continuer les changements incomplets","Créer de nouveaux artefacts dans les changements existants","Gérer plusieurs changements via la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Unvollendete Änderungen fortsetzen","Erstellen neuer Artefakte in bestehenden Änderungen","Mehrere Änderungen über die Benutzerauswahl verwalten"],"pt":["Continuar alterações incompletas","Criar novos artefatos em alterações existentes","Gerenciar várias alterações por meio da seleção do usuário"],"ru":["Продолжение незавершенных изменений","Создание новых артефактов в существующих изменениях","Управление несколькими изменениями через выбор пользователя"],"ar":["استكمال التغييرات غير المكتملة","إنشاء ملفات جديدة في التغييرات الحالية","إدارة التغييرات المتعددة من خلال اختيار المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JUDO Core runtime environment","Needs conversation context for change inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["需要JUDO Core运行时环境","需要对话上下文来进行改变推断","用户选择仅限于前3个更改"],"ja":["JUDO Coreランタイム環境が必要","会話のコンテキストが変更の推論に必要","ユーザー選択は先頭の3つの変更に限定される"],"ko":["JUDO Core 런타임 환경이 필요함","변경 추론을 위해 대화 상텍스트가 필요함","사용자 선택은 상위 3개의 변경으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de tiempo de ejecución de JUDO Core","Necesita contexto de conversación para inferencia de cambios","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution JUDO Core","A besoin d''un contexte de conversation pour l''inférence de changements","Limité aux 3 premiers changements pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt JUDO Core-Laufzeitumgebung","Benötigt Konversationskontext für Änderungsinferenz","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de tempo de execução JUDO Core","Necessita de contexto de conversa para inferência de alterações","Limitado aos 3 principais alterações para seleção do usuário"],"ru":["Требует среды выполнения JUDO Core","Требует контекста разговора для вывода изменений","Ограничен первыми 3 изменениями для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تشغيل JUDO Core","يحتاج إلى سياق محادثة للاستدلال على التغييرات","محدود بالتغييرات الثلاث الأولى لاختيار المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/baoyu-infographic', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'baoyu-infographic', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z', '2026-02-19T07:25:20.089Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/baoyu-infographic","name":"baoyu-infographic","description":{"zh":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","ja":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","ko":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","es":"baoyu-infographic es una herramienta para generar infografías con dos dimensiones: diseño de layout y estilo visual. Combina libremente cualquier layout con cualquier estilo.","fr":"baoyu-infographic est un outil pour générer des infographies avec deux dimensions : conception de layout et style visuel. Combinez librement n''importe quel layout avec n''importe quel style.","de":"baoyu-infographic ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Infografiken mit zwei Dimensionen: Layout-Design und visuellem Stil. Kombinieren Sie frei beliebige Layouts mit beliebigen Stilen.","pt":"O Baoyu é um gerador de infográficos que permite combinar layouts e estilos para criar visualizações de dados personalizadas.","ru":"Baoyu - генератор инфографики, который позволяет объединять макеты и стили для создания уникальных визуализаций данных.","ar":"بَاويُ هُوَ مُولِد إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك يسمح بِتَخْليط طُرق العرض وَالتصميم لِخَلق عَرَضات بِانات مُخصصة","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"baoyu-infographic: ","ja":"baoyu-infographic: ","ko":"baoyu-infographic: ","es":"Generador de Infografías baoyu-infographic","fr":"Générateur d''Infographies baoyu-infographic","de":"Infografik-Generator baoyu-infographic","pt":"Gerador de Infográficos Baoyu","ru":"Генератор Инфографики Baoyu","ar":"مُولِد إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك بَاويُ","en":"baoyu-infographic"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","ja":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","ko":"baoyu-infographic, layout style","es":"baoyu-infographic es una herramienta para generar infografías con dos dimensiones: diseño de layout y estilo visual. Combina libremente cualquier layout con ...","fr":"baoyu-infographic est un outil pour générer des infographies avec deux dimensions : conception de layout et style visuel. Combinez librement n''importe quel l...","de":"baoyu-infographic ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Infografiken mit zwei Dimensionen: Layout-Design und visuellem Stil. Kombinieren Sie frei beliebige Layouts ...","pt":"O Baoyu é um gerador de infográficos que permite combinar layouts e estilos para criar visualizações de dados personalizadas.","ru":"Baoyu - генератор инфографики, который позволяет объединять макеты и стили для создания уникальных визуализаций данных.","ar":"بَاويُ هُوَ مُولِد إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك يسمح بِتَخْليط طُرق العرض وَالتصميم لِخَلق عَرَضات بِانات مُخصصة","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["20","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers","portrait","lang","AesopIDE Antigravity"],"ja":["20","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers","portrait","lang","AesopIDE Antigravity"],"ko":["20","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers","portrait","lang","AesopIDE Antigravity"],"es":["Generación de infografías con diseños de layout personalizados","Estilos visuales personalizables","Compatibilidad con 20 opciones de diseño de layout","Compatibilidad con varios idiomas","Opción de cambiar el aspecto de la infografía"],"fr":["Génération d''infographies avec des conceptions de layout personnalisées","Styles visuels personnalisables","Compatibilité avec 20 options de conception de layout","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Option de changer l''aspect de l''infographie"],"de":["Erstellung von Infografiken mit benutzerdefinierten Layout-Designs","Benutzerdefinierbare visuelle Stile","Kompatibilität mit 20 Layout-Design-Optionen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachen","Option zum Ändern des Aspekts der Infografik"],"pt":["Combinação de layouts e estilos","20 opções de layout","Geração de infográficos personalizados","Suporte a vários idiomas","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Объединение макетов и стилей","20 вариантов макета","Генерация инфографики на заказ","Поддержка нескольких языков","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс"],"ar":["تَخْليط طُرق العرض وَالتصميم","20 خيار لطريقة العرض","توليد إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك مُخصص","دَعْم اللغات المُتَعَدِّدَة","وِجْهة مُشَغِّل بَسيطة وَصَرفيَّة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-infographic","AesopIDE","Antigravity","infographic","layout","style","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers"],"ja":["baoyu-infographic","AesopIDE","Antigravity","infographic","layout","style","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers"],"ko":["baoyu-infographic","AesopIDE","Antigravity","infographic","layout","style","technical-schematic","hierarchical-layers"],"es":["generador de infografías","herramienta de infografías","diseño de layout","estilo visual","visualización de datos","infografías personalizadas","baoyu-infographic"],"fr":["générateur d''infographies","outils d''infographies","conception de layout","style visuel","visualisation de données","infographies personnalisées","baoyu-infographic"],"de":["Infografik-Generator","Infografik-Tool","Layout-Design","visueller Stil","Datenvisualisierung","benutzerdefinierte Infografiken","baoyu-infographic"],"pt":["gerador de infográficos","criação de infográficos","visualização de dados","layout de infográficos","estilo de infográficos","ferramentas de design"],"ru":["генератор инфографики","создание инфографики","визуализация данных","макет инфографики","стиль инфографики","инструменты дизайна"],"ar":["مُولِد إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك","خَلق إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك","عَرَضات بِانات","طريقة عرض إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك","تَصَميم إِنْفُوجِرَافِيْك","أَدَوات دِيزَين"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-infographic","description":"Generates professional infographics with 20 layout types and 17 visual styles. Analyzes content, recommends layout×style combinations, and generates publication-ready infographics. Use when user asks to create infographic, 信息图, visual summary, or 可视化.","bodyPreview":"# Infographic Generator\n\nTwo dimensions: **layout** (information structure) × **style** (visual aesthetics). Freely combine any layout with any style.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md --layout hierarchical-layers --style technical-schematic\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md --aspect portrait --lang zh\n/baoyu-infographic  # then paste content\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Values |\n|--------|--------|\n| `--layout` | 20 options (see La","body":"# Infographic Generator\n\nTwo dimensions: **layout** (information structure) × **style** (visual aesthetics). Freely combine any layout with any style.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md --layout hierarchical-layers --style technical-schematic\n/baoyu-infographic path/to/content.md --aspect portrait --lang zh\n/baoyu-infographic  # then paste content\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Values |\n|--------|--------|\n| `--layout` | 20 options (see Layout Gallery), default: bento-grid |\n| `--style` | 17 options (see Style Gallery), default: craft-handmade |\n| `--aspect` | landscape (16:9), portrait (9:16), square (1:1) |\n| `--lang` | en, zh, ja, etc. |\n\n## Layout Gallery\n\n| Layout | Best For |\n|--------|----------|\n| `linear-progression` | Timelines, processes, tutorials |\n| `binary-comparison` | A vs B, before-after, pros-cons |\n| `comparison-matrix` | Multi-factor comparisons |\n| `hierarchical-layers` | Pyramids, priority levels |\n| `tree-branching` | Categories, taxonomies |\n| `hub-spoke` | Central concept with related items |\n| `structural-breakdown` | Exploded views, cross-sections |\n| `bento-grid` | Multiple topics, overview (default) |\n| `iceberg` | Surface vs hidden aspects |\n| `bridge` | Problem-solution |\n| `funnel` | Conversion, filtering |\n| `isometric-map` | Spatial relationships |\n| `dashboard` | Metrics, KPIs |\n| `periodic-table` | Categorized collections |\n| `comic-strip` | Narratives, sequences |\n| `story-mountain` | Plot structure, tension arcs |\n| `jigsaw` | Interconnected parts |\n| `venn-diagram` | Overlapping concepts |\n| `winding-roadmap` | Journey, milestones |\n| `circular-flow` | Cycles, recurring processes |\n\nFull definitions: `references/layouts/<layout>.md`\n\n## Style Gallery\n\n| Style | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `craft-handmade` | Hand-drawn, paper craft (default) |\n| `claymation` | 3D clay figures, stop-motion |\n| `kawaii` | Japanese cute, pastels |\n| `storybook-watercolor` | Soft painted, whimsical |\n| `chalkboard` | Chalk on black board |\n| `cyberpunk-neon` | Neon glow, futuristic |\n| `bold-graphic` | Comic style, halftone |\n| `aged-academia` | Vintage science, sepia |\n| `corporate-memphis` | Flat vector, vibrant |\n| `technical-schematic` | Blueprint, engineering |\n| `origami` | Folded paper, geometric |\n| `pixel-art` | Retro 8-bit |\n| `ui-wireframe` | Grayscale interface mockup |\n| `subway-map` | Transit diagram |\n| `ikea-manual` | Minimal line art |\n| `knolling` | Organized flat-lay |\n| `lego-brick` | Toy brick construction |\n\nFull definitions: `references/styles/<style>.md`\n\n## Recommended Combinations\n\n| Content Type | Layout + Style |\n|--------------|----------------|\n| Timeline/History | `linear-progression` + `craft-handmade` |\n| Step-by-step | `linear-progression` + `ikea-manual` |\n| A vs B | `binary-comparison` + `corporate-memphis` |\n| Hierarchy | `hierarchical-layers` + `craft-handmade` |\n| Overlap | `venn-diagram` + `craft-handmade` |\n| Conversion | `funnel` + `corporate-memphis` |\n| Cycles | `circular-flow` + `craft-handmade` |\n| Technical | `structural-breakdown` + `technical-schematic` |\n| Metrics | `dashboard` + `corporate-memphis` |\n| Educational | `bento-grid` + `chalkboard` |\n| Journey | `winding-roadmap` + `storybook-watercolor` |\n| Categories | `periodic-table` + `bold-graphic` |\n\nDefault: `bento-grid` + `craft-handmade`\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\ninfographic/{topic-slug}/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}\n├── analysis.md\n├── structured-content.md\n├── prompts/infographic.md\n└── infographic.png\n```\n\nSlug: 2-4 words kebab-case from topic. Conflict: append `-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Preserve all source data **verbatim**—no summarization or rephrasing\n- Define learning objectives before structuring content\n- Structure for visual communication (headlines, labels, visual elements)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Setup & Analyze\n\n**1.1 Load Preferences (EXTEND.md)**\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-infographic/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-infographic/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                        Path                        │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-infographic/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-infographic/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, display summary                                              │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Ask user with AskUserQuestion (see references/config/first-time-setup.md) │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Preferred layout/style | Default aspect ratio | Custom style definitions | Language preference\n\nSchema: `references/config/preferences-schema.md`\n\n**1.2 Analyze Content → `analysis.md`**\n\n1. Save source content (file path or paste → `source.md`)\n2. Analyze: topic, data type, complexity, tone, audience\n3. Detect source language and user language\n4. Extract design instructions from user input\n5. Save analysis\n\nSee `references/analysis-framework.md` for detailed format.\n\n### Step 2: Generate Structured Content → `structured-content.md`\n\nTransform content into infographic structure:\n1. Title and learning objectives\n2. Sections with: key concept, content (verbatim), visual element, text labels\n3. Data points (all statistics/quotes copied exactly)\n4. Design instructions from user\n\n**Rules**: Markdown only. No new information. All data verbatim.\n\nSee `references/structured-content-template.md` for detailed format.\n\n### Step 3: Recommend Combinations\n\nRecommend 3-5 layout×style combinations based on:\n- Data structure → matching layout\n- Content tone → matching style\n- Audience expectations\n- User design instructions\n\n### Step 4: Confirm Options\n\nPresent all options in single confirmation:\n1. **Combination** (always): 3+ options with rationale\n2. **Aspect** (always): landscape/portrait/square\n3. **Language** (only if source ≠ user language): which language for text\n\n### Step 5: Generate Prompt → `prompts/infographic.md`\n\nCombine:\n1. Layout definition from `references/layouts/<layout>.md`\n2. Style definition from `references/styles/<style>.md`\n3. Base template from `references/base-prompt.md`\n4. Structured content from Step 2\n5. All text in confirmed language\n\n### Step 6: Generate Image\n\n1. Select available image generation skill (ask user if multiple)\n2. Call with prompt file and output path\n3. On failure, auto-retry once\n\n### Step 7: Output Summary\n\nReport: topic, layout, style, aspect, language, output path, files created.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/analysis-framework.md` - Analysis methodology\n- `references/structured-content-template.md` - Content format\n- `references/base-prompt.md` - Prompt template\n- `references/layouts/<layout>.md` - 20 layout definitions\n- `references/styles/<style>.md` - 17 style definitions\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 1.1** for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:20.089Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Visualization Agents needing advanced infographic generation capabilities with customizable layouts and styles.","zh":"非常适合需要高级信息图表生成能力的数据可视化代理，具有可自定义的布局和样式。","ja":"高度なインフォグラフィック生成機能とカスタマイズ可能なレイアウトおよびスタイルを必要とするデータ可視化エージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 정보 그래픽 생성 기능과 사용자 정의 레이아웃 및 스타일이 필요한 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Visualización de Datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de infografías con diseños y estilos personalizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Visualisation de Données ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération d''infographies avec des dispositions et des styles personnalisables.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Visualisierungs-Agenten, die erweiterte Infografik-Generierungsfunktionen mit anpassbaren Layouts und Stilen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de infográficos com layouts e estilos personalizáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации инфографики с настраиваемыми макетами и стилями.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء الرسومات التوضيحية مع تخطيطات وأساليب قابلة للتعديل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate informative and visually appealing infographics by freely combining 20 different layouts with various styles, supporting multiple languages and aspect ratios, and utilizing Markdown files as input.","zh":"通过自由组合20种不同的布局和各种样式，支持多种语言和宽高比，并利用Markdown文件作为输入，使代理能够生成信息丰富且视觉效果良好的信息图表。","ja":"20種類の異なるレイアウトと様々なスタイルを自由に組み合わせて、複数の言語とアスペクト比をサポートし、Markdownファイルを入力として使用することで、情報豊富で視覚的に優れたインフォグラフィックを生成できるエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"20가지 서로 다른 레이아웃과 다양한 스타일을 자유롭게 결합하여 여러 언어와 가로세로 비율을 지원하고 Markdown 파일을 입력으로 사용함으로써 정보가 풍부하고 시각적으로 우수한 정보 그래픽을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar infografías informativas y visualmente atractivas combinando libremente 20 diseños diferentes con varios estilos, admitiendo múltiples idiomas y relaciones de aspecto, y utilizando archivos Markdown como entrada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des infographies informatives et visuellement attrayantes en combinant librement 20 dispositions différentes avec divers styles, en prenant en charge plusieurs langues et rapports d''aspect, et en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme entrée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, informative und visuell ansprechende Infografiken zu generieren, indem sie 20 verschiedene Layouts mit verschiedenen Stilen frei kombinieren, mehrere Sprachen und Bildschirmformate unterstützen und Markdown-Dateien als Eingabe verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar infográficos informativos e visualmente atraentes, combinando livremente 20 layouts diferentes com vários estilos, suportando múltiplos idiomas e proporções de aspecto, e utilizando arquivos Markdown como entrada.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать информативные и визуально привлекательные инфографики, свободно комбинируя 20 разных макетов с различными стилями, поддерживая несколько языков и соотношения сторон, и используя файлы Markdown в качестве входных данных.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من إنشاء رسومات توضيحية مُثيرة ومرئية جذابة من خلال الجمع بين 20 تخطيطًا مختلفًا مع أساليب متنوعة، ودعم اللغات المتعددة ونسب الجانب، واستخدام ملفات Markdown كمدخلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating infographic creation for data analysis reports","Generating technical schematics with hierarchical layers","Creating multilingual infographics for international audiences"],"zh":["自动创建数据分析报告的信息图表","生成具有分层层次的技术图纸","为国际受众创建多语言信息图表"],"ja":["データ分析レポートのインフォグラフィックを作成自動化する","階層的な層を持つ技術的スキーマを生成する","国際的なオーディエンス向けの多言語インフォグラフィックを作成する"],"ko":["데이터 분석 보고서의 정보 그래픽을 자동 생성하는 것","계층적 계층을 갖는 기술적 도면을 생성하는 것","국제적 대상에게 多言語 정보 그래픽을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de infografías para informes de análisis de datos","Generación de esquemas técnicos con capas jerárquicas","Creación de infografías multilingües para audiencias internacionales"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création d''infographies pour les rapports d''analyse de données","Génération de schémas techniques avec des couches hiérarchiques","Création d''infographies multilingues pour les publics internationaux"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Infografiken für Datenanalyseberichte","Generierung von technischen Schemata mit hierarchischen Schichten","Erstellung von mehrsprachigen Infografiken für internationale Zielgruppen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de infográficos para relatórios de análise de dados","Gerar esquemas técnicos com camadas hierárquicas","Criar infográficos multilíngues para públicos internacionais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание инфографики для отчетов об анализе данных","Генерировать технические схемы с иерархическими слоями","Создавать многоязычную инфографику для международной аудитории"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الرسومات التوضيحية لتقارير تحليل البيانات","إنشاء المخططات الفنية ذات الطبقات المتدرجة","إنشاء رسومات توضيحية متعددة اللغات للجماهير الدولية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires input content in Markdown format","Limited to 20 predefined layout options","Dependent on command-line interface for execution"],"zh":["需要以Markdown格式作为输入内容","仅限20个预定义的布局选项","依赖于命令行接口来执行"],"ja":["入力コンテンツはMarkdown形式でなければならない","20個の事前に定義されたレイアウトオプションに限定される","実行にはコマンドラインインターフェースに依存する"],"ko":["입력 내용은 Markdown 형식이어야 함","20개의 사전 정의된 레이아웃 옵션으로 제한됨","실행에는 명령줄 인터페이스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere contenido de entrada en formato Markdown","Limitado a 20 opciones de diseño preestablecidas","Dependiente de la interfaz de línea de comandos para la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite un contenu d''entrée au format Markdown","Limité à 20 options de disposition prédéfinies","Dépend de l''interface de ligne de commande pour l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt Eingabehalt in Markdown-Format","Begrenzt auf 20 voreingestellte Layoutoptionen","Abhängig von der Kommandozeilenoberfläche für die Ausführung"],"pt":["Requer conteúdo de entrada no formato Markdown","Limitado a 20 opções de layout predefinidas","Dependente da interface de linha de comando para execução"],"ru":["Требует входного контента в формате Markdown","Ограничен 20 предопределенными вариантами макета","Зависит от командной строки для выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب محتوى إدخال بتنسيق Markdown","محدود بخيارات التخطيط المحددة مسبقًا 20","يعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sayuprc/isekai-terrarium-admin-panel/code-reviewer', 'community', 'sayuprc', 'isekai-terrarium-admin-panel', 'sayuprc/isekai-terrarium-admin-panel', 'code-reviewer', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z', '2026-02-19T07:25:24.302Z', NULL, '{"id":"sayuprc/isekai-terrarium-admin-panel/code-reviewer","name":"code-reviewer","description":{"zh":"代码审查工具是一种用于优化代码质量的工具，通过分析代码结构和内容，提供专业的代码审查服务","ja":"コードレビューツールは、コードの構造と内容を分析し、専門的なコードレビューを提供することでコードの品質を最適化するツールです","ko":"코드 리뷰 도구는 코드 구조와 내용을 분석하여 전문적인 코드 리뷰를 제공함으로써 코드 품질을 최적화하는 도구입니다","es":"El proceso de revisión de código es crucial para garantizar la calidad y seguridad de un proyecto. Nuestra guía ofrece una visión general completa del proceso de code review","fr":"Le processus de revue de code est crucial pour garantir la qualité et la sécurité d''un projet. Notre guide offre une vue d''ensemble complète du processus de code review","de":"Der Code-Review-Prozess ist entscheidend, um die Qualität und Sicherheit eines Projekts zu gewährleisten. Unser Leitfaden bietet einen umfassenden Überblick über den Code-Review-Prozess","pt":"O Code Reviewer é uma ferramenta de revisão de código que ajuda os desenvolvedores a melhorar a qualidade do seu código, fornecendo uma análise detalhada e personalizada","ru":"Code Reviewer - это инструмент для проверки кода, который помогает разработчикам улучшить качество своего кода, предоставляя подробный и индивидуальный анализ","ar":"مراجع الشفرة هو أداة مراجعة كود تساعد المطورين على تحسين جودة كودهم، مع تقديم تحليل مفصل ومخصص","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查工具","ja":"コードレビューツール","ko":"코드 리뷰 도구","es":"Revisión de código para desarrolladores","fr":"Code Review pour les développeurs","de":"Code-Review für Entwickler","pt":"Code Reviewer: Otimização de Código para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Code Reviewer: Оптимизация Код для Разработчиков","ar":"مراجع الشفرة: تحسين الشفرة للمانحين","en":"code-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查工具是一种用于优化代码质量的工具，通过分析代码结构和内容，提供专业的代码审查服务","ja":"コードレビューツールは、コードの構造と内容を分析し、専門的なコードレビューを提供することでコードの品質を最適化するツールです","ko":"코드 리뷰 도구는 코드 구조와 내용을 분석하여 전문적인 코드 리뷰를 제공함으로써 코드 품질을 최적화하는 도구입니다","es":"El proceso de revisión de código es crucial para garantizar la calidad y seguridad de un proyecto. Nuestra guía ofrece una visión general completa del proces...","fr":"Le processus de revue de code est crucial pour garantir la qualité et la sécurité d''un projet. Notre guide offre une vue d''ensemble complète du processus de ...","de":"Der Code-Review-Prozess ist entscheidend, um die Qualität und Sicherheit eines Projekts zu gewährleisten. Unser Leitfaden bietet einen umfassenden Überblick ...","pt":"O Code Reviewer é uma ferramenta de revisão de código que ajuda os desenvolvedores a melhorar a qualidade do seu código, fornecendo uma análise detalhada e p...","ru":"Code Reviewer - это инструмент для проверки кода, который помогает разработчикам улучшить качество своего кода, предоставляя подробный и индивидуальный анализ","ar":"مراجع الشفرة هو أداة مراجعة كود تساعد المطورين على تحسين جودة كودهم، مع تقديم تحليل مفصل ومخصص","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码结构分析","代码内容检查","专业的代码审查服务","支持多种编程语言","代码优化建议"],"ja":["コード構造の分析","コード内容のチェック","専門的なコードレビュー","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","コード最適化の提案"],"ko":["코드 구조 분석","코드 내용 검사","전문적인 코드 리뷰","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원","코드 최적화 제안"],"es":["Análisis de contexto","Revisión especializada","Verificación de seguridad","Optimización de rendimiento","Revisión de código frontal y backend"],"fr":["Analyse de contexte","Revues spécialisées","Vérification de sécurité","Optimisation des performances","Revues de code frontal et backend"],"de":["Kontextanalyse","Spezialisierte Überprüfung","Sicherheitsüberprüfung","Leistungsoptimierung","Code-Review für Frontend und Backend"],"pt":["Análise de contexto","Revisão de código personalizada","Suporte a várias linguagens de programação","Integração com o projeto isekai-terrarium","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Анализ контекста","Индивидуальная проверка кода","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Интеграция с проектом isekai-terrarium","Улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["تحليل السياق","مراجعة كود مخصصة","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة","التكامل مع مشروع isekai-terrarium","تحسين جودة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查工具","代码优化","代码检查","代码分析","开发工具","代码质量"],"ja":["コードレビューツール","コード最適化","コードチェック","コード分析","開発ツール","コード品質"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 도구","코드 최적화","코드 검사","코드 분석","개발 도구","코드 품질"],"es":["code review","revisión de código","desarrollo de software","seguridad de código","optimización de rendimiento","análisis de contexto"],"fr":["code review","revue de code","développement de logiciels","sécurité de code","optimisation des performances","analyse de contexte"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Sicherheit","Leistungsoptimierung","Kontextanalyse"],"pt":["code reviewer","revisão de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","isekai-terrarium","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["code reviewer","проверка кода","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","isekai-terrarium","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مراجع الشفرة","مراجعة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","isekai-terrarium","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"sayuprc","repo":"isekai-terrarium-admin-panel","repoPath":"sayuprc/isekai-terrarium-admin-panel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"isekai-terrarium 管理パネルの包括的なコードレビュー。バックエンド（PHP/Laravel）とフロントエンド（Astro/SolidJS/TS）の両方に対して、アーキテクチャ、セキュリティ、パフォーマンス、スタイルのチェックを行います。コードのレビュー依頼、PRの確認、またはプロジェクト標準に対する実装の検証を求められたときにトリガーします。","bodyPreview":"# コードレビュー・スキル\n\nこのスキルは、isekai-terrarium 管理パネルプロジェクトに最適化された包括的なコードレビュープロセスを案内します。\n\n## ワークフロー\n\n### 1. コンテキストの分析\n- 変更の範囲（新機能、バグ修正、リファクタリング）を理解する。\n- 対象ファイルとその役割（バックエンドパッケージ、フロントエンドコンポーネント、API定義）を特定する。\n\n### 2. 専門的なレビューの実行\nレビュー対象のコードに応じて、関連するリファレンスファイルを読み込んでください：\n- **バックエンド (PHP)**: [references/php-review.md](references/php-review.md) を参照\n- **フロントエンド (SolidJS/Astro)**: [references/frontend-review.md](references/frontend-review.md) を参照\n- **全般 (セキュリティ/パフォーマンス)**: [references/general-review.md](references","body":"# コードレビュー・スキル\n\nこのスキルは、isekai-terrarium 管理パネルプロジェクトに最適化された包括的なコードレビュープロセスを案内します。\n\n## ワークフロー\n\n### 1. コンテキストの分析\n- 変更の範囲（新機能、バグ修正、リファクタリング）を理解する。\n- 対象ファイルとその役割（バックエンドパッケージ、フロントエンドコンポーネント、API定義）を特定する。\n\n### 2. 専門的なレビューの実行\nレビュー対象のコードに応じて、関連するリファレンスファイルを読み込んでください：\n- **バックエンド (PHP)**: [references/php-review.md](references/php-review.md) を参照\n- **フロントエンド (SolidJS/Astro)**: [references/frontend-review.md](references/frontend-review.md) を参照\n- **全般 (セキュリティ/パフォーマンス)**: [references/general-review.md](references/general-review.md) を参照\n\n### 3. 構造分析 (ヘキサゴナルアーキテクチャ)\n変更がパッケージベースのヘキサゴナルアーキテクチャに従っているか検証します：\n- Domain レイヤーが Application や Infrastructure レイヤーに依存していないか。\n- Application レイヤーが流れを調整しているが、ドメインロジックを含んでいないか。\n- Infrastructures レイヤーが永続化や外部連携を処理しているか。\n\n### 4. フィードバックの提供\n以下の形式でレビュー結果を提供してください：\n\n#### 概要\nレビュー結果の簡潔な概要（例：「軽微な提案を含む LGTM」または「重大な問題を発見」）。\n\n#### 指摘事項\n各指摘事項をカテゴリ分けします：\n- **[重大]**: セキュリティ脆弱性、重大なバグ、または深刻なアーキテクチャ違反。修正必須。\n- **[警告]**: 潜在的なパフォーマンス問題、テストの不足、または最適でないパターン。対処が推奨される。\n- **[提案]**: 可読性の向上、軽微なスタイル違反、またはより良い代替案。品質向上のための推奨事項。\n\n#### 具体例\n変更を提案する場合は、修正や改善を示す簡潔なコード例を提供してください。\n\n## トリガー\n- 「このコードをレビューして」\n- 「PRの確認をお願いします」\n- 「この実装で大丈夫ですか？」\n- 「プロジェクトのヘキサゴナルアーキテクチャに従っているか確認して」\n- 「[機能名] のコードレビュー」\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:24.302Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring comprehensive code review capabilities for PHP, SolidJS, and Astro projects.","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要对 PHP、SolidJS 和 Astro 项目进行全面代码审查。","ja":"Cursor や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しており、PHP、SolidJS、Astro プロジェクトの包括的なコードレビュー機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 PHP, SolidJS 및 Astro 프로젝트에 대한 포괄적인 코드 리뷰 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que requieren capacidades de revisión de código comprehensivas para proyectos de PHP, SolidJS y Astro.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de révision de code complètes pour les projets PHP, SolidJS et Astro.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die umfassende Code-Review-Fähigkeiten für PHP-, SolidJS- und Astro-Projekte erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring comprehensive code review capabilities for PHP, SolidJS, and Astro projects.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring comprehensive code review capabilities for PHP, SolidJS, and Astro projects.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring comprehensive code review capabilities for PHP, SolidJS, and Astro projects."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough code reviews, analyzing backend PHP code, frontend SolidJS and Astro components, and assessing security and performance using specialized review guidelines from references like php-review.md and frontend-review.md.","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底代码审查的能力，分析后端 PHP 代码、前端 SolidJS 和 Astro 组件，并使用参考文档（如 php-review.md 和 frontend-review.md）中的专用审查指南来评估安全性和性能。","ja":"エージェントに徹底的なコードレビューを実施する能力を与え、バックエンドの PHP コード、フロントエンドの SolidJS と Astro コンポーネントを分析し、php-review.md や frontend-review.md などの参考文献からの特別なレビュー ガイドラインを使用してセキュリティとパフォーマンスを評価します。","ko":"에이전트가 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 백엔드 PHP 코드, 프론트엔드 SolidJS 및 Astro 구성 요소를 분석하고 php-review.md 및 frontend-review.md와 같은 참조 문서의 전문 리뷰 지침을 사용하여 보안 및 성능을 평가합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas, analizando el código PHP de backend, los componentes frontend de SolidJS y Astro, y evaluando la seguridad y el rendimiento utilizando directrices de revisión especializadas de referencias como php-review.md y frontend-review.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des révisions de code approfondies, en analysant le code PHP backend, les composants frontend SolidJS et Astro, et en évaluant la sécurité et les performances à l''aide de lignes directrices de révision spécialisées de références comme php-review.md et frontend-review.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Code-Reviews durchzuführen, indem sie den PHP-Backend-Code, die SolidJS- und Astro-Frontend-Komponenten analysieren und Sicherheit und Leistung unter Verwendung spezieller Review-Richtlinien aus Referenzen wie php-review.md und frontend-review.md bewerten.","pt":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough code reviews, analyzing backend PHP code, frontend SolidJS and Astro components, and assessing security and performance using specialized review guidelines from references like php-review.md and frontend-review.md.","ru":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough code reviews, analyzing backend PHP code, frontend SolidJS and Astro components, and assessing security and performance using specialized review guidelines from references like php-review.md and frontend-review.md.","ar":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough code reviews, analyzing backend PHP code, frontend SolidJS and Astro components, and assessing security and performance using specialized review guidelines from references like php-review.md and frontend-review.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing PHP backend code for security vulnerabilities","Reviewing SolidJS and Astro frontend components for performance optimization","Debugging code changes for new feature implementations or bug fixes"],"zh":["分析 PHP 后端代码中的安全漏洞","审查 SolidJS 和 Astro 前端组件以进行性能优化","调试代码更改以实现新功能或错误修复"],"ja":["セキュリティ脆弱性のあるバックエンド PHP コードを分析する","パフォーマンス最適化のために SolidJS と Astro のフロントエンド コンポーネントをレビューする","新しい機能の実装やバグ修正のためのコード変更をデバッグする"],"ko":["보안 취약점이 있는 백엔드 PHP 코드를 분석합니다.","성능 최적화를 위해 SolidJS 및 Astro 프론트엔드 구성 요소를 검토합니다.","새로운 기능 구현 또는 버그 수정을 위한 코드 변경을 디버깅합니다."],"es":["Analizar el código de backend de PHP en busca de vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Revisar los componentes frontend de SolidJS y Astro para la optimización del rendimiento","Depurar los cambios de código para nuevas implementaciones de funciones o correcciones de errores"],"fr":["Analyser le code backend PHP pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Réviser les composants frontend SolidJS et Astro pour l''optimisation des performances","Déboguer les modifications de code pour les nouvelles mises en œuvre de fonctionnalités ou les corrections de bogues"],"de":["Analyse des PHP-Backend-Codes auf Sicherheitsverletzlichkeiten","Überprüfung der SolidJS- und Astro-Frontend-Komponenten für die Leistungsoptimierung","Fehlersuche bei Codeänderungen für neue Funktionsimplementierungen oder Fehlerbehebungen"],"pt":["Analyzing PHP backend code for security vulnerabilities","Reviewing SolidJS and Astro frontend components for performance optimization","Debugging code changes for new feature implementations or bug fixes"],"ru":["Analyzing PHP backend code for security vulnerabilities","Reviewing SolidJS and Astro frontend components for performance optimization","Debugging code changes for new feature implementations or bug fixes"],"ar":["Analyzing PHP backend code for security vulnerabilities","Reviewing SolidJS and Astro frontend components for performance optimization","Debugging code changes for new feature implementations or bug fixes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific reference files like php-review.md and frontend-review.md","Optimized for isekai-terrarium management panel projects"],"zh":["需要访问特定的参考文件，如 php-review.md 和 frontend-review.md","优化用于 isekai-terrarium 管理面板项目"],"ja":["php-review.md や frontend-review.md などの特定の参考ファイルへのアクセスが必要","isekai-terrarium 管理パネル プロジェクト向けに最適化"],"ko":["php-review.md 및 frontend-review.md와 같은 특정 참조 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","isekai-terrarium 관리 패널 프로젝트에 최적화됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de referencia específicos como php-review.md y frontend-review.md","Optimizado para proyectos de panel de administración de isekai-terrarium"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de référence spécifiques comme php-review.md et frontend-review.md","Optimisé pour les projets de panneau de gestion isekai-terrarium"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf bestimmte Referenzdateien wie php-review.md und frontend-review.md","Optimiert für Isekai-Terrarium-Verwaltungspanel-Projekte"],"pt":["Requires access to specific reference files like php-review.md and frontend-review.md","Optimized for isekai-terrarium management panel projects"],"ru":["Requires access to specific reference files like php-review.md and frontend-review.md","Optimized for isekai-terrarium management panel projects"],"ar":["Requires access to specific reference files like php-review.md and frontend-review.md","Optimized for isekai-terrarium management panel projects"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('haxllo/repolens/Agent Development', 'community', 'haxllo', 'repolens', 'haxllo/repolens', 'Agent Development', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z', '2026-02-19T07:25:28.334Z', NULL, '{"id":"haxllo/repolens/Agent Development","name":"Agent Development","description":{"zh":"代理开发是创建自主处理复杂任务的能力。了解代理结构和系统提示设计是关键","ja":"エージェント開発は、複雑なタスクを自律的に処理する能力を創出すること。エージェント構造とシステムプロンプト設計を理解することが重要","ko":"에이전트 개발은 복잡한 태스크를 자율적으로 처리하는 능력을 만드는 것입니다. 에이전트 구조와 시스템 프롬프트 설계를 이해하는 것이 중요합니다","es":"Los agentes son subprocessos autónomos que manejan tareas complejas de forma independiente, permitiendo crear capacidades autónomas poderosas","fr":"Les agents sont des sous-processus autonomes qui gèrent des tâches complexes de manière indépendante, permettant de créer des capacités autonomes puissantes","de":"Agenten sind autarke Subprozesse, die komplexe Aufgaben unabhängig bearbeiten, um leistungsfähige autarke Fähigkeiten zu ermöglichen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de agentes autônomos para Claude Code, com foco em estrutura, condições de acionamento e design de prompts de sistema.","ru":"Разработка автономных агентов для Claude Code, с фокусом на структуре, условиях срабатывания и дизайне системных подсказок.","ar":"تطوير العوامل المستقلة لبرنامج Claude Code, مع التركيز على البنية وشروط التنشيط وتصميم الإشارات النصية للنظام.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Claude 代码插件代理开发","ja":"Claude コード プラグインエージェント開発","ko":"클로드 코드 플러그인 에이전트 개발","es":"Desarrollo de Agentes para Claude Code Plugins","fr":"Développement d''Agents pour les Plugins Claude Code","de":"Entwicklung von Agenten für Claude Code Plugins","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Agentes para Claude Code","ru":"Разработка агентов для Claude Code","ar":"تطوير العوامل لبرنامج Claude Code","en":"Agent Development"},"description":{"zh":"代理开发是创建自主处理复杂任务的能力。了解代理结构和系统提示设计是关键","ja":"エージェント開発は、複雑なタスクを自律的に処理する能力を創出すること。エージェント構造とシステムプロンプト設計を理解することが重要","ko":"에이전트 개발은 복잡한 태스크를 자율적으로 처리하는 능력을 만드는 것입니다. 에이전트 구조와 시스템 프롬프트 설계를 이해하는 것이 중요합니다","es":"Los agentes son subprocessos autónomos que manejan tareas complejas de forma independiente, permitiendo crear capacidades autónomas poderosas","fr":"Les agents sont des sous-processus autonomes qui gèrent des tâches complexes de manière indépendante, permettant de créer des capacités autonomes puissantes","de":"Agenten sind autarke Subprozesse, die komplexe Aufgaben unabhängig bearbeiten, um leistungsfähige autarke Fähigkeiten zu ermöglichen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de agentes autônomos para Claude Code, com foco em estrutura, condições de acionamento e design de prompts de sistema.","ru":"Разработка автономных агентов для Claude Code, с фокусом на структуре, условиях срабатывания и дизайне системных подсказок.","ar":"تطوير العوامل المستقلة لبرنامج Claude Code, مع التركيز على البنية وشروط التنشيط وتصميم الإشارات النصية للنظام.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自主处理复杂任务","代理结构和系统提示设计","触发条件和描述字段","Markdown 文件格式和 YAML 前置数据","创建强大的自主能力"],"ja":["複雑なタスクを自律的に処理","エージェント構造とシステムプロンプト設計","トリガー条件と説明フィールド","Markdown ファイル形式と YAML フロントマター","強力な自律能力を作成"],"ko":["복잡한 태스크를 자율적으로 처리","에이전트 구조와 시스템 프롬프트 설계","트리거 조건과 설명 필드","Markdown 파일 형식과 YAML 프론트매터","강력한 자율 능력을 만드는 것"],"es":["Estructura de agente","Condiciones de activación","Diseño de promtps de sistema","Formato de archivo Markdown con YAML","Activación a través del campo de descripción con ejemplos"],"fr":["Structure d''agent","Conditions de déclenchement","Conception de promtps de système","Format de fichier Markdown avec YAML","Déclenchement via le champ de description avec exemples"],"de":["Agentenstruktur","Auslösebedingungen","System-Prompt-Design","Markdown-Dateiformat mit YAML","Auslösen über das Beschreibungsfeld mit Beispielen"],"pt":["Estrutura de agentes","Condições de acionamento","Design de prompts de sistema","Arquivos Markdown com frontmatter YAML","Acionamento via campo de descrição com exemplos"],"ru":["Структура агентов","Условия срабатывания","Дизайн системных подсказок","Файлы Markdown с YAML-заголовком","Срабатывание через поле описания с примерами"],"ar":["بنية العوامل","شروط التنشيط","تصميم الإشارات النصية للنظام","ملفات Markdown مع YAML-الرأس","التنشيط عبر حقل الوصف مع الأمثلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代理开发","Claude 代码插件","自主处理","复杂任务","系统提示设计","触发条件","Markdown 文件格式","YAML 前置数据"],"ja":["エージェント開発","Claude コード プラグイン","自律的な処理","複雑なタスク","システムプロンプト設計","トリガー条件","Markdown ファイル形式","YAML フロントマター"],"ko":["에이전트 개발","클로드 코드 플러그인","자율적인 처리","복잡한 태스크","시스템 프롬프트 설계","트리거 조건","Markdown 파일 형식","YAML 프론트매터"],"es":["desarrollo de agentes","Claude Code Plugins","tareas complejas","autonomía","subprocesos","programación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["développement d''agents","plugins Claude Code","tâches complexes","autonomie","sous-processus","programmation","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Agentenentwicklung","Claude Code Plugins","komplexe Aufgaben","Autonomie","Subprozesse","Programmierung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de agentes","claude code","agentes autônomos","estrutura de agentes","condições de acionamento","design de prompts de sistema","arquivos markdown","yaml frontmatter"],"ru":["разработка агентов","claude code","автономные агенты","структура агентов","условия срабатывания","дизайн системных подсказок","файлы markdown","yaml-заголовок"],"ar":["تطوير العوامل","برنامج claude code","العوامل المستقلة","بنية العوامل","شروط التنشيط","تصميم الإشارات النصية للنظام","ملفات markdown","yaml-الرأس"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Agent Development","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create an agent, add an agent, write a subagent, agent frontmatter, when to use description, agent examples, agent tools, agent colors, autonomous agent, or needs guidance on agent structure, system prompts, triggering conditions, or agent development best practices for Claude Code plugins.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Agent Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nAgents are autonomous subprocesses that handle complex, multi-step tasks independently. Understanding agent structure, triggering conditions, and system prompt design enables creating powerful autonomous capabilities.\n\n**Key concepts:**\n- Agents are FOR autonomous work, commands are FOR user-initiated actions\n- Markdown file format with YAML frontmatter\n- Triggering via description field with examples\n- System prompt defines agent behavio","body":"# Agent Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nAgents are autonomous subprocesses that handle complex, multi-step tasks independently. Understanding agent structure, triggering conditions, and system prompt design enables creating powerful autonomous capabilities.\n\n**Key concepts:**\n- Agents are FOR autonomous work, commands are FOR user-initiated actions\n- Markdown file format with YAML frontmatter\n- Triggering via description field with examples\n- System prompt defines agent behavior\n- Model and color customization\n\n## Agent File Structure\n\n### Complete Format\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: agent-identifier\ndescription: Use this agent when [triggering conditions]. Examples:\n\n<example>\nContext: [Situation description]\nuser: \"[User request]\"\nassistant: \"[How assistant should respond and use this agent]\"\n<commentary>\n[Why this agent should be triggered]\n</commentary>\n</example>\n\n<example>\n[Additional example...]\n</example>\n\nmodel: inherit\ncolor: blue\ntools: [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Grep\"]\n---\n\nYou are [agent role description]...\n\n**Your Core Responsibilities:**\n1. [Responsibility 1]\n2. [Responsibility 2]\n\n**Analysis Process:**\n[Step-by-step workflow]\n\n**Output Format:**\n[What to return]\n```\n\n## Frontmatter Fields\n\n### name (required)\n\nAgent identifier used for namespacing and invocation.\n\n**Format:** lowercase, numbers, hyphens only\n**Length:** 3-50 characters\n**Pattern:** Must start and end with alphanumeric\n\n**Good examples:**\n- `code-reviewer`\n- `test-generator`\n- `api-docs-writer`\n- `security-analyzer`\n\n**Bad examples:**\n- `helper` (too generic)\n- `-agent-` (starts/ends with hyphen)\n- `my_agent` (underscores not allowed)\n- `ag` (too short, < 3 chars)\n\n### description (required)\n\nDefines when Claude should trigger this agent. **This is the most critical field.**\n\n**Must include:**\n1. Triggering conditions (\"Use this agent when...\")\n2. Multiple `<example>` blocks showing usage\n3. Context, user request, and assistant response in each example\n4. `<commentary>` explaining why agent triggers\n\n**Format:**\n```\nUse this agent when [conditions]. Examples:\n\n<example>\nContext: [Scenario description]\nuser: \"[What user says]\"\nassistant: \"[How Claude should respond]\"\n<commentary>\n[Why this agent is appropriate]\n</commentary>\n</example>\n\n[More examples...]\n```\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Include 2-4 concrete examples\n- Show proactive and reactive triggering\n- Cover different phrasings of same intent\n- Explain reasoning in commentary\n- Be specific about when NOT to use the agent\n\n### model (required)\n\nWhich model the agent should use.\n\n**Options:**\n- `inherit` - Use same model as parent (recommended)\n- `sonnet` - Claude Sonnet (balanced)\n- `opus` - Claude Opus (most capable, expensive)\n- `haiku` - Claude Haiku (fast, cheap)\n\n**Recommendation:** Use `inherit` unless agent needs specific model capabilities.\n\n### color (required)\n\nVisual identifier for agent in UI.\n\n**Options:** `blue`, `cyan`, `green`, `yellow`, `magenta`, `red`\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Choose distinct colors for different agents in same plugin\n- Use consistent colors for similar agent types\n- Blue/cyan: Analysis, review\n- Green: Success-oriented tasks\n- Yellow: Caution, validation\n- Red: Critical, security\n- Magenta: Creative, generation\n\n### tools (optional)\n\nRestrict agent to specific tools.\n\n**Format:** Array of tool names\n\n```yaml\ntools: [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\"]\n```\n\n**Default:** If omitted, agent has access to all tools\n\n**Best practice:** Limit tools to minimum needed (principle of least privilege)\n\n**Common tool sets:**\n- Read-only analysis: `[\"Read\", \"Grep\", \"Glob\"]`\n- Code generation: `[\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Grep\"]`\n- Testing: `[\"Read\", \"Bash\", \"Grep\"]`\n- Full access: Omit field or use `[\"*\"]`\n\n## System Prompt Design\n\nThe markdown body becomes the agent''s system prompt. Write in second person, addressing the agent directly.\n\n### Structure\n\n**Standard template:**\n```markdown\nYou are [role] specializing in [domain].\n\n**Your Core Responsibilities:**\n1. [Primary responsibility]\n2. [Secondary responsibility]\n3. [Additional responsibilities...]\n\n**Analysis Process:**\n1. [Step one]\n2. [Step two]\n3. [Step three]\n[...]\n\n**Quality Standards:**\n- [Standard 1]\n- [Standard 2]\n\n**Output Format:**\nProvide results in this format:\n- [What to include]\n- [How to structure]\n\n**Edge Cases:**\nHandle these situations:\n- [Edge case 1]: [How to handle]\n- [Edge case 2]: [How to handle]\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n\n✅ **DO:**\n- Write in second person (\"You are...\", \"You will...\")\n- Be specific about responsibilities\n- Provide step-by-step process\n- Define output format\n- Include quality standards\n- Address edge cases\n- Keep under 10,000 characters\n\n❌ **DON''T:**\n- Write in first person (\"I am...\", \"I will...\")\n- Be vague or generic\n- Omit process steps\n- Leave output format undefined\n- Skip quality guidance\n- Ignore error cases\n\n## Creating Agents\n\n### Method 1: AI-Assisted Generation\n\nUse this prompt pattern (extracted from Claude Code):\n\n```\nCreate an agent configuration based on this request: \"[YOUR DESCRIPTION]\"\n\nRequirements:\n1. Extract core intent and responsibilities\n2. Design expert persona for the domain\n3. Create comprehensive system prompt with:\n   - Clear behavioral boundaries\n   - Specific methodologies\n   - Edge case handling\n   - Output format\n4. Create identifier (lowercase, hyphens, 3-50 chars)\n5. Write description with triggering conditions\n6. Include 2-3 <example> blocks showing when to use\n\nReturn JSON with:\n{\n  \"identifier\": \"agent-name\",\n  \"whenToUse\": \"Use this agent when... Examples: <example>...</example>\",\n  \"systemPrompt\": \"You are...\"\n}\n```\n\nThen convert to agent file format with frontmatter.\n\nSee `examples/agent-creation-prompt.md` for complete template.\n\n### Method 2: Manual Creation\n\n1. Choose agent identifier (3-50 chars, lowercase, hyphens)\n2. Write description with examples\n3. Select model (usually `inherit`)\n4. Choose color for visual identification\n5. Define tools (if restricting access)\n6. Write system prompt with structure above\n7. Save as `agents/agent-name.md`\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Identifier Validation\n\n```\n✅ Valid: code-reviewer, test-gen, api-analyzer-v2\n❌ Invalid: ag (too short), -start (starts with hyphen), my_agent (underscore)\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- 3-50 characters\n- Lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens only\n- Must start and end with alphanumeric\n- No underscores, spaces, or special characters\n\n### Description Validation\n\n**Length:** 10-5,000 characters\n**Must include:** Triggering conditions and examples\n**Best:** 200-1,000 characters with 2-4 examples\n\n### System Prompt Validation\n\n**Length:** 20-10,000 characters\n**Best:** 500-3,000 characters\n**Structure:** Clear responsibilities, process, output format\n\n## Agent Organization\n\n### Plugin Agents Directory\n\n```\nplugin-name/\n└── agents/\n    ├── analyzer.md\n    ├── reviewer.md\n    └── generator.md\n```\n\nAll `.md` files in `agents/` are auto-discovered.\n\n### Namespacing\n\nAgents are namespaced automatically:\n- Single plugin: `agent-name`\n- With subdirectories: `plugin:subdir:agent-name`\n\n## Testing Agents\n\n### Test Triggering\n\nCreate test scenarios to verify agent triggers correctly:\n\n1. Write agent with specific triggering examples\n2. Use similar phrasing to examples in test\n3. Check Claude loads the agent\n4. Verify agent provides expected functionality\n\n### Test System Prompt\n\nEnsure system prompt is complete:\n\n1. Give agent typical task\n2. Check it follows process steps\n3. Verify output format is correct\n4. Test edge cases mentioned in prompt\n5. Confirm quality standards are met\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Minimal Agent\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: simple-agent\ndescription: Use this agent when... Examples: <example>...</example>\nmodel: inherit\ncolor: blue\n---\n\nYou are an agent that [does X].\n\nProcess:\n1. [Step 1]\n2. [Step 2]\n\nOutput: [What to provide]\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields Summary\n\n| Field | Required | Format | Example |\n|-------|----------|--------|---------|\n| name | Yes | lowercase-hyphens | code-reviewer |\n| description | Yes | Text + examples | Use when... <example>... |\n| model | Yes | inherit/sonnet/opus/haiku | inherit |\n| color | Yes | Color name | blue |\n| tools | No | Array of tool names | [\"Read\", \"Grep\"] |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n**DO:**\n- ✅ Include 2-4 concrete examples in description\n- ✅ Write specific triggering conditions\n- ✅ Use `inherit` for model unless specific need\n- ✅ Choose appropriate tools (least privilege)\n- ✅ Write clear, structured system prompts\n- ✅ Test agent triggering thoroughly\n\n**DON''T:**\n- ❌ Use generic descriptions without examples\n- ❌ Omit triggering conditions\n- ❌ Give all agents same color\n- ❌ Grant unnecessary tool access\n- ❌ Write vague system prompts\n- ❌ Skip testing\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\nFor detailed guidance, consult:\n\n- **`references/system-prompt-design.md`** - Complete system prompt patterns\n- **`references/triggering-examples.md`** - Example formats and best practices\n- **`references/agent-creation-system-prompt.md`** - The exact prompt from Claude Code\n\n### Example Files\n\nWorking examples in `examples/`:\n\n- **`agent-creation-prompt.md`** - AI-assisted agent generation template\n- **`complete-agent-examples.md`** - Full agent examples for different use cases\n\n### Utility Scripts\n\nDevelopment tools in `scripts/`:\n\n- **`validate-agent.sh`** - Validate agent file structure\n- **`test-agent-trigger.sh`** - Test if agent triggers correctly\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nTo create an agent for a plugin:\n\n1. Define agent purpose and triggering conditions\n2. Choose creation method (AI-assisted or manual)\n3. Create `agents/agent-name.md` file\n4. Write frontmatter with all required fields\n5. Write system prompt following best practices\n6. Include 2-4 triggering examples in description\n7. Validate with `scripts/validate-agent.sh`\n8. Test triggering with real scenarios\n9. Document agent in plugin README\n\nFocus on clear triggering conditions and comprehensive system prompts for autonomous operation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:28.334Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的自治代理，需要高级代理开发功能来实现复杂任务自动化","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの高度なエージェント開発機能を必要とする自律エージェントに最適","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 고급 에이전트 개발 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","fr":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","de":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","pt":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","ru":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation","ar":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced agent development capabilities for complex task automation"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create autonomous subprocesses using Markdown files with YAML frontmatter, triggering conditions, and system prompt design, enabling powerful capabilities like multi-step task handling and customized agent behavior via description fields and examples","zh":"使得代理能够使用带有 YAML 前置内容的 Markdown 文件、触发条件和系统提示设计来创建自治子过程，从而实现像多步骤任务处理和通过描述字段和示例自定义代理行为等强大的功能","ja":"マークダウンファイル、トリガー条件、システムプロンプトデザインを使用して自律サブプロセスを作成し、多段階のタスク処理や説明フィールドと例を使用したエージェントの動作のカスタマイズなどの強力な機能を可能にする","ko":" YAML 전면 물질을 포함한 마크다운 파일, 트리거 조건 및 시스템 프롬프트 디자인을 사용하여 자율적 子 프로세스를 생성하여 다단계 작업 처리 및 설명 필드 및 예제를 통한 에이전트 동작의 사용자 지정과 같은 강력한 기능을 가능하게 함","es":"Empowers agents to create autonomous subprocesses using Markdown files with YAML frontmatter, triggering conditions, and system prompt design, enabling powerful capabilities like multi-step task handling and customized agent behavior via description fields and examples","fr":"Empowers agents to create autonomous subprocesses using Markdown files with YAML frontmatter, triggering conditions, and system prompt design, enabling powerful capabilities like multi-step task handling and customized agent behavior via description fields and examples","de":"Empowers agents to create autonomous subprocesses using Markdown files with YAML frontmatter, triggering conditions, and system prompt design, enabling powerful capabilities like multi-step task handling and customized agent behavior via description fields and examples","pt":"Empowers agents to create autonomous subpro