ichiers YAML pour les workflows CI/CD","de":"Das Skill für Expo-CI/CD-Workflows hilft Entwicklern bei der Erstellung und Bearbeitung von YAML-Dateien für CI/CD-Workflows","pt":"O skill expo-cicd-workflows ajuda os desenvolvedores a escrever e editar arquivos YAML de fluxo de trabalho CI/CD do Expo","ru":"Навык expo-cicd-workflows помогает разработчикам писать и редактировать файлы YAML рабочих потоков CI/CD Expo","ar":"تساعد مهارة expo-cicd-workflows المطورين على كتابة وتحرير ملفات YAML لتدفقات العمل CI/CD الخاصة بـ Expo","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["EAS CI/CD YAML ","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"ja":["EAS CI/CD YAML ","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"ko":["EAS CI/CD YAML ","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"es":["Edición de archivos YAML para flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Validación de archivos YAML con esquema JSON","Uso de ETags para caché de respuestas","Implementación con Node.js"],"fr":["Édition de fichiers YAML pour les workflows CI/CD","Validation de fichiers YAML avec schéma JSON","Utilisation d''ETags pour le cache de réponses","Mise en œuvre avec Node.js"],"de":["Bearbeitung von YAML-Dateien für CI/CD-Workflows","Validierung von YAML-Dateien mit JSON-Schema","Verwendung von ETags für Antwort-Caching","Implementierung mit Node.js"],"pt":["Ajuda a escrever e editar arquivos YAML de fluxo de trabalho CI/CD","Fornece esquema JSON para validação de arquivos","USA Node.js para fetch de recursos","Cache de respostas usando ETags para eficiência","Suporte à integração contínua e entrega contínua"],"ru":["Помогает писать и редактировать файлы YAML рабочих потоков CI/CD","Предоставляет схему JSON для проверки файлов","Использует Node.js для получения ресурсов","Кэширует ответы с помощью ETags для эффективности","Поддерживает непрерывную интеграцию и доставку"],"ar":["تساعد في كتابة وتحرير ملفات YAML لتدفقات العمل CI/CD","توفر مخطط JSON للتحقق من صحة الملفات","استخدام Node.js لاسترجاع الموارد","مخزن استجابات باستخدام ETags للكفاءة","دعم للتكامل المستمر والتسليم المستمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo CI/CD","EAS CI/CD","YAML","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"ja":["Expo CI/CD","EAS CI/CD","YAML","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"ko":["Expo CI/CD","EAS CI/CD","YAML","JSON ","Node.js","ETags","Expo API"],"es":["flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Expo","YAML","integración continua","entrega continua","desarrollo de software","automatización","Node.js"],"fr":["workflows CI/CD","Expo","YAML","intégration continue","livraison continue","développement de logiciels","automatisation","Node.js"],"de":["CI/CD-Workflows","Expo","YAML","kontinuierliche Integration","kontinuierliche Lieferung","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung","Node.js"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho CI/CD","Expo","arquivo YAML","integração contínua","entrega contínua","desenvolvimento de software","Node.js","JSON Schema"],"ru":["рабочий поток CI/CD","Expo","файл YAML","непрерывная интеграция","непрерывная доставка","разработка программного обеспечения","Node.js","схема JSON"],"ar":["تدفق العمل CI/CD","Expo","ملف YAML","التكامل المستمر","التسليم المستمر","تطوير البرمجيات","Node.js","مخطط JSON"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.184Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-cicd-workflows","description":"Helps understand and write EAS workflow YAML files for Expo projects. Use this skill when the user asks about CI/CD or workflows in an Expo or EAS context, mentions .eas/workflows/, or wants help with EAS build pipelines or deployment automation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# EAS Workflows Skill\n\nHelp developers write and edit EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files.\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nFetch these resources before generating or validating workflow files. Use the fetch script (implemented using Node.js) in this skill''s `scripts/` directory; it caches responses using ETags for efficiency:\n\n```bash\n# Fetch resources\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/fetch.js <url>\n```\n\n1. **JSON Schema** — https://api.expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema\n   - It is NECESSARY to fetch this schema\n   - So","body":"# EAS Workflows Skill\n\nHelp developers write and edit EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files.\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nFetch these resources before generating or validating workflow files. Use the fetch script (implemented using Node.js) in this skill''s `scripts/` directory; it caches responses using ETags for efficiency:\n\n```bash\n# Fetch resources\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/fetch.js <url>\n```\n\n1. **JSON Schema** — https://api.expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema\n   - It is NECESSARY to fetch this schema\n   - Source of truth for validation\n   - All job types and their required/optional parameters\n   - Trigger types and configurations\n   - Runner types, VM images, and all enums\n\n2. **Syntax Documentation** — https://raw.githubusercontent.com/expo/expo/refs/heads/main/docs/pages/eas/workflows/syntax.mdx\n   - Overview of workflow YAML syntax\n   - Examples and English explanations\n   - Expression syntax and contexts\n\n3. **Pre-packaged Jobs** — https://raw.githubusercontent.com/expo/expo/refs/heads/main/docs/pages/eas/workflows/pre-packaged-jobs.mdx\n   - Documentation for supported pre-packaged job types\n   - Job-specific parameters and outputs\n\nDo not rely on memorized values; these resources evolve as new features are added.\n\n## Workflow File Location\n\nWorkflows live in `.eas/workflows/*.yml` (or `.yaml`).\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\nA workflow file has these top-level keys:\n\n- `name` — Display name for the workflow\n- `on` — Triggers that start the workflow (at least one required)\n- `jobs` — Job definitions (required)\n- `defaults` — Shared defaults for all jobs\n- `concurrency` — Control parallel workflow runs\n\nConsult the schema for the full specification of each section.\n\n## Expressions\n\nUse `${{ }}` syntax for dynamic values. The schema defines available contexts:\n\n- `github.*` — GitHub repository and event information\n- `inputs.*` — Values from `workflow_dispatch` inputs\n- `needs.*` — Outputs and status from dependent jobs\n- `jobs.*` — Job outputs (alternative syntax)\n- `steps.*` — Step outputs within custom jobs\n- `workflow.*` — Workflow metadata\n\n## Generating Workflows\n\nWhen generating or editing workflows:\n\n1. Fetch the schema to get current job types, parameters, and allowed values\n2. Validate that required fields are present for each job type\n3. Verify job references in `needs` and `after` exist in the workflow\n4. Check that expressions reference valid contexts and outputs\n5. Ensure `if` conditions respect the schema''s length constraints\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generating or editing a workflow file, validate it against the schema:\n\n```sh\n# Install dependencies if missing\n[ -d \"{baseDir}/scripts/node_modules\" ] || npm install --prefix {baseDir}/scripts\n\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/validate.js <workflow.yml> [workflow2.yml ...]\n```\n\nThe validator fetches the latest schema and checks the YAML structure. Fix any reported errors before considering the workflow complete.\n\n## Answering Questions\n\nWhen users ask about available options (job types, triggers, runner types, etc.), fetch the schema and derive the answer from it rather than relying on potentially outdated information.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:44.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","zh":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","ja":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","ko":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","es":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","fr":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","de":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","pt":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","ru":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management.","ar":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents specializing in Expo application deployment and CI/CD pipeline management."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","zh":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","ja":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","ko":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","es":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","fr":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","de":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","pt":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","ru":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation.","ar":"Enables agents to generate and validate EAS CI/CD workflow YAML files against the official JSON schema from expo.dev/v2/workflows/schema. Includes Node.js-based fetch scripts with ETag caching for efficient schema retrieval and validation."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"zh":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"ja":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"ko":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"es":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"fr":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"de":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"pt":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"ru":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"],"ar":["Generating EAS Build workflow configurations","Validating YAML syntax against Expo''s JSON schema","Automating CI/CD pipeline setup for Expo projects","Caching schema responses using ETag optimization"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"zh":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"ja":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"ko":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"es":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"fr":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"de":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"pt":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"ru":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"],"ar":["Requires Node.js runtime for fetch scripts","Dependent on Expo''s external schema API availability","Specifically designed for EAS workflows only"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
