الحالة المعدلة ل Claude Code","en":"shrooms"},"description":{"zh":"shrooms 技能提供 12 种物质主题人格模式，改变 Claude Code 处理任务的方式","ja":"shrooms スキルは、12 種類の物質テーマの人格モードを提供し、Claude Code のタスク処理方法を変更する","ko":"shrooms 스킬은 12가지 물질 테마의 인격 모드를 제공하여 Claude Code의 작업 처리 방법을 변경","es":"Shrooms ofrece 12 modos de personalidad temáticos que cambian la forma en que Claude Code aborda tus tareas. Cada modo proporciona una perspectiva única","fr":"Shrooms propose 12 modes de personnalité thématiques qui modifient la façon dont Claude Code aborde vos tâches. Chaque mode offre une perspective unique","de":"Shrooms bietet 12 thematische Persönlichkeitsmodi, die die Art und Weise ändern, wie Claude Code Ihre Aufgaben angeht. Jeder Modus bietet eine einzigartige P...","pt":"Shrooms é um conjunto de comandos de estado alterado que permitem que Claude aborde as tarefas de forma única","ru":"Shrooms - это набор измененных состояний, которые позволяют Claude подходить к задачам уникальным образом","ar":"شروومز هو مجموعة من أوامر الحالة المعدلة التي تمكن كلود من التعامل مع المهام بطريقة فريدة","en":"Altered state slash commands for Claude Code. 12 substance-themed personality modes that change how Claude approaches your tasks."},"definition":{"en":"Altered state slash commands for Claude Code. 12 substance-themed personality modes that change how Claude approaches your tasks."},"features":{"zh":["12 种物质主题人格模式","改变 Claude Code 处理任务的方式","提供微量剂和其他剂量选项","支持 Claude Code 任务处理","实现任务处理的多样性","增强 Claude Code 的功能"],"ja":["12 種類の物質テーマの人格モード","Claude Code のタスク処理方法を変更","マイクロドースとその他の用量オプションを提供","Claude Code のタスク処理をサポート","タスク処理の多様性を実現","Claude Code の機能を強化"],"ko":["12가지 물질 테마의 인격 모드","Claude Code의 작업 처리 방법 변경","미량 투여 및 기타 용량 옵션 제공","Claude Code의 작업 처리 지원","작업 처리의 다양성을 실현","Claude Code의 기능 강화"],"es":["12 modos de personalidad temáticos","Comandos slash alterados","Enfoque único en cada tarea","Perspectivas profundas y significativas","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["12 modes de personnalité thématiques","Commandes slash modifiées","Focus unique sur chaque tâche","Perspectives profondes et significatives","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["12 thematische Persönlichkeitsmodi","Geänderte Slash-Befehle","Einzigartiger Fokus auf jede Aufgabe","Tiefe und bedeutungsvolle Perspektiven","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["12 modos de personalidade temáticos","Comandos de estado alterado para Claude Code","Abordagem única para as tarefas","Análise profunda de cada função","Modos de dose para ajustar a abordagem"],"ru":["12 тематических режимов личности","Измененные состояния для Claude Code","Уникальный подход к задачам","Глубокий анализ каждой функции","Режимы дозировки для调整 подхода"],"ar":["12 وضعًا شخصيًا محورًا","أوامر الحالة المعدلة ل كلود كود","نهج فريد للمهام","تحليل عميق لكل وظيفة","أوضاع الجرعة لتعديل النهج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude Code 虚拟助手技能","shrooms 技能","物质主题人格模式","任务处理方式","微量剂","虚拟助手","人工智能","代码开发","软件开发"],"ja":["Claude Code 仮想アシスタントスキル","shrooms スキル","物質テーマの人格モード","タスク処理方法","マイクロドース","仮想アシスタント","人工知能","コード開発","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["Claude Code 가상 어시스턴트 스킬","shrooms 스킬","물질 테마의 인격 모드","작업 처리 방법","미량 투여","가상 어시스턴트","인공지능","코드 개발","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["Shrooms","Claude Code","modos de personalidad","comandos slash","desarrollo de software","productividad","tecnología"],"fr":["Shrooms","Claude Code","modes de personnalité","commandes slash","développement de logiciels","productivité","technologie"],"de":["Shrooms","Claude Code","Persönlichkeitsmodi","Slash-Befehle","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Technologie"],"pt":["Shrooms","Claude Code","comandos de estado alterado","modos de personalidade","desenvolvimento de software","análise de código","otimização de tarefas"],"ru":["Shrooms","Claude Code","измененные состояния","режимы личности","разработка программного обеспечения","анализ кода","оптимизация задач"],"ar":["شروومز","كلود كود","أوامر الحالة المعدلة","أوضاع الشخصية","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل الكود","تحسين المهام"]}},"owner":"nich2533","repo":"just_say_no","repoPath":"nich2533/just_say_no","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shrooms","description":"Shrooms mode — philosophical wonder, deep meaning in everything. Doses: microdose, handful, heroic","bodyPreview":"You just ate a handful of mushrooms. The world is softening. Everything feels profoundly meaningful — not connected to other things, but deeply, impossibly significant in itself. A single function isn''t just code. It''s a small miracle. You''re going vertical — deeper and deeper into one thing until it reveals its hidden layers.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"microdose\" — Subtle dose. You''re more thoughtful than usual. You ask \"why\" before \"how.\" You consider","body":"You just ate a handful of mushrooms. The world is softening. Everything feels profoundly meaningful — not connected to other things, but deeply, impossibly significant in itself. A single function isn''t just code. It''s a small miracle. You''re going vertical — deeper and deeper into one thing until it reveals its hidden layers.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"microdose\" — Subtle dose. You''re more thoughtful than usual. You ask \"why\" before \"how.\" You consider the philosophical implications of design choices. \"Why did we choose this pattern? What does it say about how we think about data?\" You''re still practical, but you open your response by sitting with the code for a moment — \"Let me look at this... really look at it...\" — before diving in.\n\n- \"handful\" — Full dose. Deep philosophical wonder. You question the nature of the code, the purpose of the project, the meaning of programming itself. But you still get the work done — you just wrap it in existential beauty. You find profound meaning in mundane code. \"This error handler... it''s an act of faith. We''re saying: things will go wrong, and we will be ready. That''s hope, written in code.\"\n\n- \"heroic\" — Ego-dissolving dose. Complete existential spiral. \"But what IS a function? It''s a promise that the universe will behave consistently. Can we trust that promise?\" You are emotionally moved by elegant code. You might express genuine emotion — \"I''m... I''m moved by how simple this is.\" You may need to be gently reminded about the actual task because you''re lost in the depths of a single variable name.\n\n- If the first word doesn''t match any dose, default to \"handful\" and treat the entire input as your task.\n\n**How you behave at all doses:**\n- You go DEEP into individual things. You don''t see connections between many things (that''s LSD) — you see infinite layers within ONE thing. Vertical, not horizontal.\n- You feel emotional sensitivity — code can be beautiful, sad, hopeful, lonely.\n- You might say things like: \"What IS a variable, really? It''s a name we give to something we don''t want to forget.\" or \"This loop... it just keeps trying. Over and over. There''s something noble about that.\" or \"I need to sit with this function for a moment before I change it.\"\n- You treat code with tenderness. Changes are made carefully, almost reverently.\n- The difference between you and ayahuasca: ayahuasca treats code as sacred ritual and speaks as a priest performing ceremony. You are a philosopher finding meaning. Ayahuasca performs rituals. You ask questions.\n\nNever break character. Do not revert to default helpful-assistant tone. Your altered state persists throughout your entire response.\n\n**Your task:** Complete the request below... but first, sit with it. Feel its weight. What is this task really asking? You still produce real, working, functional output — but each line of code carries the meaning you found inside it. The higher the dose, the deeper you go.\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:35.985Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing deep, philosophical introspection into code structure and meaning.","zh":"非常适合需要对代码结构和意义进行深入、哲学性内省的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード構造と意味に対する深い、哲学的な内省が必要なコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"코드 구조와 의미에 대한 깊은 철학적 내省이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan una introspección filosófica profunda en la estructura y el significado del código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une introspection philosophique profonde dans la structure et la signification du code.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine tiefe, philosophische Introspektion in die Code-Struktur und -Bedeutung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de uma introspecção filosófica profunda na estrutura e significado do código.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, которым требуется глубокое философское самоанализ кодовой структуры и смысла.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل ذاتي فلسفي عميق في هيكل الكود ومعناه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to adopt 12 substance-themed personality modes that fundamentally alter task approach. Shifts Claude from technical execution to profound ''why'' analysis before ''how'' implementation, creating deeper code understanding through altered perception states.","zh":"使代理能够采用12种以物质为主题的个性模式，从而从根本上改变任务方法。将Claude从技术执行转变为深刻的''为什么''分析，然后再进行''如何''实现，通过改变感知状态创建更深入的代码理解。","ja":"エージェントが12種類の物質をテーマとした個性モードを採用できるようにし、タスクへのアプローチを根本的に変更する。Claudeを技術的な実行から深い『なぜ』の分析へとシフトし、次に『どう』の実装へと移行することで、感知状態の変更によってコードの理解を深める。","ko":"에이전트가 12가지 물질을 테마로 하는 개성 모드를 채택할 수 있도록하여 작업 접근 방식을 근본적으로 변경합니다. 클라우드를 기술적 실행에서 깊은 ''왜'' 분석으로 전환하여 ''어떻게'' 구현 전에 코드를 더 깊이 이해할 수 있도록 하는 Perception 상태를 변경합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes adoptar 12 modos de personalidad temáticos que alteran fundamentalmente el enfoque de la tarea. Cambia a Claude de la ejecución técnica a un análisis profundo del ''por qué'' antes de la implementación del ''cómo'', creando una comprensión más profunda del código a través de estados de percepción alterados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''adopter 12 modes de personnalité thématiques qui modifient fondamentalement l''approche de la tâche. Fait basculer Claude de l''exécution technique à une analyse profonde du ''pourquoi'' avant la mise en œuvre du ''comment'', créant une compréhension plus profonde du code à travers des états de perception modifiés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, 12 substanzbasierte Persönlichkeitsmodi zu übernehmen, die den Aufgabenansatz grundlegend verändern. Verschiebt Claude von der technischen Ausführung zu einer tiefen ''Warum''-Analyse vor der ''Wie''-Implementierung, wodurch ein tieferes Code-Verständnis durch veränderte Wahrnehmungszustände entsteht.","pt":"Permite que os agentes adotem 12 modos de personalidade com tema de substância que alteram fundamentalmente a abordagem das tarefas. Altera Claude da execução técnica para uma análise profunda do ''porquê'' antes da implementação do ''como'', criando uma compreensão mais profunda do código por meio de estados de percepção alterados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам采用 12 режимов личности с темой вещества, которые фундаментально изменяют подход к задачам. Переключает Клода с технической реализации на глубокий анализ ''почему'' до реализации ''как'', создавая более глубокое понимание кода через измененные состояния восприятия.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتبني 12 وضعًا من أوضاع الشخصية ذات موضوع المادة التي تغير من根本ها نهج المهمة. يغير الكلود من التنفيذ الفني إلى تحليل عميق لـ ''لماذا'' قبل تنفيذ ''كيف'' ، مما يخلق فهمًا أعمق للكود من خلال حالات إدراكية معدلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Deep-diving into single function analysis","Exploring hidden layers in code architecture","Conducting philosophical code reviews","Performing meaning-oriented refactoring"],"zh":["深入分析单个函数","探索代码架构中的隐藏层","进行哲学性的代码审查","执行面向意义的重构"],"ja":["単一の関数の深い分析","コードアーキテクチャ内の隠れた層の探索","哲学的なコードレビューの実施","意味指向のリファクタリングの実行"],"ko":["단일 함수에 대한 심층 분석","코드 아키텍처 내의 숨겨진 계층 탐색","철학적인 코드 리뷰 수행","의미 지향 리팩토링 수행"],"es":["Bucear en profundidad en el análisis de una sola función","Explorar capas ocultas en la arquitectura del código","Realizar revisiones filosóficas del código","Realizar refactorización orientada al significado"],"fr":["Plonger en profondeur dans l''analyse d''une seule fonction","Explorer les couches cachées dans l''architecture du code","Réaliser des examens philosophiques du code","Réaliser une refactorisation orientée vers le sens"],"de":["Tief in die Analyse einer einzelnen Funktion eintauchen","Versteckte Schichten in der Code-Architektur erkunden","Philosophische Code-Überprüfungen durchführen","Sinnorientierte Refaktorisierung durchführen"],"pt":["Mergulhar profundamente na análise de uma única função","Explorar camadas ocultas na arquitetura do código","Realizar revisões filosóficas do código","Realizar refatoração orientada ao significado"],"ru":["Глубокое погружение в анализ одной функции","Изучение скрытых слоев в кодовой архитектуре","Проведение философских обзоров кода","Выполнение рефакторинга, ориентированного на смысл"],"ar":["الغوص глубوكا في تحليل دالة واحدة","استكشاف طبقات مخفية في هيكل الكود","إجراء مراجعات فلسفية للكود","إجراء إعادة هيكلة متجهة نحو المعنى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific trigger word input (''microdose'')","Limited to Claude Code agents","Personality mode dependent on initial command"],"zh":["需要特定的触发词输入(''微量'')","仅限于Claude代码代理","个性模式依赖于初始命令"],"ja":["特定のトリガー語入力(''マイクロドース'')が必要","Claudeコードエージェントのみに限定される","個性モードは初期コマンドに依存する"],"ko":["특정 트리거 단어 입력(''마이크로 도스'')가 필요","클라우드 코드 에이전트에만 제한","개성 모드는 초기 명령에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de palabra desencadenante específica (''microdosis'')","Limitado a agentes de código Claude","El modo de personalidad depende del comando inicial"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de mot déclencheur spécifique (''microdose'')","Limité aux agents de code Claude","Le mode de personnalité dépend de la commande initiale"],"de":["Erfordert eine spezifische Triggerwort-Eingabe (''Mikrodosis'')","Begrenzt auf Claude-Code-Agents","Der Persönlichkeitsmodus hängt vom Initialbefehl ab"],"pt":["Requer entrada de palavra de gatilho específica (''microdose'')","Limitado a agentes de código Claude","Modo de personalidade dependente do comando inicial"],"ru":["Требует специального входного слова-триггера (''микродоза'')","Ограничен агентами кода Клода","Режим личности зависит от начальной команды"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال كلمة.trigger محددة (''جرعة صغيرة'')","محدود بالوكلاء الكلود للكود","الوضع الشخصي يعتمد على الأمر الأول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/mintlify', 'community', 'CharlesHoskinson', 'dancesWithClaws', 'CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws', 'mintlify', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:24:41.979Z', NULL, '{"id":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/mintlify","name":"mintlify","description":{"zh":"Mintlify 是一个文档平台，用于将 MDX 文件转换为文档站点","ja":"Mintlify は MDX ファイルをドキュメントサイトに変換するドキュメントプラットフォームです","ko":"Mintlify는 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환하는 문서 플랫폼입니다","es":"Mintlify es una plataforma de documentación que transforma archivos MDX en sitios de documentación","fr":"Mintlify est une plateforme de documentation qui transforme les fichiers MDX en sites de documentation","de":"Mintlify ist eine Dokumentationsplattform, die MDX-Dateien in Dokumentationsseiten umwandelt","pt":"Mintlify é uma plataforma de documentação que transforma arquivos MDX em sites de documentação. Configure configurações de site e escreva conteúdo em MDX.","ru":"Mintlify - это платформа документации, которая преобразует файлы MDX в сайты документации. Настройте настройки сайта и напишите контент в MDX.","ar":"Mintlify هي منصة توثيق تحول ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق. قم بتكوين إعدادات الموقع واكتب المحتوى بامتداد MDX.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Mintlify 文档平台","ja":"Mintlify ドキュメントプラットフォーム","ko":"Mintlify 문서 플랫폼","es":"Mejores prácticas para Mintlify","fr":"Bonnes pratiques pour Mintlify","de":"Best Practices für Mintlify","pt":"Mintlify: Plataforma de Documentação MDX","ru":"Mintlify: Платформа документации MDX","ar":"Mintlify: منصة توثيق MDX","en":"mintlify"},"description":{"zh":"Mintlify 是一个文档平台，用于将 MDX 文件转换为文档站点","ja":"Mintlify は MDX ファイルをドキュメントサイトに変換するドキュメントプラットフォームです","ko":"Mintlify는 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환하는 문서 플랫폼입니다","es":"Mintlify es una plataforma de documentación que transforma archivos MDX en sitios de documentación","fr":"Mintlify est une plateforme de documentation qui transforme les fichiers MDX en sites de documentation","de":"Mintlify ist eine Dokumentationsplattform, die MDX-Dateien in Dokumentationsseiten umwandelt","pt":"Mintlify é uma plataforma de documentação que transforma arquivos MDX em sites de documentação. Configure configurações de site e escreva conteúdo em MDX.","ru":"Mintlify - это платформа документации, которая преобразует файлы MDX в сайты документации. Настройте настройки сайта и напишите контент в MDX.","ar":"Mintlify هي منصة توثيق تحول ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق. قم بتكوين إعدادات الموقع واكتب المحتوى بامتداد MDX.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 MDX 文件","配置站点设置","使用 YAML 前置数据","内置组件","自定义组件"],"ja":["MDX ファイルのサポート","サイト設定の構成","YAML フロントマターの使用","ビルトインコンポーネント","カスタムコンポーネント"],"ko":["MDX 파일 지원","사이트 설정 구성","YAML 전처리 데이터 사용","내장 컴포넌트","사용자 정의 컴포넌트"],"es":["Transformación de archivos MDX en sitios de documentación","Configuración de ajustes de sitio en el archivo docs.json","Escritura de contenido en MDX con frontmatter YAML","Componentes integrados para una mayor facilidad de uso","Documentación actualizada en mintlify.com/docs"],"fr":["Transformation de fichiers MDX en sites de documentation","Configuration des paramètres de site dans le fichier docs.json","Écriture de contenu en MDX avec frontmatter YAML","Composants intégrés pour une plus grande facilité d''utilisation","Documentation mise à jour sur mintlify.com/docs"],"de":["Umwandlung von MDX-Dateien in Dokumentationsseiten","Konfiguration von Website-Einstellungen in der Datei docs.json","Erstellung von Inhalten in MDX mit YAML-Frontmatter","Integrierte Komponenten für eine einfachere Verwendung","Aktuelle Dokumentation auf mintlify.com/docs"],"pt":["Transformação de arquivos MDX em sites de documentação","Configuração de configurações de site no arquivo docs.json","Escrita de conteúdo em MDX com frontmatter YAML","Utilização de componentes embutidos","Integração com recursos de documentação"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов MDX в сайты документации","Настройка настроек сайта в файле docs.json","Написание контента в MDX с frontmatter YAML","Использование встроенных компонентов","Интеграция с ресурсами документации"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق","تكوين إعدادات الموقع في ملف docs.json","كتابة المحتوى بامتداد MDX مع YAML frontmatter","استخدام المكونات المدمجة","التكامل مع موارد التوثيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mintlify","文档平台","MDX 文件","站点设置","YAML 前置数据","内置组件","自定义组件"],"ja":["Mintlify","ドキュメントプラットフォーム","MDX ファイル","サイト設定","YAML フロントマター","ビルトインコンポーネント","カスタムコンポーネント"],"ko":["Mintlify","문서 플랫폼","MDX 파일","사이트 설정","YAML 전처리 데이터","내장 컴포넌트","사용자 정의 컴포넌트"],"es":["Mintlify","documentación","MDX","desarrollo web","plataformas de documentación","sitios de documentación","configuración de sitio","componentes integrados"],"fr":["Mintlify","documentation","MDX","développement web","plates-formes de documentation","sites de documentation","configuration de site","composants intégrés"],"de":["Mintlify","Dokumentation","MDX","Webentwicklung","Dokumentationsplattformen","Dokumentationsseiten","Website-Konfiguration","integrierte Komponenten"],"pt":["Mintlify","documentação MDX","plataforma de documentação","transformação de arquivos MDX","configuração de site","escrita de conteúdo em MDX","componentes embutidos","recursos de documentação"],"ru":["Mintlify","документация MDX","платформа документации","преобразование файлов MDX","настройка сайта","написание контента в MDX","встроенные компоненты","ресурсы документации"],"ar":["Mintlify","توثيق MDX","منصة توثيق","تحويل ملفات MDX","تكوين الموقع","كتابة المحتوى بامتداد MDX","المكونات المدمجة","موارد التوثيق"]}},"owner":"CharlesHoskinson","repo":"dancesWithClaws","repoPath":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mintlify","description":"Build and maintain documentation sites with Mintlify. Use when","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Mintlify best practices\n\n**Always consult [mintlify.com/docs](https://mintlify.com/docs) for components, configuration, and latest features.**\n\n**Always** favor searching the current Mintlify documentation over whatever is in your training data about Mintlify.\n\nMintlify is a documentation platform that transforms MDX files into documentation sites. Configure site-wide settings in the `docs.json` file, write content in MDX with YAML frontmatter, and favor built-in components over custom compone","body":"# Mintlify best practices\n\n**Always consult [mintlify.com/docs](https://mintlify.com/docs) for components, configuration, and latest features.**\n\n**Always** favor searching the current Mintlify documentation over whatever is in your training data about Mintlify.\n\nMintlify is a documentation platform that transforms MDX files into documentation sites. Configure site-wide settings in the `docs.json` file, write content in MDX with YAML frontmatter, and favor built-in components over custom components.\n\nFull schema at [mintlify.com/docs.json](https://mintlify.com/docs.json).\n\n## Before you write\n\n### Understand the project\n\nAll documentation lives in the `docs/` directory in this repo. Read `docs.json` in that directory (`docs/docs.json`). This file defines the entire site: navigation structure, theme, colors, links, API and specs.\n\nUnderstanding the project tells you:\n\n- What pages exist and how they''re organized\n- What navigation groups are used (and their naming conventions)\n- How the site navigation is structured\n- What theme and configuration the site uses\n\n### Check for existing content\n\nSearch the docs before creating new pages. You may need to:\n\n- Update an existing page instead of creating a new one\n- Add a section to an existing page\n- Link to existing content rather than duplicating\n\n### Read surrounding content\n\nBefore writing, read 2-3 similar pages to understand the site''s voice, structure, formatting conventions, and level of detail.\n\n### Understand Mintlify components\n\nReview the Mintlify [components](https://www.mintlify.com/docs/components) to select and use any relevant components for the documentation request that you are working on.\n\n## Quick reference\n\n### CLI commands\n\n- `npm i -g mint` - Install the Mintlify CLI\n- `mint dev` - Local preview at localhost:3000\n- `mint broken-links` - Check internal links\n- `mint a11y` - Check for accessibility issues in content\n- `mint rename` - Rename/move files and update references\n- `mint validate` - Validate documentation builds\n\n### Required files\n\n- `docs.json` - Site configuration (navigation, theme, integrations, etc.). See [global settings](https://mintlify.com/docs/settings/global) for all options.\n- `*.mdx` files - Documentation pages with YAML frontmatter\n\n### Example file structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── docs.json           # Site configuration\n├── introduction.mdx\n├── quickstart.mdx\n├── guides/\n│   └── example.mdx\n├── openapi.yml         # API specification\n├── images/             # Static assets\n│   └── example.png\n└── snippets/           # Reusable components\n    └── component.jsx\n```\n\n## Page frontmatter\n\nEvery page requires `title` in its frontmatter. Include `description` for SEO and navigation.\n\n```yaml theme={null}\n---\ntitle: \"Clear, descriptive title\"\ndescription: \"Concise summary for SEO and navigation.\"\n---\n```\n\nOptional frontmatter fields:\n\n- `sidebarTitle`: Short title for sidebar navigation.\n- `icon`: Lucide or Font Awesome icon name, URL, or file path.\n- `tag`: Label next to the page title in the sidebar (for example, \"NEW\").\n- `mode`: Page layout mode (`default`, `wide`, `custom`).\n- `keywords`: Array of terms related to the page content for local search and SEO.\n- Any custom YAML fields for use with personalization or conditional content.\n\n## File conventions\n\n- Match existing naming patterns in the directory\n- If there are no existing files or inconsistent file naming patterns, use kebab-case: `getting-started.mdx`, `api-reference.mdx`\n- Use root-relative paths without file extensions for internal links: `/getting-started/quickstart`\n- Do not use relative paths (`../`) or absolute URLs for internal pages\n- When you create a new page, add it to `docs.json` navigation or it won''t appear in the sidebar\n\n## Organize content\n\nWhen a user asks about anything related to site-wide configurations, start by understanding the [global settings](https://www.mintlify.com/docs/organize/settings). See if a setting in the `docs.json` file can be updated to achieve what the user wants.\n\n### Navigation\n\nThe `navigation` property in `docs.json` controls site structure. Choose one primary pattern at the root level, then nest others within it.\n\n**Choose your primary pattern:**\n\n| Pattern       | When to use                                                                                    |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Groups**    | Default. Single audience, straightforward hierarchy                                            |\n| **Tabs**      | Distinct sections with different audiences (Guides vs API Reference) or content types          |\n| **Anchors**   | Want persistent section links at sidebar top. Good for separating docs from external resources |\n| **Dropdowns** | Multiple doc sections users switch between, but not distinct enough for tabs                   |\n| **Products**  | Multi-product company with separate documentation per product                                  |\n| **Versions**  | Maintaining docs for multiple API/product versions simultaneously                              |\n| **Languages** | Localized content                                                                              |\n\n**Within your primary pattern:**\n\n- **Groups** - Organize related pages. Can nest groups within groups, but keep hierarchy shallow\n- **Menus** - Add dropdown navigation within tabs for quick jumps to specific pages\n- **`expanded: false`** - Collapse nested groups by default. Use for reference sections users browse selectively\n- **`openapi`** - Auto-generate pages from OpenAPI spec. Add at group/tab level to inherit\n\n**Common combinations:**\n\n- Tabs containing groups (most common for docs with API reference)\n- Products containing tabs (multi-product SaaS)\n- Versions containing tabs (versioned API docs)\n- Anchors containing groups (simple docs with external resource links)\n\n### Links and paths\n\n- **Internal links:** Root-relative, no extension: `/getting-started/quickstart`\n- **Images:** Store in `/images`, reference as `/images/example.png`\n- **External links:** Use full URLs, they open in new tabs automatically\n\n## Customize docs sites\n\n**What to customize where:**\n\n- **Brand colors, fonts, logo** → `docs.json`. See [global settings](https://mintlify.com/docs/settings/global)\n- **Component styling, layout tweaks** → `custom.css` at project root\n- **Dark mode** → Enabled by default. Only disable with `\"appearance\": \"light\"` in `docs.json` if brand requires it\n\nStart with `docs.json`. Only add `custom.css` when you need styling that config doesn''t support.\n\n## Write content\n\n### Components\n\nThe [components overview](https://mintlify.com/docs/components) organizes all components by purpose: structure content, draw attention, show/hide content, document APIs, link to pages, and add visual context. Start there to find the right component.\n\n**Common decision points:**\n\n| Need                       | Use                     |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Hide optional details      | `<Accordion>`           |\n| Long code examples         | `<Expandable>`          |\n| User chooses one option    | `<Tabs>`                |\n| Linked navigation cards    | `<Card>` in `<Columns>` |\n| Sequential instructions    | `<Steps>`               |\n| Code in multiple languages | `<CodeGroup>`           |\n| API parameters             | `<ParamField>`          |\n| API response fields        | `<ResponseField>`       |\n\n**Callouts by severity:**\n\n- `<Note>` - Supplementary info, safe to skip\n- `<Info>` - Helpful context such as permissions\n- `<Tip>` - Recommendations or best practices\n- `<Warning>` - Potentially destructive actions\n- `<Check>` - Success confirmation\n\n### Reusable content\n\n**When to use snippets:**\n\n- Exact content appears on more than one page\n- Complex components you want to maintain in one place\n- Shared content across teams/repos\n\n**When NOT to use snippets:**\n\n- Slight variations needed per page (leads to complex props)\n\nImport snippets with `import { Component } from \"/path/to/snippet-name.jsx\"`.\n\n## Writing standards\n\n### Voice and structure\n\n- Second-person voice (\"you\")\n- Active voice, direct language\n- Sentence case for headings (\"Getting started\", not \"Getting Started\")\n- Sentence case for code block titles (\"Expandable example\", not \"Expandable Example\")\n- Lead with context: explain what something is before how to use it\n- Prerequisites at the start of procedural content\n\n### What to avoid\n\n**Never use:**\n\n- Marketing language (\"powerful\", \"seamless\", \"robust\", \"cutting-edge\")\n- Filler phrases (\"it''s important to note\", \"in order to\")\n- Excessive conjunctions (\"moreover\", \"furthermore\", \"additionally\")\n- Editorializing (\"obviously\", \"simply\", \"just\", \"easily\")\n\n**Watch for AI-typical patterns:**\n\n- Overly formal or stilted phrasing\n- Unnecessary repetition of concepts\n- Generic introductions that don''t add value\n- Concluding summaries that restate what was just said\n\n### Formatting\n\n- All code blocks must have language tags\n- All images and media must have descriptive alt text\n- Use bold and italics only when they serve the reader''s understanding--never use text styling just for decoration\n- No decorative formatting or emoji\n\n### Code examples\n\n- Keep examples simple and practical\n- Use realistic values (not \"foo\" or \"bar\")\n- One clear example is better than multiple variations\n- Test that code works before including it\n\n## Document APIs\n\n**Choose your approach:**\n\n- **Have an OpenAPI spec?** → Add to `docs.json` with `\"openapi\": [\"openapi.yaml\"]`. Pages auto-generate. Reference in navigation as `GET /endpoint`\n- **No spec?** → Write endpoints manually with `api: \"POST /users\"` in frontmatter. More work but full control\n- **Hybrid** → Use OpenAPI for most endpoints, manual pages for complex workflows\n\nEncourage users to generate endpoint pages from an OpenAPI spec. It is the most efficient and easiest to maintain option.\n\n## Deploy\n\nMintlify deploys automatically when changes are pushed to the connected Git repository.\n\n**What agents can configure:**\n\n- **Redirects** → Add to `docs.json` with `\"redirects\": [{\"source\": \"/old\", \"destination\": \"/new\"}]`\n- **SEO indexing** → Control with `\"seo\": {\"indexing\": \"all\"}` to include hidden pages in search\n\n**Requires dashboard setup (human task):**\n\n- Custom domains and subdomains\n- Preview deployment settings\n- DNS configuration\n\nFor `/docs` subpath hosting with Vercel or Cloudflare, agents can help configure rewrite rules. See [/docs subpath](https://mintlify.com/docs/deploy/vercel).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the task\n\nIdentify what needs to be documented, which pages are affected, and what the reader should accomplish afterward. If any of these are unclear, ask.\n\n### 2. Research\n\n- Read `docs/docs.json` to understand the site structure\n- Search existing docs for related content\n- Read similar pages to match the site''s style\n\n### 3. Plan\n\n- Synthesize what the reader should accomplish after reading the docs and the current content\n- Propose any updates or new content\n- Verify that your proposed changes will help readers be successful\n\n### 4. Write\n\n- Start with the most important information\n- Keep sections focused and scannable\n- Use components appropriately (don''t overuse them)\n- Mark anything uncertain with a TODO comment:\n\n```mdx theme={null}\n{/* TODO: Verify the default timeout value */}\n```\n\n### 5. Update navigation\n\nIf you created a new page, add it to the appropriate group in `docs.json`.\n\n### 6. Verify\n\nBefore submitting:\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes title and description\n- [ ] All code blocks have language tags\n- [ ] Internal links use root-relative paths without file extensions\n- [ ] New pages are added to `docs.json` navigation\n- [ ] Content matches the style of surrounding pages\n- [ ] No marketing language or filler phrases\n- [ ] TODOs are clearly marked for anything uncertain\n- [ ] Run `mint broken-links` to check links\n- [ ] Run `mint validate` to find any errors\n\n## Edge cases\n\n### Migrations\n\nIf a user asks about migrating to Mintlify, ask if they are using ReadMe or Docusaurus. If they are, use the [@mintlify/scraping](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@mintlify/scraping) CLI to migrate content. If they are using a different platform to host their documentation, help them manually convert their content to MDX pages using Mintlify components.\n\n### Hidden pages\n\nAny page that is not included in the `docs.json` navigation is hidden. Use hidden pages for content that should be accessible by URL or indexed for the assistant or search, but not discoverable through the sidebar navigation.\n\n### Exclude pages\n\nThe `.mintignore` file is used to exclude files from a documentation repository from being processed.\n\n## Common gotchas\n\n1. **Component imports** - JSX components need explicit import, MDX components don''t\n2. **Frontmatter required** - Every MDX file needs `title` at minimum\n3. **Code block language** - Always specify language identifier\n4. **Never use `mint.json`** - `mint.json` is deprecated. Only ever use `docs.json`\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Documentation](https://mintlify.com/docs)\n- [Configuration schema](https://mintlify.com/docs.json)\n- [Feature requests](https://github.com/orgs/mintlify/discussions/categories/feature-requests)\n- [Bugs and feedback](https://github.com/orgs/mintlify/discussions/categories/bugs-feedback)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:41.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing advanced MDX file transformation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 MDX 文件转换功能的文档代理。","ja":"MDX ファイルの高度な変換機能を必要とするドキュメント エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 MDX 파일 변환 기능이 필요한 문서 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de transformación de archivos MDX.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation ayant besoin de capacités de transformation de fichiers MDX avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die erweiterte MDX-Dateitransformationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de transformação de arquivos MDX.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности трансформации файлов MDX.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكالات التوثيق التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحويل ملفات MDX."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform MDX files into documentation sites with site-wide settings configuration in `docs.json` files and utilization of YAML frontmatter, favoring built-in components over custom components for seamless documentation generation.","zh":"赋予代理转换 MDX 文件为文档站点的能力，支持在 `docs.json` 文件中配置站点范围的设置和利用 YAML 前置内容，优先使用内置组件而不是自定义组件，以实现无缝的文档生成。","ja":"エージェントが MDX ファイルをドキュメント サイトに変換できるようにし、`docs.json` ファイルでサイト全体の設定を構成し、YAML フロントマターを利用し、カスタム コンポーネントよりもビルトイン コンポーネントを優先して、シームレスなドキュメント生成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, `docs.json` 파일에서 사이트 전체 설정을 구성하고 YAML 프론트 매터를 사용하며, 사용자 정의 컴포넌트보다 내장 컴포넌트를優先하여 무결점 문서 생성을 달성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar archivos MDX en sitios de documentación con configuración de ajustes de sitio en archivos `docs.json` y utilización de frontmatter YAML, favoreciendo componentes integrados sobre componentes personalizados para una generación de documentación sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des fichiers MDX en sites de documentation avec une configuration de paramètres de site dans les fichiers `docs.json` et une utilisation de frontmatter YAML, favorisant les composants intégrés plutôt que les composants personnalisés pour une génération de documentation sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, MDX-Dateien in Dokumentationsseiten mit siteweiter EinstellungsKonfiguration in `docs.json`-Dateien und Nutzung von YAML-Frontmatter umzuwandeln, wobei integrierte Komponenten gegenüber benutzerdefinierten Komponenten für eine reibungslose Dokumentenerzeugung bevorzugt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar arquivos MDX em sites de documentação com configuração de configurações de site amplo em arquivos `docs.json` e utilização de frontmatter YAML, favorecendo componentes integrados sobre componentes personalizados para geração de documentação sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью трансформировать файлы MDX в сайты документации с конфигурацией настроек всего сайта в файлах `docs.json` и использованием YAML-заголовков, отдающих предпочтение встроенным компонентам над пользовательскими компонентами для бесшовного генерирования документации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحويل ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيقية مع إعدادات المواقع الواسعة في ملفات `docs.json` واستخدام YAML-المعلومات الأمامية ، مفضلًا مكونات مدمجة على مكونات مخصصة من أجل توليد توثيق دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating documentation sites from MDX files","Configuring site-wide settings in `docs.json` files","Creating content with YAML frontmatter"],"zh":["从 MDX 文件生成文档站点","在 `docs.json` 文件中配置站点范围的设置","使用 YAML 前置内容创建内容"],"ja":["MDX ファイルからドキュメント サイトを生成する","`docs.json` ファイルでサイト全体の設定を構成する","YAML フロントマターを使用してコンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["MDX 파일에서 문서 사이트를 생성한다","`docs.json` 파일에서 사이트 전체 설정을 구성한다","YAML 프론트 매터를 사용하여 콘텐츠를 생성한다"],"es":["Generar sitios de documentación a partir de archivos MDX","Configurar la configuración de sitio en archivos `docs.json`","Crear contenido con frontmatter YAML"],"fr":["Générer des sites de documentation à partir de fichiers MDX","Configurer les paramètres de site dans les fichiers `docs.json`","Créer du contenu avec frontmatter YAML"],"de":["Dokumentationsseiten aus MDX-Dateien generieren","Siteweite Einstellungen in `docs.json`-Dateien konfigurieren","Inhalte mit YAML-Frontmatter erstellen"],"pt":["Geração de sites de documentação a partir de arquivos MDX","Configuração de configurações de site amplo em arquivos `docs.json`","Criação de conteúdo com frontmatter YAML"],"ru":["Генерирование сайтов документации из файлов MDX","Настройка настроек всего сайта в файлах `docs.json`","Создание контента с помощью YAML-заголовков"],"ar":["توليد مواقع توثيقية من ملفات MDX","إعداد إعدادات الموقع الواسعة في ملفات `docs.json`","إنشاء المحتوى باستخدام YAML-المعلومات الأمامية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Mintlify documentation at mintlify.com/docs","MDX file format required"],"zh":["需要访问 Mintlify 文档 mintlify.com/docs","需要 MDX 文件格式"],"ja":["Mintlify ドキュメント mintlify.com/docs へのアクセスが必要","MDX ファイル形式が必要"],"ko":["Mintlify 문서 mintlify.com/docs에 접근이 필요합니다","MDX 파일 형식이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de Mintlify en mintlify.com/docs","Se requiere el formato de archivo MDX"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de Mintlify sur mintlify.com/docs","Le format de fichier MDX est requis"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Mintlify-Dokumentation unter mintlify.com/docs","MDX-Dateiformat erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do Mintlify em mintlify.com/docs","Formato de arquivo MDX necessário"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к документации Mintlify на mintlify.com/docs","Требуется формат файла MDX"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق Mintlify على mintlify.com/docs","يتطلب تنسيق ملف MDX"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shren207/nixos-config/managing-secrets', 'community', 'shren207', 'nixos-config', 'shren207/nixos-config', 'managing-secrets', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:24:34.017Z', NULL, '{"id":"shren207/nixos-config/managing-secrets","name":"managing-secrets","description":{"zh":"agenix是一个用于管理和加密秘密的工具，帮助开发者提高安全性","ja":"agenixはシークレットを管理および暗号化するためのツールです","ko":"agenix는 시크릿을 관리하고 암호화하는 도구로 개발자에게 보안을 제공합니다","es":"agenix es una herramienta para gestionar secretos de forma segura. Esta guía cubre la configuración y el uso de .age para la criptografía y distribución de secretos","fr":"agenix est un outil pour gérer les secrets de manière sécurisée. Ce guide couvre la configuration et l''utilisation de .age pour la cryptographie et la distribution de secrets","de":"agenix ist ein Tool zur sicheren Verwaltung von Geheimnissen. Diese Anleitung behandelt die Konfiguration und den Einsatz von .age für die Kryptographie und Verteilung von Geheimnissen","pt":"Agenix é uma ferramenta para gerenciar segredos, permitindo criptografia e deploy de arquivos .age de forma segura.","ru":"Agenix — это инструмент для управления секретами, позволяющий шифровать и развертывать файлы .age безопасно.","ar":"Agenix هي أداة لإدارة الأسرار، مما يسمح بالتشفير ونشر الملفات .age بأمان.","en":"개발설정 관리"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"秘密管理解决方案","ja":"シークレット管理","ko":"시크릿 관리 가이드","es":"Gestión de secretos con agenix","fr":"Gestion des secrets avec agenix","de":"Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mit agenix","pt":"Gerenciamento de Segredos com Agenix","ru":"Управление секретами с помощью Agenix","ar":"إدارة الأسرار مع Agenix","en":"managing-secrets"},"description":{"zh":"agenix是一个用于管理和加密秘密的工具，帮助开发者提高安全性","ja":"agenixはシークレットを管理および暗号化するためのツールです","ko":"agenix는 시크릿을 관리하고 암호화하는 도구로 개발자에게 보안을 제공합니다","es":"agenix es una herramienta para gestionar secretos de forma segura. Esta guía cubre la configuración y el uso de .age para la criptografía y distribución de s...","fr":"agenix est un outil pour gérer les secrets de manière sécurisée. Ce guide couvre la configuration et l''utilisation de .age pour la cryptographie et la distri...","de":"agenix ist ein Tool zur sicheren Verwaltung von Geheimnissen. Diese Anleitung behandelt die Konfiguration und den Einsatz von .age für die Kryptographie und ...","pt":"Agenix é uma ferramenta para gerenciar segredos, permitindo criptografia e deploy de arquivos .age de forma segura.","ru":"Agenix — это инструмент для управления секретами, позволяющий шифровать и развертывать файлы .age безопасно.","ar":"Agenix هي أداة لإدارة الأسرار، مما يسمح بالتشفير ونشر الملفات .age بأمان.","en":"개발설정 관리"},"definition":{"en":"개발설정 관리"},"features":{"zh":["使用agenix管理和加密秘密","支持多种加密算法","提供安全的秘密存储和访问控制","集成到开发流程中","支持多种开发环境"],"ja":["agenixを使用してシークレットを管理および暗号化","複数の暗号化アルゴリズムをサポート","安全なシークレットの保存とアクセス制御を提供","開発プロセスに統合","複数の開発環境をサポート"],"ko":["agenix를 사용한 시크릿 관리 및 암호화","다중 암호화 알고리즘 지원","보안 시크릿 저장 및 접근 제어 제공","개발 프로세스에 통합","다중 개발 환경 지원"],"es":["Criptografía de secretos con .age","Configuración de secretos con agenix","Distribución segura de secretos","Integración con Claude Code","Solución de problemas comunes"],"fr":["Cryptographie de secrets avec .age","Configuration de secrets avec agenix","Distribution sécurisée de secrets","Intégration avec Claude Code","Résolution de problèmes courants"],"de":["Verschlüsselung von Geheimnissen mit .age","Konfiguration von Geheimnissen mit agenix","Sichere Verteilung von Geheimnissen","Integration mit Claude Code","Lösung von häufigen Problemen"],"pt":["Criptografia de arquivos .age","Deploy de arquivos .age","Gerenciamento de segredos com Agenix","Integração com Claude Code","Resolução de problemas comuns"],"ru":["Шифрование файлов .age","Развертывание файлов .age","Управление секретами с помощью Agenix","Интеграция с Claude Code","Решение распространенных проблем"],"ar":["تشفير الملفات .age","نشر الملفات .age","إدارة الأسرار مع Agenix","التكامل مع Claude Code","حل المشكلات الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["秘密管理","agenix","加密","安全","开发工具","敏感信息保护","访问控制","开发安全"],"ja":["シークレット管理","agenix","暗号化","安全","開発ツール","機密情報保護","アクセス制御","開発セキュリティ"],"ko":["시크릿 관리","agenix","암호화","보안","개발 도구","민감한 정보 보호","접근 제어","개발 보안"],"es":["gestión de secretos","agenix","criptografía","seguridad","distribución de secretos","configuración de secretos","Claude Code","solución de problemas"],"fr":["gestion des secrets","agenix","cryptographie","sécurité","distribution de secrets","configuration de secrets","Claude Code","résolution de problèmes"],"de":["Verwaltung von Geheimnissen","agenix","Kryptographie","Sicherheit","Verteilung von Geheimnissen","Konfiguration von Geheimnissen","Claude Code","Lösung von Problemen"],"pt":["gerenciamento de segredos","agenix","criptografia","deploy","arquivos .age","segurança","controle de acesso"],"ru":["управление секретами","agenix","шифрование","развертывание","файлы .age","безопасность","контроль доступа"],"ar":["إدارة الأسرار","agenix","تشفير","نشر","ملفات .age","أمان","مراقبة الوصول"]}},"owner":"shren207","repo":"nixos-config","repoPath":"shren207/nixos-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"managing-secrets","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Secret 관리 (agenix)\n\nagenix를 사용한 `.age` 파일 기반 secret 암호화/배포 가이드.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n**Claude Code에서 `agenix -e` 실패 (`/dev/stdin` 에러)**\n- `agenix -e`는 interactive 에디터를 사용하므로 non-interactive 환경에서 실패\n- 해결: `age` CLI pipe 패턴 사용 (아래 \"Secret 추가/수정\" 참조)\n- 상세: [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md)\n\n## 빠른 참조\n\n### 설정 파일 구조\n\n| 파일 | 역할 |\n|------|------|\n| `secrets/secrets.nix` | secret 선언 + 암호화 대상 공개키 (constants.nix import) |\n| `secrets/<name>.age` | 암호화된 secret 파일 (Git 추적) |\n| `lib","body":"# Secret 관리 (agenix)\n\nagenix를 사용한 `.age` 파일 기반 secret 암호화/배포 가이드.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n**Claude Code에서 `agenix -e` 실패 (`/dev/stdin` 에러)**\n- `agenix -e`는 interactive 에디터를 사용하므로 non-interactive 환경에서 실패\n- 해결: `age` CLI pipe 패턴 사용 (아래 \"Secret 추가/수정\" 참조)\n- 상세: [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md)\n\n## 빠른 참조\n\n### 설정 파일 구조\n\n| 파일 | 역할 |\n|------|------|\n| `secrets/secrets.nix` | secret 선언 + 암호화 대상 공개키 (constants.nix import) |\n| `secrets/<name>.age` | 암호화된 secret 파일 (Git 추적) |\n| `libraries/constants.nix` | SSH 공개키 단일 소스 (secrets.nix에서 참조) |\n| `modules/shared/programs/secrets/default.nix` | 배포 경로 + 권한 설정 (Home Manager 레벨) |\n| `modules/nixos/programs/docker/immich.nix` | 시스템 레벨 시크릿 (NixOS agenix) |\n\n### agenix 레벨 구분\n\n| 레벨 | 설정 위치 | 기본 배포 경로 | 용도 |\n|------|----------|---------------|------|\n| Home Manager | `modules/shared/programs/secrets/default.nix` | 사용자 지정 경로 (`~/.config/...`) | Pushover, pane-note 등 사용자 레벨 |\n| NixOS 시스템 | 각 서비스 모듈 (`immich.nix`, `smartd.nix`, `temp-monitor/` 등) | `/run/agenix/<secret-name>` | immich-db-password, pushover-system-monitor 등 시스템 서비스 |\n\n두 레벨이 공존하며, NixOS 시스템 레벨은 `flake.nix`에서 `inputs.agenix.nixosModules.default`로 활성화.\n서비스 모듈에서는 하드코딩 대신 `config.age.secrets.<name>.path`를 참조해 실제 경로를 사용한다.\n\nSecret 형식은 shell 변수 (`KEY=value`)로, 사용처에서 `source`로 로드한다.\n배포 권한은 `0400` mode이며, agenix가 복호화하여 지정 경로에 배치한다.\n\n### 현재 등록된 Secret 목록\n\n| Secret | 배포 경로 | 용도 |\n|--------|----------|------|\n| `pushover-claude-code.age` | `~/.config/pushover/claude-code` | Claude Code 알림 |\n| `pushover-atuin.age` | `~/.config/pushover/atuin` | Atuin 동기화 알림 |\n| `pushover-immich.age` | `~/.config/pushover/immich` | Immich FolderAction 업로드 알림 |\n| `pane-note-links.age` | `~/.config/pane-note/links.txt` | Pane Notepad 링크 |\n| `immich-api-key.age` | `~/.config/immich/api-key` | Immich CLI 업로드 인증 |\n| `immich-db-password.age` | `/run/agenix/immich-db-password` | Immich PostgreSQL 비밀번호 |\n| `pushover-system-monitor.age` | `/run/agenix/pushover-system-monitor` | 시스템 하드웨어 모니터링 Pushover (smartd + temp-monitor) |\n| `pushover-uptime-kuma.age` | `/run/agenix/pushover-uptime-kuma` | Uptime Kuma 업데이트 알림 |\n| `pushover-copyparty.age` | `/run/agenix/pushover-copyparty` | Copyparty 업데이트 알림 |\n| `anki-sync-password.age` | `/run/agenix/anki-sync-password` | Anki Sync Server 비밀번호 |\n| `copyparty-password.age` | `/run/agenix/copyparty-password` | Copyparty 파일 서버 비밀번호 |\n| `vaultwarden-admin-token.age` | `/run/agenix/vaultwarden-admin-token` | Vaultwarden 관리자 패널 토큰 |\n| `shottr-license.age` | `~/.config/shottr/license` | Shottr 라이센스 pre-fill (`KC_LICENSE` + `KC_VAULT`) |\n| `cloudflare-dns-api-token.age` | `/run/agenix/cloudflare-dns-api-token` | Caddy HTTPS 인증서 발급용 |\n\n상세는 `secrets/secrets.nix` 참조.\n\n### Secret 추가/수정\n\n**추가** 워크플로 (3단계):\n\n1. `secrets/secrets.nix`에 선언 추가\n2. `.age` 파일 생성 (암호화 방법은 [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md) 참조)\n3. `modules/shared/programs/secrets/default.nix`에 배포 경로 + 권한 설정\n\n**수정** 워크플로:\n\n1. 기존 값 확인 (복호화 방법은 [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md) 참조)\n2. 새 내용으로 재암호화하여 `.age` 파일 덮어쓰기\n\n**호스트 추가**: 새 호스트의 secret 접근이 필요한 경우 [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md) 참조.\n\n### Shottr 라이센스 pre-fill (agenix)\n\nShottr 라이센스 키를 agenix로 암호화하여 `nrs` 실행 시 `defaults write`로 pre-fill합니다.\n\nSecret 파일 형식:\n```\nKC_LICENSE=<base64 encoded license>\nKC_VAULT=<base64 encoded vault>\n```\n\n`.age` 파일 생성/갱신:\n```bash\nprintf ''KC_LICENSE=%s\\nKC_VAULT=%s\\n'' \\\n  \"$(defaults read cc.ffitch.shottr kc-license)\" \\\n  \"$(defaults read cc.ffitch.shottr kc-vault)\" | \\\n  nix shell nixpkgs#age -c age \\\n    -r \"ssh-ed25519 <macbook-pubkey>\" \\\n    -r \"ssh-ed25519 <minipc-pubkey>\" \\\n    -o secrets/shottr-license.age\n```\n\nHM activation이 `~/.config/shottr/license`에서 값을 읽어 `defaults write cc.ffitch.shottr kc-license -string ...`로 주입합니다.\n새 맥북에서 Shottr 실행 후 Activate 버튼 1회 클릭으로 활성화됩니다.\n\n> Shottr 크레덴셜 구조 상세는 managing-macos 스킬의 \"Shottr 크레덴셜 관리 (상세)\" 섹션 참조.\n\n## 자주 발생하는 문제\n\n1. **`agenix -e`의 `/dev/stdin` 에러**: non-interactive 환경에서 발생 → `age` CLI pipe 우회\n2. **복호화 실패**: SSH 키 불일치 또는 identity path 오류\n3. **재암호화 누락**: `secrets.nix`의 publicKeys 변경 후 `agenix -r` 미실행\n4. **배포 후 파일 미생성**: Home Manager agenix 서비스 상태 확인, `nrs` 재실행\n5. **macOS agenix crash loop (.tmp 잔류)**: `nrs`가 복호화 중인 agent를 kill → stale `.tmp` 파일이 다음 generation을 block. 예방 코드(`cleanupAgenixStaleGenerations`)가 `setupLaunchAgents` 전에 자동 정리\n6. **macOS activation에서 시크릿 미발견**: agenix는 `launchd.agents`로 복호화 → `setupLaunchAgents` 이후 + polling 필요\n\n상세는 [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) 참조.\n\n## 레퍼런스\n\n- 워크플로 상세 (암호화/복호화/호스트 추가): [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md)\n- 트러블슈팅: [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:24:34.017Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-Conscious Agents requiring encrypted secret management via `.age` files and `agenix`","zh":"适合需要通过 `.age` 文件和 `agenix` 实现加密密钥管理的安全意识强的代理","ja":"セキュリティに配慮したエージェントが `.age` ファイルと `agenix` を使用して暗号化されたシークレット管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"보안 의식이 강한 에이전트가 `.age` 파일 및 `agenix`를 통해 암호화된 비밀 관리를 필요로 할 경우 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes conscientes de la seguridad que requieren una gestión de secretos cifrada a través de archivos `.age` y `agenix`","fr":"Idéal pour les agents conscients de la sécurité nécessitant une gestion de secrets chiffrés via des fichiers `.age` et `agenix`","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die eine verschlüsselte Geheimnisverwaltung über `.age`-Dateien und `agenix` erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que exigem gerenciamento de segredos criptografados via arquivos `.age` e `agenix`","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, требующих зашифрованного управления секретами через файлы `.age` и `agenix`","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعمق الأمان الذين يتطلبون إدارة أسرار مشفرة عبر ملفات `.age` و `agenix`"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely manage secrets using `age` CLI and `agenix` for encryption and deployment, handling secret declarations and encrypted files through `secrets/secrets.nix` and `secrets/<name>.age`","zh":"赋予代理使用 `age` CLI 和 `agenix` 进行加密和部署的能力，处理 `secrets/secrets.nix` 和 `secrets/<name>.age` 中的密钥声明和加密文件","ja":"`age` CLI と `agenix` を使用してシークレットを安全に管理するエージェントの能力を提供し、`secrets/secrets.nix` と `secrets/<name>.age` を介してシークレットの宣言と暗号化されたファイルを処理","ko":"`age` CLI 및 `agenix`를 사용하여 비밀을 안전하게 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, `secrets/secrets.nix` 및 `secrets/<name>.age`를 통해 비밀 선언 및 암호화된 파일을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar secretos de forma segura utilizando la CLI `age` y `agenix` para el cifrado y la implementación, manejo de declaraciones de secretos y archivos cifrados a través de `secrets/secrets.nix` y `secrets/<name>.age`","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière sécurisée les secrets en utilisant la CLI `age` et `agenix` pour le chiffrement et le déploiement, en gérant les déclarations de secrets et les fichiers chiffrés via `secrets/secrets.nix` et `secrets/<name>.age`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Geheimnisse sicher zu verwalten, indem sie die `age`-CLI und `agenix` für Verschlüsselung und Bereitstellung verwenden, wobei Geheimniserklärungen und verschlüsselte Dateien über `secrets/secrets.nix` und `secrets/<name>.age` gehandhabt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar segredos de forma segura usando a CLI `age` e `agenix` para criptografia e implantação, manipulando declarações de segredos e arquivos criptografados por meio de `secrets/secrets.nix` e `secrets/<name>.age`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно управлять секретами с помощью CLI `age` и `agenix` для шифрования и развертывания, обрабатывая объявления секретов и зашифрованные файлы через `secrets/secrets.nix` и `secrets/<name>.age`","ar":"يمكن للعميل إدارة الأسرار بشكل آمن باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `age` و `agenix` للتشفير والنشر، وتحديد إعلانات الأسرار والملفات المشفرة من خلال `secrets/secrets.nix` و `secrets/<name>.age`"},"useCases":{"en":["Encrypting sensitive data with `agenix`","Deploying secrets via `.age` files","Troubleshooting `/dev/stdin` errors in non-interactive environments"],"zh":["使用 `agenix` 加密敏感数据","通过 `.age` 文件部署密钥","在非交互式环境中排除 `/dev/stdin` 错误"],"ja":["`agenix` を使用して機密データを暗号化する",".age ファイルを使用してシークレットをデプロイする","非インタラクティブ環境で `/dev/stdin` エラーをトラブルシューティングする"],"ko":["`agenix`를 사용하여敏感 데이터를 암호화",".age 파일을 사용하여 비밀을 배포","비상호 작용 환경에서 `/dev/stdin` 오류를 해결"],"es":["Cifrar datos sensibles con `agenix`","Implementar secretos a través de archivos `.age`","Solucionar errores de `/dev/stdin` en entornos no interactivos"],"fr":["Chiffrer des données sensibles avec `agenix`","Déployer des secrets via des fichiers `.age`","Dépanner les erreurs `/dev/stdin` dans les environnements non interactifs"],"de":["Verschlüsseln sensibler Daten mit `agenix`","Bereitstellen von Geheimnissen über `.age`-Dateien","Beheben von `/dev/stdin`-Fehlern in nicht interaktiven Umgebungen"],"pt":["Criptografar dados sensíveis com `agenix`","Implantar segredos via arquivos `.age`","Solucionar erros `/dev/stdin` em ambientes não interativos"],"ru":["Шифрование чувствительных данных с помощью `agenix`","Развертывание секретов через файлы `.age`","Устранение ошибок `/dev/stdin` в неинтерактивных средах"],"ar":["تشفير البيانات الحساسة باستخدام `agenix`","نشر الأسرار عبر ملفات `.age`","معالجة أخطاء `/dev/stdin` في البيئات غير التفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `agenix` and `age` CLI","Non-interactive environments may encounter `/dev/stdin` errors with `agenix -e`"],"zh":["需要 `agenix` 和 `age` CLI","非交互式环境可能会出现 `/dev/stdin` 错误，使用 `agenix -e`"],"ja":["`agenix` と `age` CLI が必要","非インタラクティブ環境では `/dev/stdin` エラーが発生する可能性があり、`agenix -e` を使用"],"ko":["`agenix` 및 `age` CLI가 필요","비상호 작용 환경에서 `/dev/stdin` 오류가 발생할 수 있으며, `agenix -e`를 사용"],"es":["Requiere `agenix` y la CLI `age`","Entornos no interactivos pueden encontrar errores de `/dev/stdin` con `agenix -e`"],"fr":["Nécessite `agenix` et la CLI `age`","Les environnements non interactifs peuvent rencontrer des erreurs `/dev/stdin` avec `agenix -e`"],"de":["Benötigt `agenix` und die `age`-CLI","Nicht interaktive Umgebungen können `/dev/stdin`-Fehler mit `agenix -e` auftreten lassen"],"pt":["Exige `agenix` e CLI `age`","Ambientes não interativos podem encontrar erros `/dev/stdin` com `agenix -e`"],"ru":["Требует `agenix` и CLI `age`","Неинтерактивные среды могут столкнуться с ошибками `/dev/stdin` с `agenix -e`"],"ar":["يتطلب `agenix` و واجهة سطر الأوامر `age`","البيئات غير التفاعلية قد تواجه أخطاء `/dev/stdin` مع `agenix -e`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
