ux schémas avec le guide de création de schémas","Compatibilité avec la ligne de commande"],"de":["Generierung von CLI-Bildschirmen ohne Code","Definition von JSON-Schemata für die Interaktion mit der CLI","Verwendung der Headless-Tool für die Ausführung von Befehlen","Erstellung neuer Schemata mit dem Schema-Erstellungshandbuch","Kompatibilität mit der Kommandozeile"],"pt":["Crie interfaces de usuário sem codificação","Defina esquemas JSON para interagir com a CLI","Não é necessário conhecimento de programação","Use o comando ''headless'' para executar o adaptador","Crie novos esquemas com o guia de criação de esquemas"],"ru":["Создавайте интерфейсы пользователя без кодирования","Определите схемы JSON для взаимодействия с CLI","Не требуется знание программирования","Используйте команду ''headless'' для запуска адаптера","Создайте новые схемы с помощью руководства по созданию схем"],"ar":["انشئ واجهات المستخدم بدون كتابة الكود","عرف مخططات JSON للتفاعل مع CLI","لا يلزم معرفة البرمجة","استخدم الأمر ''headless'' لتشغيل الموصل","انشئ مخططات جديدة مع دليل إنشاء المخططات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Headless 适配器","无代码生成屏幕","JSON 模式","Headless CLI 代理","代码生成","开发工具"],"ja":["Headless アダプター","コード不要のスクリーン生成","JSON スキーマ","Headless CLI エージェント","コード生成","開発ツール"],"ko":["Headless 어댑터","코드 없이 화면 생성","JSON 스키마","Headless CLI 에이전트","코드 생성","개발 도구"],"es":["adaptadores headless","generación de pantallas de CLI","esquemas JSON","interacción con la CLI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["adaptateurs headless","génération d''écrans de CLI","schémas JSON","interaction avec la CLI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Headless-Adapter","Generierung von CLI-Bildschirmen","JSON-Schemata","Interaktion mit der CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["adaptadores headless","interfaces de usuário sem codificação","esquemas JSON","CLI","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de interface de usuário"],"ru":["хедлесс-адаптеры","интерфейсы пользователя без кодирования","схемы JSON","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","технология интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["الموصلات بدون رأس","واجهات المستخدم بدون كتابة الكود","مخططات JSON","CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"plaited","repo":"plaited","repoPath":"plaited/plaited","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"headless-adapters","description":"Discover, create, and validate headless adapters for agent integration. Includes scaffolding tools and schema-driven compliance testing.","bodyPreview":"# Headless Adapters\n\n## Purpose\n\nSchema-driven adapter for headless CLI agents. **No code required** - just define a JSON schema describing how to interact with the CLI.\n\n| Use Case | Tool |\n|----------|------|\n| Wrap headless CLI agent | `headless` command |\n| Create new schemas | [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Check if a schema exists** in [schemas/](schemas/)\n2. **Run the adapter:**\n   ```bash\n   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-e","body":"# Headless Adapters\n\n## Purpose\n\nSchema-driven adapter for headless CLI agents. **No code required** - just define a JSON schema describing how to interact with the CLI.\n\n| Use Case | Tool |\n|----------|------|\n| Wrap headless CLI agent | `headless` command |\n| Create new schemas | [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Check if a schema exists** in [schemas/](schemas/)\n2. **Run the adapter:**\n   ```bash\n   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/claude-headless.json\n   ```\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### headless\n\nSchema-driven adapter for ANY headless CLI agent.\n\n```bash\nbunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema <path>\n```\n\n**Options:**\n| Flag | Description | Required |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| `-s, --schema` | Path to adapter schema (JSON) | Yes |\n\n**Schema Format:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"command\": [\"my-agent-cli\"],\n  \"sessionMode\": \"stream\",\n  \"prompt\": { \"flag\": \"-p\" },\n  \"output\": { \"flag\": \"--output-format\", \"value\": \"stream-json\" },\n  \"autoApprove\": [\"--allow-all\"],\n  \"outputEvents\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": { \"path\": \"$.type\", \"value\": \"message\" },\n      \"emitAs\": \"message\",\n      \"extract\": { \"content\": \"$.text\" }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"result\": {\n    \"matchPath\": \"$.type\",\n    \"matchValue\": \"result\",\n    \"contentPath\": \"$.content\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Session Modes:**\n\n| Mode | Description | Use When |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| `stream` | Keep process alive, multi-turn via stdin | CLI supports session resume |\n| `iterative` | New process per turn, accumulate history | CLI is stateless |\n\n## Pre-built Schemas\n\nTested schemas are available in [schemas/](schemas/):\n\n| Schema | Agent | Mode | Auth Env Var | Status |\n|--------|-------|------|--------------|--------|\n| `claude-headless.json` | Claude Code | stream | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Tested |\n| `gemini-headless.json` | Gemini CLI | iterative | `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Tested |\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n# Claude Code\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/claude-headless.json\n\n# Gemini CLI\nGEMINI_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/gemini-headless.json\n```\n\n## Creating a Schema\n\n1. Explore the CLI''s `--help` to identify prompt, output, and auto-approve flags\n2. Capture sample JSON output from the CLI\n3. Map JSONPath patterns to output events\n4. Create schema file based on an existing template\n5. Test with `headless` command\n\nSee [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) for the complete workflow.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Likely Cause | Solution |\n|-------|--------------|----------|\n| Tool calls not captured | JSONPath not iterating arrays | Use `[*]` wildcard syntax - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#tool-calls-not-appearing) |\n| \"unexpected argument\" error | Stdin mode misconfigured | Use `stdin: true` - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#stdin-mode-issues) |\n| 401 Authentication errors | API key not properly configured | Set the correct API key environment variable (see Pre-built Schemas table) |\n| Timeout on prompt | JSONPath not matching | Capture raw CLI output, verify paths - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#jsonpath-debugging) |\n| Empty responses | Content extraction failing | Check extract paths - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#output-event-matching) |\n\n**Complete troubleshooting documentation:** [Troubleshooting Guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md)\n\n## External Resources\n\n- **AgentSkills Spec**: [agentskills.io](https://agentskills.io)\n\n## Related\n\n- **[agent-eval-harness skill](../agent-eval-harness/SKILL.md)** - Running evaluations against adapters\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:30.559Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","zh":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","ja":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","ko":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","es":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","fr":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","de":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","pt":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","ru":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters.","ar":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing seamless integration with JSON schema-driven adapters."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","zh":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","ja":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","ko":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","es":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","fr":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","de":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","pt":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","ru":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides.","ar":"Empowers agents to interact with headless CLI agents using schema-driven adapters, providing a no-code solution with JSON schema definition, enabling tools like `headless` command and schema creation guides."},"useCases":{"en":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"zh":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"ja":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"ko":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"es":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"fr":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"de":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"pt":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"ru":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"],"ar":["Wrapping headless CLI agents for automated interactions","Creating new schemas for customized adapters","Running adapters with predefined JSON schemas"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"zh":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"ja":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"ko":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"es":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"fr":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"de":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"pt":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"ru":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"],"ar":["Requires JSON schema definition","Limited to headless CLI agents"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
