крытый Источник AI Движка Контента","ar":"مصادق نطاق: محرك مفتوح المصدر للمحتوى الإصطناعي","en":"scope-validator"},"description":{"zh":"Scope Validator是开源AI内容引擎，帮助开发者确定功能的范围并进行合理的决策","ja":"Scope ValidatorはオープンソースAIコンテンツエンジンであり、開発者が機能の範囲を決定し、合理な決定を下せるようにサポートします","ko":"Scope Validator는 오픈소스 AI 콘텐츠 엔진으로 개발자가 기능의 범위를 결정하고 합리적인 결정을 내리는 것을 도와줍니다","es":"El validador de alcance es una herramienta de motor de contenido AI de código abierto que ayuda a determinar el ámbito de nuevas características y nodos en p...","fr":"Le validateur de portée est un moteur de contenu AI open source qui aide à déterminer la portée de nouvelles fonctionnalités et de nouveaux nœuds dans les pr...","de":"Der Scope-Validator ist eine Open-Source-AI-Inhalts-Engine, die hilft, den Umfang neuer Funktionen und Knoten in Projekten zu bestimmen","pt":"O Validador de Escopo é uma ferramenta de motor de conteúdo de IA que ajuda a determinar o escopo de recursos e funcionalidades no desenvolvimento de software","ru":"Валидатор Области - это инструмент движка контента ИИ, который помогает определить область действия ресурсов и функций при разработке программного обеспечения","ar":"مصادق النطاق هو أداة لمحرك المحتوى الإصطناعي التي تساعد في تحديد نطاق الموارد والخصائص في تطوير البرمجيات","en":"Open source AI content engine"},"definition":{"en":"Open source AI content engine"},"features":{"zh":["确定功能的范围","进行合理的决策","支持功能请求的分类","支持PR审查","支持社交发布和RSS功能"],"ja":["機能の範囲を決定する","合理な決定を下す","機能リクエストのトライアージをサポートする","PRレビューをサポートする","ソーシャル発行とRSS機能をサポートする"],"ko":["기능의 범위를 결정","합리적인 결정을 내리기","기능 요청의 분류를 지원","PR審查를 지원","소셜 발행 및 RSS 기능을 지원"],"es":["Determina el ámbito de nuevas características y nodos","Ayuda en la revisión de solicitudes de extracción para cumplimiento de alcance","Proporciona orientación para la publicación social y las características de RSS o feed","Facilita la toma de decisiones sobre la ubicación de características y nodos","Integra con otros habilidades para un flujo de trabajo más eficiente"],"fr":["Détermine la portée de nouvelles fonctionnalités et de nouveaux nœuds","Aide à la révision des demandes d''extraction pour la conformité de portée","Fournit des conseils pour la publication sociale et les fonctionnalités de RSS ou de flux","Facilite la prise de décision sur l''emplacement des fonctionnalités et des nœuds","Intègre avec d''autres compétences pour un flux de travail plus efficace"],"de":["Bestimmt den Umfang neuer Funktionen und Knoten","Hilft bei der Überprüfung von Pull-Requests für Scope-Compliance","Bietet Anleitung für soziales Publizieren und RSS- oder Feed-Funktionen","Erleichtert die Entscheidungsfindung über den Standort von Funktionen und Knoten","Integriert mit anderen Fähigkeiten für einen effizienteren Workflow"],"pt":["Determina o escopo de recursos e funcionalidades","Ajuda na triagem de solicitações de recursos","Valida a conformidade com o escopo","Fornece orientação para contribuições de código","Integração com outros instrumentos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Определяет область действия ресурсов и функций","Помогает в тренировке запросов на функции","Проверяет соответствие области","Предоставляет руководство для вклада кода","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["يحدد نطاق الموارد والخصائص","يساعد في فرز الطلبات الميزات","يؤكد مطابقة النطاق","يوفر إرشادات للمساهمات في الكود","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Scope Validator","开源AI内容引擎","功能范围","决策","功能请求","PR审查","社交发布","RSS"],"ja":["Scope Validator","オープンソースAIコンテンツエンジン","機能の範囲","決定","機能リクエスト","PRレビュー","ソーシャル発行","RSS"],"ko":["Scope Validator","오픈소스 AI 콘텐츠 엔진","기능 범위","결정","기능 요청","PR審查","소셜 발행","RSS"],"es":["validador de alcance","motor de contenido AI","desarrollo de software","código abierto","gestión de proyectos","publicación social","RSS","feed","revisión de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["validateur de portée","moteur de contenu AI","développement de logiciels","code open source","gestion de projets","publication sociale","RSS","flux","révision des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Scope-Validator","AI-Inhalts-Engine","Software-Entwicklung","Open-Source-Code","Projektmanagement","soziales Publizieren","RSS","Feed","Überprüfung von Pull-Requests"],"pt":["validador de escopo","motor de conteúdo de IA","desenvolvimento de software","escopo de recursos","conformidade com o escopo","contribuições de código","integração com outros instrumentos"],"ru":["валидатор области","движка контента ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","область действия ресурсов","соответствие области","вклад кода","интеграция с другими инструментами"],"ar":["مصادق نطاق","محرك المحتوى الإصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","نطاق الموارد","مطابقة النطاق","المساهمات في الكود","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]}},"owner":"genfeedai","repo":"core","repoPath":"genfeedai/core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scope-validator","description":"Validate feature requests against Genfeed OSS core vs Cloud scope. Helps users and contributors understand whether a feature belongs in the open-source core (submit PR) or Cloud SaaS (subscribe).","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Scope Validator\n\n## Routing\n\n**USE this skill when:**\n- User asks \"should this be in core or cloud?\"\n- User wants to contribute a new node or feature\n- User requests social publishing, RSS, or feed features\n- Feature request triage or PR review for scope compliance\n\n**DO NOT use this skill when:**\n- User already knows where the feature belongs and wants to build it -> Use `node-creator`, `react-flow`, etc.\n- User wants infrastructure details -> Use `infra-reference`\n- User wants to fix a bug -","body":"# Scope Validator\n\n## Routing\n\n**USE this skill when:**\n- User asks \"should this be in core or cloud?\"\n- User wants to contribute a new node or feature\n- User requests social publishing, RSS, or feed features\n- Feature request triage or PR review for scope compliance\n\n**DO NOT use this skill when:**\n- User already knows where the feature belongs and wants to build it -> Use `node-creator`, `react-flow`, etc.\n- User wants infrastructure details -> Use `infra-reference`\n- User wants to fix a bug -> Use `bugfix`\n\n**Expected outputs:**\n- OSS Core vs Cloud SaaS classification\n- List of Cloud-only nodes/features/providers involved\n- OSS alternative suggestions when applicable\n\nHelps users and contributors understand whether a feature belongs in:\n\n- **OSS Core** → Submit a PR or feature request to [genfeedai/core](https://github.com/genfeedai/core)\n- **Cloud SaaS** → Subscribe at [genfeed.ai/cloud](https://genfeed.ai/cloud)\n\n## OSS Core Scope\n\n### Included Nodes (26 total)\n\n#### Input Nodes (5)\n\n| Node | Type | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| Image Input | `imageInput` | Upload or reference an image |\n| Audio Input | `audioInput` | Upload an audio file (MP3, WAV) |\n| Video Input | `videoInput` | Upload or reference a video file |\n| Prompt | `prompt` | Text prompt for AI generation |\n| Template | `template` | Preset prompt template |\n\n#### AI Nodes (7)\n\n| Node | Type | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| Image Generator | `imageGen` | Generate images with nano-banana models |\n| Video Generator | `videoGen` | Generate videos with veo-3.1 models |\n| LLM | `llm` | Generate text with meta-llama |\n| Lip Sync | `lipSync` | Generate talking-head video from image/video and audio |\n| Voice Change | `voiceChange` | Replace or mix audio track in a video |\n| Text to Speech | `textToSpeech` | Convert text to natural-sounding speech |\n| Transcribe | `transcribe` | Convert video or audio to text transcript |\n\n#### Processing Nodes (12)\n\n| Node | Type | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| Resize | `resize` | Resize media to different aspect ratios using Luma AI |\n| Animation | `animation` | Apply easing curve to video |\n| Video Stitch | `videoStitch` | Concatenate multiple videos |\n| Video Trim | `videoTrim` | Trim video to a specific time range |\n| Frame Extract | `videoFrameExtract` | Extract a specific frame from video as image |\n| Luma Reframe Image | `lumaReframeImage` | AI-powered image outpainting |\n| Luma Reframe Video | `lumaReframeVideo` | AI-powered video reframing |\n| Topaz Image Upscale | `topazImageUpscale` | AI-powered image upscaling with face enhancement |\n| Topaz Video Upscale | `topazVideoUpscale` | AI-powered video upscaling to 4K |\n| Grid Split | `imageGridSplit` | Split image into grid cells |\n| Annotation | `annotation` | Add shapes, arrows, and text to images |\n| Subtitle | `subtitle` | Burn subtitles into video using FFmpeg |\n\n#### Output Nodes (2)\n\n| Node | Type | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| Output | `output` | Final workflow output |\n| Preview | `preview` | Preview media with playback controls |\n\n### Cloud-Only Nodes (EXCLUDED from OSS)\n\n| Node | Type | Reason |\n|------|------|--------|\n| Social Publish | `socialPublish` | Requires OAuth integrations for 7 platforms |\n| RSS Input | `rssInput` | Content aggregation is Cloud feature |\n| Tweet Input | `tweetInput` | Twitter API dependency, feed feature |\n| Tweet Remix | `tweetRemix` | Depends on tweet input, social-focused |\n\n### Cloud-Only Features (EXCLUDED from OSS)\n\n| Feature | Reason |\n|---------|--------|\n| Telegram Bot | Managed bot requiring public infrastructure |\n| Webhook triggers | Requires publicly reachable endpoints |\n| Scheduled execution | Cron-based scheduling is Cloud infrastructure |\n| CLI | Removed from core scope |\n| SDK | Removed from core scope |\n\n### Cloud-Only Providers (EXCLUDED from OSS)\n\n| Provider | Reason |\n|----------|--------|\n| FAL.ai | Cloud-only provider |\n| HuggingFace | Cloud-only provider |\n\n**OSS Provider:** Replicate only\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Rule 1: Node Type Check\n\n```\nIF node.type IN [socialPublish, rssInput, tweetInput, tweetRemix]\nTHEN FAIL: \"Node type ''{node.type}'' is Cloud-only. Use OSS alternatives or upgrade to Cloud.\"\n```\n\n### Rule 2: Provider Check\n\n```\nIF node.provider IN [fal, huggingface]\nTHEN FAIL: \"Provider ''{node.provider}'' is Cloud-only. OSS only supports Replicate.\"\n```\n\n### Rule 3: Template Check\n\n```\nIF template contains Cloud-only nodes\nTHEN FAIL: \"Template uses Cloud-only nodes. Remove: {cloud_nodes}\"\n```\n\n### Rule 4: Feature Request Check\n\n```\nIF request mentions [publish, social, twitter, rss, feed, youtube upload]\nTHEN WARN: \"Social publishing and feed features are Cloud-only.\"\n```\n\n### Rule 5: Bot/Trigger Check\n\n```\nIF request mentions [telegram, bot, webhook trigger, cron, scheduled, external trigger]\nTHEN FAIL: \"Bot and trigger integrations are Cloud-only. Core workflows are triggered from the UI only.\"\n```\n\n## Validation Examples\n\n### Valid OSS Workflow\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    { \"type\": \"prompt\" },\n    { \"type\": \"imageGen\" },\n    { \"type\": \"videoGen\" },\n    { \"type\": \"subtitle\" },\n    { \"type\": \"output\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n✅ All nodes are within OSS scope.\n\n### Invalid OSS Workflow\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    { \"type\": \"rssInput\" },\n    { \"type\": \"tweetRemix\" },\n    { \"type\": \"socialPublish\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n❌ Contains Cloud-only nodes: `rssInput`, `tweetRemix`, `socialPublish`\n\n## Response Templates\n\n### When Cloud Feature Requested\n\n```\nThe feature you''re requesting ({feature}) is available in Genfeed Cloud.\n\nOSS Core includes:\n- 26 nodes for media generation and processing\n- Replicate provider for AI models\n- Visual workflow editor with queue-based execution\n- Gallery asset management\n\nFor social publishing and content aggregation features,\nconsider upgrading to Genfeed Cloud: https://genfeed.ai/cloud\n```\n\n### When Suggesting Alternatives\n\n```\nInstead of {cloud_feature}, consider these OSS alternatives:\n\n1. {alternative_1}\n2. {alternative_2}\n\nThese achieve similar results within the OSS scope.\n```\n\n## Common Requests & Responses\n\n### \"Can I publish to YouTube?\"\n\n**Response:** Social publishing is Cloud-only. In OSS, use the `output` node to export your video, then manually upload to YouTube.\n\n### \"Can I fetch RSS feeds?\"\n\n**Response:** RSS/feed aggregation is Cloud-only. In OSS, use the `prompt` node with manually entered content, or the `template` node with predefined prompts.\n\n### \"Can I use FAL.ai models?\"\n\n**Response:** FAL.ai is Cloud-only. OSS uses Replicate provider. Check if the model you need is available on Replicate.\n\n### \"Can I remix tweets?\"\n\n**Response:** Tweet remix is Cloud-only. In OSS, use the `llm` node with a custom prompt to rewrite text in different tones.\n\n### \"Can I trigger workflows from Telegram?\"\n\n**Response:** Telegram bot integration is Cloud-only. In OSS, workflows are triggered manually from the web UI. Cloud provides a managed Telegram bot at `cloud/apps/server/api/src/services/telegram-bot/`.\n\n### \"Can I set up webhook triggers?\"\n\n**Response:** Webhook triggers are Cloud-only. Core runs on localhost where external services can''t reach it without tunnels. In OSS, trigger workflows from the web UI.\n\n## Integration\n\nWhen validating:\n\n1. **Parse the request** - Identify node types, providers, and features mentioned\n2. **Check against scope** - Compare with OSS node list\n3. **Report violations** - List all Cloud-only features found\n4. **Suggest alternatives** - Provide OSS workarounds when possible\n5. **Link to Cloud** - Mention upgrade path for full feature access\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```\nOSS Node Types (26):\n  Input:      imageInput, audioInput, videoInput, prompt, template\n  AI:         imageGen, videoGen, llm, lipSync, voiceChange, textToSpeech, transcribe\n  Processing: resize, animation, videoStitch, videoTrim, videoFrameExtract,\n              lumaReframeImage, lumaReframeVideo, topazImageUpscale,\n              topazVideoUpscale, imageGridSplit, annotation, subtitle\n  Output:     output, preview\n\nCloud-Only Nodes (4):\n  socialPublish, rssInput, tweetInput, tweetRemix\n\nCloud-Only Features:\n  telegramBot, webhookTriggers, scheduledExecution, cli, sdk\n\nTriggers:\n  UI only (no webhooks, no bots, no scheduled)\n\nOSS Provider:\n  replicate (only)\n\nCloud Providers:\n  fal, huggingface\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:34.056Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","zh":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","ja":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","ko":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","es":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","fr":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","de":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing to validate feature requests and determine scope compliance for core or cloud contributions."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","zh":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","ja":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","ko":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","es":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","fr":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","de":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","pt":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","ru":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features.","ar":"Empowers agents to triage feature requests, review pull requests for scope compliance, and determine the appropriate placement of new nodes or features using routing and social publishing protocols like RSS or feed features."},"useCases":{"en":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"zh":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"ja":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"ko":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"es":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"fr":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"de":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"pt":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"ru":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"],"ar":["Triageing feature requests for scope compliance","Reviewing pull requests for core or cloud contributions","Determining the appropriate placement of new nodes or features"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"zh":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"ja":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"ko":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"es":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"fr":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"de":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"pt":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"ru":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"],"ar":["Not suitable for users who already know where the feature belongs","Does not provide infrastructure details","Not intended for bug fixing"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('farmanlab/ai_agent_orchestra/extracting-interactions', 'community', 'farmanlab', 'ai_agent_orchestra', 'farmanlab/ai_agent_orchestra', 'extracting-interactions', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:26:00.982Z', NULL, '{"id":"farmanlab/ai_agent_orchestra/extracting-interactions","name":"extracting-interactions","description":{"zh":"交互作用提取技能是一种自动从Figma设计中提取交互作用规范的技术，支持组件状态、过渡定义、触发器整理和屏幕过渡规范等功能。","ja":"extracting-interactionsスキルは、Figmaデザインからインタラクション仕様を自動抽出する技術です。コンポーネント状態、トランジション定義、トリガー整理、画面遷移仕様などをサポートします。","ko":"상호작용 추출 기술은 피그마 디자인에서 상호작용 규격을 자동으로 추출하는 기술입니다. 컴포넌트 상태, 전환 정의, 트리거 정리, 화면 전환 규격 등을 지원합니다.","es":"Esta habilidad extrae especificaciones de interacción de diseños Figma, incluyendo estados de componentes y transiciones.","fr":"Cette compétence extrait les spécifications d''interaction des conceptions Figma, y compris les états des composants et les transitions.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit extrahiert Interaktionsspezifikationen aus Figma-Designs, einschließlich Komponentenzuständen und Übergängen.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"交互作用提取技能 - Figma设计自动化","ja":"extracting-interactionsスキル - フィガデザインからのインタラクション抽出","ko":"상호작용 추출 기술 - 피그마 디자인 자동화","es":"Extraer interacciones de Figma","fr":"Extraction d''interactions à partir de Figma","de":"Interaktionen aus Figma extrahieren","en":"extracting-interactions"},"description":{"zh":"交互作用提取技能是一种自动从Figma设计中提取交互作用规范的技术，支持组件状态、过渡定义、触发器整理和屏幕过渡规范等功能。","ja":"extracting-interactionsスキルは、Figmaデザインからインタラクション仕様を自動抽出する技術です。コンポーネント状態、トランジション定義、トリガー整理、画面遷移仕様などをサポートします。","ko":"상호작용 추출 기술은 피그마 디자인에서 상호작용 규격을 자동으로 추출하는 기술입니다. 컴포넌트 상태, 전환 정의, 트리거 정리, 화면 전환 규격 등을 지원합니다.","es":"Esta habilidad extrae especificaciones de interacción de diseños Figma, incluyendo estados de componentes y transiciones.","fr":"Cette compétence extrait les spécifications d''interaction des conceptions Figma, y compris les états des composants et les transitions.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit extrahiert Interaktionsspezifikationen aus Figma-Designs, einschließlich Komponentenzuständen und Übergängen.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["组件状态抽取（hover、active、disabled、focused等）","过渡定义","触发器整理","屏幕过渡规范"],"ja":["コンポーネント状態の抽出（hover、active、disabled、focused等）","トランジション定義","トリガー整理","画面遷移仕様"],"ko":["컴포넌트 상태 추출（호버, 액티브, 비활성화, 포커스 등）","전환 정의","트리거 정리","화면 전환 규격"],"es":["Extracción de estados de componentes","Definición de transiciones","Organización de desencadenadores","Especificaciones de transición de pantalla"],"fr":["Extraction des états de composants","Définition des transitions","Organisation des déclencheurs","Spécifications de transition d''écran"],"de":["Extraktion von Komponentenzuständen","Definition von Übergängen","Organisation von Auslösern","Bildschirmübergangsspezifikationen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["交互作用提取","Figma设计自动化","组件状态","过渡定义","触发器整理","屏幕过渡规范"],"ja":["extracting-interactions","Figmaデザイン自動化","コンポーネント状態","トランジション定義","トリガー整理","画面遷移仕様"],"ko":["상호작용 추출","피그마 디자인 자동화","컴포넌트 상태","전환 정의","트리거 정리","화면 전환 규격"],"es":["extracción de interacciones","diseño de Figma","especificaciones de interacción","estados de componentes","transiciones","desencadenadores","transición de pantalla"],"fr":["extraction d''interactions","conception Figma","spécifications d''interaction","états de composants","transitions","déclencheurs","transition d''écran"],"de":["Interaktionsextraktion","Figma-Design","Interaktionsspezifikationen","Komponentenzustände","Übergänge","Auslöser","Bildschirmübergang"]}},"owner":"farmanlab","repo":"ai_agent_orchestra","repoPath":"farmanlab/ai_agent_orchestra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"extracting-interactions","description":"Extracts interaction specifications from Figma designs (hover states, transitions, animations, triggers). Updates the インタラクション section in screen spec.md.","bodyPreview":"# Interaction Extraction Skill\n\nFigmaデザインからインタラクション仕様（hover状態、遷移、アニメーション、トリガー）を抽出するスキルです。\n\n## 目次\n\n1. [概要](#概要)\n2. [対象範囲](#対象範囲)\n3. [クイックスタート](#クイックスタート)\n4. [詳細ガイド](#詳細ガイド)\n5. [出力形式](#出力形式)\n\n## 概要\n\nこのスキルは以下のタスクをサポートします：\n\n1. **コンポーネント状態の抽出**: hover, active, disabled, focused等\n2. **トランジション定義**: 状態間のアニメーション仕様\n3. **トリガー整理**: ユーザー操作と対応するアクション\n4. **画面遷移仕様**: ナビゲーションとアニメーション\n\n## 禁止事項\n\n**以下は絶対に行わないこと：**\n- 実装コードの生成（CSS/JS/Swift等）\n- アニメーションライブラリの提案（Framer Motion/GSAP等）\n- 技術スタック固有の実装詳細\n\nこのスキルの目的は「どのようなインタラク","body":"# Interaction Extraction Skill\n\nFigmaデザインからインタラクション仕様（hover状態、遷移、アニメーション、トリガー）を抽出するスキルです。\n\n## 目次\n\n1. [概要](#概要)\n2. [対象範囲](#対象範囲)\n3. [クイックスタート](#クイックスタート)\n4. [詳細ガイド](#詳細ガイド)\n5. [出力形式](#出力形式)\n\n## 概要\n\nこのスキルは以下のタスクをサポートします：\n\n1. **コンポーネント状態の抽出**: hover, active, disabled, focused等\n2. **トランジション定義**: 状態間のアニメーション仕様\n3. **トリガー整理**: ユーザー操作と対応するアクション\n4. **画面遷移仕様**: ナビゲーションとアニメーション\n\n## 禁止事項\n\n**以下は絶対に行わないこと：**\n- 実装コードの生成（CSS/JS/Swift等）\n- アニメーションライブラリの提案（Framer Motion/GSAP等）\n- 技術スタック固有の実装詳細\n\nこのスキルの目的は「どのようなインタラクションがあるか」の**情報整理のみ**です。\n\n## 対象範囲\n\n### このスキルで扱うもの（コンポーネントレベル）\n\n- ボタンの hover / active / disabled 状態\n- 入力フィールドの focus / error / filled 状態\n- カードの hover エフェクト\n- トグル / チェックボックスの on/off\n- アコーディオンの展開/折りたたみ\n- タブの選択状態\n- ドロップダウンの開閉\n- モーダル/ダイアログの表示/非表示\n- ツールチップの表示\n\n### documenting-ui-states で扱うもの（画面レベル）\n\n- 画面全体の loading / error / empty 状態\n- API通信に伴う画面状態変化\n\n## 出力先\n\nこのスキルは**画面仕様書（spec.md）の「インタラクション」セクション**を更新します。\n\n```\n.outputs/{screen-id}/\n├── spec.md                 # ← このスキルが「インタラクション」セクションを更新\n├── index.html              # 参照用HTML\n└── assets/\n```\n\n## クイックスタート\n\n### 基本的な使い方\n\n```\n以下のFigma画面のインタラクション仕様を抽出してください：\nhttps://figma.com/design/XXXXX/Project?node-id=1234-5678\n```\n\nエージェントは自動的に：\n1. コンポーネントバリアントを検出\n2. 状態変化のパターンを整理\n3. トリガーとアクションを文書化\n4. **spec.md の「インタラクション」セクションを更新**\n\n## 詳細ガイド\n\n詳細な情報は以下のファイルを参照してください：\n\n- **[workflow.md](references/workflow.md)**: インタラクション抽出のワークフロー\n- **[interaction-patterns.md](references/interaction-patterns.md)**: 一般的なインタラクションパターン\n- **[section-template.md](references/section-template.md)**: セクション出力テンプレート\n\n## Workflow\n\nインタラクション抽出時にこのチェックリストをコピー：\n\n```\nInteraction Extraction Progress:\n- [ ] Step 0: spec.md の存在確認\n- [ ] Step 1: インタラクティブ要素を特定\n- [ ] Step 2: コンポーネントバリアントを検出\n- [ ] Step 3: 状態変化を整理\n- [ ] Step 4: トリガーとアクションを文書化\n- [ ] Step 5: トランジション/アニメーションを整理\n- [ ] Step 6: 画面遷移を整理\n- [ ] Step 7: spec.md の「インタラクション」セクションを更新\n```\n\n### Step 0: spec.md の存在確認\n\n```bash\n# 確認\nls .outputs/{screen-id}/spec.md\n\n# なければテンプレートから初期化\ncp .agents/templates/screen-spec.md .outputs/{screen-id}/spec.md\n```\n\n### Step 1: インタラクティブ要素を特定\n\nHTMLまたはFigmaから以下を抽出：\n\n- ボタン（button, a[role=\"button\"]）\n- リンク（a）\n- 入力フィールド（input, textarea, select）\n- インタラクティブカード\n- タブ、アコーディオン\n- トグル、チェックボックス、ラジオ\n\n### Step 2: コンポーネントバリアントを検出\n\nFigmaコンポーネントのバリアントプロパティを確認：\n\n```\nButton\n├── State=Default\n├── State=Hover\n├── State=Pressed\n├── State=Disabled\n└── State=Loading\n```\n\n### Step 3: 状態変化を整理\n\n各コンポーネントの状態遷移を文書化：\n\n| 要素 | From | To | トリガー |\n|------|------|-----|----------|\n| 送信ボタン | default | hover | マウスオーバー |\n| 送信ボタン | hover | pressed | クリック |\n| 送信ボタン | pressed | loading | クリック完了 |\n\n### Step 4: トリガーとアクションを文書化\n\n| トリガー | 対象 | アクション |\n|----------|------|-----------|\n| クリック | 送信ボタン | フォーム送信 |\n| クリック | 講座カード | 詳細画面へ遷移 |\n| ホバー | カード | 影を強調 |\n\n### Step 5: トランジション/アニメーションを整理\n\n| 要素 | プロパティ | 値 | duration | easing |\n|------|-----------|-----|----------|--------|\n| ボタン | background-color | #0070e0 → #005bb5 | 150ms | ease-out |\n| カード | box-shadow | 0 2px 4px → 0 4px 12px | 200ms | ease |\n| モーダル | opacity | 0 → 1 | 300ms | ease-in-out |\n\n### Step 6: 画面遷移を整理\n\n| 起点 | アクション | 遷移先 | アニメーション |\n|------|----------|--------|---------------|\n| 講座一覧 | カードクリック | 講座詳細 | push (右からスライド) |\n| 講座詳細 | 戻るボタン | 講座一覧 | pop (左へスライド) |\n| 任意 | ログインボタン | ログインモーダル | fade + scale |\n\n### Step 7: spec.md の「インタラクション」セクションを更新\n\n1. セクションを特定（`## インタラクション`）\n2. ステータスを「完了 ✓」に更新\n3. `{{INTERACTIONS_CONTENT}}` を内容に置換\n4. 完了チェックリストを更新\n5. 変更履歴に追記\n\n## 出力形式\n\n### spec.md「インタラクション」セクションの内容\n\n```markdown\n## インタラクション\n\n> **ステータス**: 完了 ✓  \n> **生成スキル**: extracting-interactions  \n> **更新日**: 2024-01-15\n\n### インタラクティブ要素一覧\n\n| 要素 | 種別 | 状態数 | 備考 |\n|------|------|--------|------|\n| 送信ボタン | button | 5 | default/hover/pressed/disabled/loading |\n| 講座カード | card | 2 | default/hover |\n| メールフィールド | input | 4 | default/focus/filled/error |\n\n### コンポーネント状態\n\n#### 送信ボタン\n\n| 状態 | 視覚変化 | Figma Node |\n|------|----------|------------|\n| default | 背景 #0070e0, テキスト白 | `1234:5678` |\n| hover | 背景 #005bb5 | `1234:5679` |\n| pressed | scale(0.98) | `1234:5680` |\n| disabled | opacity 0.5 | `1234:5681` |\n| loading | スピナー表示, テキスト非表示 | `1234:5682` |\n\n#### 講座カード\n\n| 状態 | 視覚変化 | Figma Node |\n|------|----------|------------|\n| default | shadow: 0 2px 4px | `2345:6789` |\n| hover | shadow: 0 4px 12px, translateY(-2px) | `2345:6790` |\n\n### トリガーとアクション\n\n| トリガー | 対象要素 | アクション | 条件 |\n|----------|----------|-----------|------|\n| click | 送信ボタン | フォーム送信 | バリデーション成功時 |\n| click | 講座カード | 詳細画面へ遷移 | - |\n| hover | 講座カード | 影を強調 | - |\n| focus | メールフィールド | ボーダー色変更 | - |\n| blur | メールフィールド | バリデーション実行 | - |\n\n### トランジション仕様\n\n| 要素 | プロパティ | duration | easing | 備考 |\n|------|-----------|----------|--------|------|\n| ボタン | background-color | 150ms | ease-out | hover時 |\n| ボタン | transform | 100ms | ease | pressed時 |\n| カード | box-shadow, transform | 200ms | ease | hover時 |\n| モーダル | opacity | 300ms | ease-in-out | 表示/非表示 |\n\n### 画面遷移\n\n| 起点 | アクション | 遷移先 | アニメーション |\n|------|----------|--------|---------------|\n| この画面 | カードクリック | 講座詳細 | push (右からスライド) |\n| この画面 | 戻るボタン | 前の画面 | pop (左へスライド) |\n\n### 特記事項\n\n- ボタンのloading状態はAPI通信中に表示\n- カードホバーはタッチデバイスでは無効化推奨\n```\n\n## 完了チェックリスト\n\n生成後、以下を確認：\n\n```\n- [ ] spec.md の「インタラクション」セクションが更新されている\n- [ ] ステータスが「完了 ✓」になっている\n- [ ] 全てのインタラクティブ要素がリストされている\n- [ ] 各要素の状態が網羅されている\n- [ ] トリガーとアクションが明確\n- [ ] トランジション仕様が記載されている\n- [ ] 完了チェックリストが更新されている\n- [ ] 変更履歴に記録が追加されている\n```\n\n## 注意事項\n\n### 他のセクションを変更しない\n\nこのスキルは「インタラクション」セクションのみを更新します。\n\n### documenting-ui-states との違い\n\n| 観点 | documenting-ui-states | extracting-interactions |\n|------|----------------------|------------------------|\n| 対象 | 画面全体の状態 | コンポーネントの状態 |\n| 例 | loading, error, empty | hover, pressed, focus |\n| トリガー | APIレスポンス等 | ユーザー操作 |\n\n### Figmaプロトタイプの活用\n\nFigmaプロトタイプが設定されている場合、以下を確認：\n\n- インタラクショントリガー（On Click, On Hover等）\n- アニメーション設定（Duration, Easing）\n- 遷移先フレーム\n\n## 参照\n\n- **[workflow.md](references/workflow.md)**: 詳細なワークフロー\n- **[interaction-patterns.md](references/interaction-patterns.md)**: インタラクションパターン集\n- **[section-template.md](references/section-template.md)**: セクション出力テンプレート\n- **[managing-screen-specs](../managing-screen-specs/SKILL.md)**: 仕様書管理スキル\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:26:00.982Z","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jackychenlu/skill-demo/songsee', 'community', 'jackychenlu', 'skill-demo', 'jackychenlu/skill-demo', 'songsee', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z', '2026-02-19T07:25:43.757Z', NULL, '{"id":"jackychenlu/skill-demo/songsee","name":"songsee","description":{"zh":"songsee","ja":"songsee","ko":"songsee","es":"songsee es una herramienta que genera espectrogramas y paneles de características de audio. Permite una configuración personalizada y admite varias opciones de visualización.","fr":"songsee est un outil qui génère des spectrogrammes et des panneaux de caractéristiques audio. Il offre une configuration personnalisable et prend en charge plusieurs options de visualisation.","de":"songsee ist ein Tool, das Audio-Spektrogramme und -Eigenschaftspaneelen erzeugt. Es bietet eine anpassbare Konfiguration und unterstützt mehrere Visualisierungsoptionen.","pt":"O songsee é uma ferramenta para gerar espectrogramas e painéis de recursos de áudio. Ele oferece opções de personalização e suporte a vários formatos de saída.","ru":"Songsee - это инструмент для генерации спектрограмм и панелей функций аудио. Он предлагает варианты настройки и поддержку нескольких форматов вывода.","ar":"songsee هي أداة لإنشاء مخططات طيفية ولوحات ميزات الصوت. توفر خيارات přizpůsobení ودعمًا لمجموعة من صيغ الإخراج.","en":"skill-demo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"songseeskill","ja":"songsee","ko":"songsee","es":"songsee: Generación de Espectrogramas de Audio","fr":"songsee: Génération de Spectrogrammes Audio","de":"songsee: Erstellung von Audio-Spektrogrammen","pt":"songsee: Geração de Espectrogramas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"songsee: Генерация Спектрограмм для Разработчиков","ar":"songsee: إنشاء مخططات طيفية للمطورين","en":"songsee"},"description":{"zh":"songsee","ja":"songsee","ko":"songsee","es":"songsee es una herramienta que genera espectrogramas y paneles de características de audio. Permite una configuración personalizada y admite varias opciones ...","fr":"songsee est un outil qui génère des spectrogrammes et des panneaux de caractéristiques audio. Il offre une configuration personnalisable et prend en charge p...","de":"songsee ist ein Tool, das Audio-Spektrogramme und -Eigenschaftspaneelen erzeugt. Es bietet eine anpassbare Konfiguration und unterstützt mehrere Visualisieru...","pt":"O songsee é uma ferramenta para gerar espectrogramas e painéis de recursos de áudio. Ele oferece opções de personalização e suporte a vários formatos de saída.","ru":"Songsee - это инструмент для генерации спектрограмм и панелей функций аудио. Он предлагает варианты настройки и поддержку нескольких форматов вывода.","ar":"songsee هي أداة لإنشاء مخططات طيفية ولوحات ميزات الصوت. توفر خيارات přizpůsobení ودعمًا لمجموعة من صيغ الإخراج.","en":"skill-demo"},"definition":{"en":"skill-demo"},"features":{"zh":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"ja":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"ko":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"es":["Generación de espectrogramas de audio","Paneles de características personalizables","Opciones de visualización avanzadas","Compatibilidad con varios formatos de archivo","Interfaz de línea de comandos intuitiva"],"fr":["Génération de spectrogrammes audio","Panneaux de caractéristiques personnalisables","Options de visualisation avancées","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de fichiers","Interface de ligne de commande intuitive"],"de":["Erstellung von Audio-Spektrogrammen","Anpassbare Eigenschaftspaneelen","Erweiterte Visualisierungsoptionen","Unterstützung für verschiedene Dateiformate","Intuitive Kommandozeilenoberfläche"],"pt":["Geração de espectrogramas","Suporte a vários formatos de saída","Opções de personalização","Suporte a entrada de áudio via stdin","Geração de painéis de recursos de áudio"],"ru":["Генерация спектрограмм","Поддержка нескольких форматов вывода","Варианты настройки","Поддержка ввода аудио через stdin","Генерация панелей функций аудио"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات طيفية","دعم لمجموعة من صيغ الإخراج","خيارات přizpůsobení","دعم إدخال الصوت عبر stdin","إنشاء لوحات ميزات الصوت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"ja":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"ko":["songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee","songsee"],"es":["songsee","espectrogramas de audio","paneles de características","visualización de audio","herramientas de audio","desarrollo de audio"],"fr":["songsee","spectrogrammes audio","panneaux de caractéristiques","visualisation audio","outils audio","développement audio"],"de":["songsee","Audio-Spektrogramme","Eigenschaftspaneelen","Audio-Visualisierung","Audio-Tools","Audio-Entwicklung"],"pt":["songsee","espectrogramas","áudio","desenvolvimento","ferramentas de linha de comando","processamento de áudio","análise de áudio"],"ru":["songsee","спектрограммы","аудио","разработка","утилиты командной строки","обработка аудио","анализ аудио"],"ar":["songsee","مخططات طيفية","صوت","تطوير","أدوات سطر الأوامر","معالجة الصوت","تحليل الصوت"]}},"owner":"jackychenlu","repo":"skill-demo","repoPath":"jackychenlu/skill-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"songsee","description":"Generate spectrograms and feature-panel visualizations from audio with the songsee CLI.","bodyPreview":"# songsee\n\nGenerate spectrograms + feature panels from audio.\n\nQuick start\n\n- Spectrogram: `songsee track.mp3`\n- Multi-panel: `songsee track.mp3 --viz spectrogram,mel,chroma,hpss,selfsim,loudness,tempogram,mfcc,flux`\n- Time slice: `songsee track.mp3 --start 12.5 --duration 8 -o slice.jpg`\n- Stdin: `cat track.mp3 | songsee - --format png -o out.png`\n\nCommon flags\n\n- `--viz` list (repeatable or comma-separated)\n- `--style` palette (classic, magma, inferno, viridis, gray)\n- `--width` / `--height` o","body":"# songsee\n\nGenerate spectrograms + feature panels from audio.\n\nQuick start\n\n- Spectrogram: `songsee track.mp3`\n- Multi-panel: `songsee track.mp3 --viz spectrogram,mel,chroma,hpss,selfsim,loudness,tempogram,mfcc,flux`\n- Time slice: `songsee track.mp3 --start 12.5 --duration 8 -o slice.jpg`\n- Stdin: `cat track.mp3 | songsee - --format png -o out.png`\n\nCommon flags\n\n- `--viz` list (repeatable or comma-separated)\n- `--style` palette (classic, magma, inferno, viridis, gray)\n- `--width` / `--height` output size\n- `--window` / `--hop` FFT settings\n- `--min-freq` / `--max-freq` frequency range\n- `--start` / `--duration` time slice\n- `--format` jpg|png\n\nNotes\n\n- WAV/MP3 decode native; other formats use ffmpeg if available.\n- Multiple `--viz` renders a grid.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:25:43.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Audio que necesitan generación avanzada de espectrogramas y capacidades de visualización de paneles de características.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse audio ayant besoin de génération avancée de spectrogrammes et de capacités de visualisation de panneaux de fonctionnalités.","de":"Perfekt für Audioanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Spektrogrammgenerierung und Funktionenpanel-Visualisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Audio Analysis Agents needing advanced spectrogram generation and feature panel visualization capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","zh":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","ja":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","ko":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar spectrogramas y paneles de características a partir de archivos de audio utilizando varias opciones de visualización, incluyendo mel, chroma y mfcc, y admite múltiples formatos de salida como png y jpg, lo que permite un análisis y visualización avanzados de datos de audio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des spectrogrammes et des panneaux de fonctionnalités à partir de fichiers audio en utilisant diverses options de visualisation, notamment mel, chroma et mfcc, et prend en charge plusieurs formats de sortie tels que png et jpg, permettant ainsi une analyse et une visualisation avancées des données audio.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Spektrogramme und Funktionspanele aus Audio-Dateien unter Verwendung verschiedener Visualisierungsoptionen wie mel, chroma und mfcc zu generieren und unterstützt mehrere Ausgabeformate wie png und jpg, was eine erweiterte Audio-Datenanalyse und -Visualisierung ermöglicht.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate spectrograms and feature panels from audio files using various visualization options, including mel, chroma, and mfcc, and supports multiple output formats such as png and jpg, enabling advanced audio data analysis and visualization."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"zh":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"ja":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"ko":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"es":["Generar spectrogramas para pistas de música","Visualizar características de audio para el entrenamiento de modelos de aprendizaje automático","Crear visualizaciones de audio en rodajas de tiempo para fines de depuración"],"fr":["Générer des spectrogrammes pour des pistes de musique","Visualiser les fonctionnalités audio pour l''entraînement de modèles d''apprentissage automatique","Créer des visualisations audio découpées dans le temps pour des fins de débogage"],"de":["Spektrogramme für Musiktitel generieren","Audio-Funktionen für die Ausbildung von Machine-Learning-Modellen visualisieren","Zeitgeschnittene Audio-Visualisierungen für Debugging-Zwecke erstellen"],"pt":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"ru":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"],"ar":["Generating spectrograms for music tracks","Visualizing audio features for machine learning model training","Creating time-sliced audio visualizations for debugging purposes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"zh":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"ja":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"ko":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"es":["Requiere entrada de archivo de audio o transmisión stdin","Limitado a opciones de visualización y formatos de salida específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de fichier audio ou un flux stdin","Limité à des options de visualisation et des formats de sortie spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Audio-Dateieingabe oder stdin-Streaming","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Visualisierungsoptionen und Ausgabeformate"],"pt":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"ru":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"],"ar":["Requires audio file input or stdin streaming","Limited to specific visualization options and output formats"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('amano--/call-center/cargo-fuzz', 'community', 'amano--', 'call-center', 'amano--/call-center', 'cargo-fuzz', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.546Z', '2026-02-19T07:27:36.142Z', NULL, '{"id":"amano--/call-center/cargo-fuzz","name":"cargo-fuzz","description":{"en":""},"seo":{"title":{"en":"cargo-fuzz"},"description":{"en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"en":[]},"keywords":{"en":[]}},"owner":"amano--","repo":"call-center","repoPath":"amano--/call-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.546Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cargo-fuzz","description":">","bodyPreview":"# cargo-fuzz\n\ncargo-fuzz is the de facto choice for fuzzing Rust projects when using Cargo. It uses libFuzzer as the backend and provides a convenient Cargo subcommand that automatically enables relevant compilation flags for your Rust project, including support for sanitizers like AddressSanitizer.\n\n## When to Use\n\ncargo-fuzz is currently the primary and most mature fuzzing solution for Rust projects using Cargo.\n\n| Fuzzer | Best For | Complexity |\n|--------|----------|------------|\n| cargo-fuz","body":"# cargo-fuzz\n\ncargo-fuzz is the de facto choice for fuzzing Rust projects when using Cargo. It uses libFuzzer as the backend and provides a convenient Cargo subcommand that automatically enables relevant compilation flags for your Rust project, including support for sanitizers like AddressSanitizer.\n\n## When to Use\n\ncargo-fuzz is currently the primary and most mature fuzzing solution for Rust projects using Cargo.\n\n| Fuzzer | Best For | Complexity |\n|--------|----------|------------|\n| cargo-fuzz | Cargo-based Rust projects, quick setup | Low |\n| AFL++ | Multi-core fuzzing, non-Cargo projects | Medium |\n| LibAFL | Custom fuzzers, research, advanced use cases | High |\n\n**Choose cargo-fuzz when:**\n- Your project uses Cargo (required)\n- You want simple, quick setup with minimal configuration\n- You need integrated sanitizer support\n- You''re fuzzing Rust code with or without unsafe blocks\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```rust\n#![no_main]\n\nuse libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;\n\nfn harness(data: &[u8]) {\n    your_project::check_buf(data);\n}\n\nfuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {\n    harness(data);\n});\n```\n\nInitialize and run:\n```bash\ncargo fuzz init\n# Edit fuzz/fuzz_targets/fuzz_target_1.rs with your harness\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1\n```\n\n## Installation\n\ncargo-fuzz requires the nightly Rust toolchain because it uses features only available in nightly.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Rust and Cargo installed via [rustup](https://rustup.rs/)\n- Nightly toolchain\n\n### Linux/macOS\n\n```bash\n# Install nightly toolchain\nrustup install nightly\n\n# Install cargo-fuzz\ncargo install cargo-fuzz\n```\n\n### Verification\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly --version\ncargo fuzz --version\n```\n\n## Writing a Harness\n\n### Project Structure\n\ncargo-fuzz works best when your code is structured as a library crate. If you have a binary project, split your `main.rs` into:\n\n```text\nsrc/main.rs  # Entry point (main function)\nsrc/lib.rs   # Code to fuzz (public functions)\nCargo.toml\n```\n\nInitialize fuzzing:\n```bash\ncargo fuzz init\n```\n\nThis creates:\n```text\nfuzz/\n├── Cargo.toml\n└── fuzz_targets/\n    └── fuzz_target_1.rs\n```\n\n### Harness Structure\n\n```rust\n#![no_main]\n\nuse libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;\n\nfn harness(data: &[u8]) {\n    // 1. Validate input size if needed\n    if data.is_empty() {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    // 2. Call target function with fuzz data\n    your_project::target_function(data);\n}\n\nfuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {\n    harness(data);\n});\n```\n\n### Harness Rules\n\n| Do | Don''t |\n|----|-------|\n| Structure code as library crate | Keep everything in main.rs |\n| Use `fuzz_target!` macro | Write custom main function |\n| Handle `Result::Err` gracefully | Panic on expected errors |\n| Keep harness deterministic | Use random number generators |\n\n> **See Also:** For detailed harness writing techniques and structure-aware fuzzing with the\n> `arbitrary` crate, see the **fuzz-harness-writing** technique skill.\n\n## Structure-Aware Fuzzing\n\ncargo-fuzz integrates with the [arbitrary](https://github.com/rust-fuzz/arbitrary) crate for structure-aware fuzzing:\n\n```rust\n// In your library crate\nuse arbitrary::Arbitrary;\n\n#[derive(Debug, Arbitrary)]\npub struct Name {\n    data: String\n}\n```\n\n```rust\n// In your fuzz target\n#![no_main]\nuse libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;\n\nfuzz_target!(|data: your_project::Name| {\n    data.check_buf();\n});\n```\n\nAdd to your library''s `Cargo.toml`:\n```toml\n[dependencies]\narbitrary = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\n```\n\n## Running Campaigns\n\n### Basic Run\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1\n```\n\n### Without Sanitizers (Safe Rust)\n\nIf your project doesn''t use unsafe Rust, disable sanitizers for 2x performance boost:\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run --sanitizer none fuzz_target_1\n```\n\nCheck if your project uses unsafe code:\n```bash\ncargo install cargo-geiger\ncargo geiger\n```\n\n### Re-executing Test Cases\n\n```bash\n# Run a specific test case (e.g., a crash)\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 fuzz/artifacts/fuzz_target_1/crash-<hash>\n\n# Run all corpus entries without fuzzing\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 fuzz/corpus/fuzz_target_1 -- -runs=0\n```\n\n### Using Dictionaries\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 -- -dict=./dict.dict\n```\n\n### Interpreting Output\n\n| Output | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `NEW` | New coverage-increasing input discovered |\n| `pulse` | Periodic status update |\n| `INITED` | Fuzzer initialized successfully |\n| Crash with stack trace | Bug found, saved to `fuzz/artifacts/` |\n\nCorpus location: `fuzz/corpus/fuzz_target_1/`\nCrashes location: `fuzz/artifacts/fuzz_target_1/`\n\n## Sanitizer Integration\n\n### AddressSanitizer (ASan)\n\nASan is enabled by default and detects memory errors:\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1\n```\n\n### Disabling Sanitizers\n\nFor pure safe Rust (no unsafe blocks in your code or dependencies):\n\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run --sanitizer none fuzz_target_1\n```\n\n**Performance impact:** ASan adds ~2x overhead. Disable for safe Rust to improve fuzzing speed.\n\n### Checking for Unsafe Code\n\n```bash\ncargo install cargo-geiger\ncargo geiger\n```\n\n> **See Also:** For detailed sanitizer configuration, flags, and troubleshooting,\n> see the **address-sanitizer** technique skill.\n\n## Coverage Analysis\n\ncargo-fuzz integrates with Rust''s coverage tools to analyze fuzzing effectiveness.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nrustup toolchain install nightly --component llvm-tools-preview\ncargo install cargo-binutils\ncargo install rustfilt\n```\n\n### Generating Coverage Reports\n\n```bash\n# Generate coverage data from corpus\ncargo +nightly fuzz coverage fuzz_target_1\n```\n\nCreate coverage generation script:\n\n```bash\ncat <<''EOF'' > ./generate_html\n#!/bin/sh\nif [ $# -lt 1 ]; then\n    echo \"Error: Name of fuzz target is required.\"\n    echo \"Usage: $0 fuzz_target [sources...]\"\n    exit 1\nfi\nFUZZ_TARGET=\"$1\"\nshift\nSRC_FILTER=\"$@\"\nTARGET=$(rustc -vV | sed -n ''s|host: ||p'')\ncargo +nightly cov -- show -Xdemangler=rustfilt \\\n  \"target/$TARGET/coverage/$TARGET/release/$FUZZ_TARGET\" \\\n  -instr-profile=\"fuzz/coverage/$FUZZ_TARGET/coverage.profdata\"  \\\n  -show-line-counts-or-regions -show-instantiations  \\\n  -format=html -o fuzz_html/ $SRC_FILTER\nEOF\nchmod +x ./generate_html\n```\n\nGenerate HTML report:\n```bash\n./generate_html fuzz_target_1 src/lib.rs\n```\n\nHTML report saved to: `fuzz_html/`\n\n> **See Also:** For detailed coverage analysis techniques and systematic coverage improvement,\n> see the **coverage-analysis** technique skill.\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Tips and Tricks\n\n| Tip | Why It Helps |\n|-----|--------------|\n| Start with a seed corpus | Dramatically speeds up initial coverage discovery |\n| Use `--sanitizer none` for safe Rust | 2x performance improvement |\n| Check coverage regularly | Identifies gaps in harness or seed corpus |\n| Use dictionaries for parsers | Helps overcome magic value checks |\n| Structure code as library | Required for cargo-fuzz integration |\n\n### libFuzzer Options\n\nPass options to libFuzzer after `--`:\n\n```bash\n# See all options\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 -- -help=1\n\n# Set timeout per run\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 -- -timeout=10\n\n# Use dictionary\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 -- -dict=dict.dict\n\n# Limit maximum input size\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1 -- -max_len=1024\n```\n\n### Multi-Core Fuzzing\n\n```bash\n# Experimental forking support (not recommended)\ncargo +nightly fuzz run --jobs 1 fuzz_target_1\n```\n\nNote: The multi-core fuzzing feature is experimental and not recommended. For parallel fuzzing, consider running multiple instances manually or using AFL++.\n\n## Real-World Examples\n\n### Example: ogg Crate\n\nThe [ogg crate](https://github.com/RustAudio/ogg) parses Ogg media container files. Parsers are excellent fuzzing targets because they handle untrusted data.\n\n```bash\n# Clone and initialize\ngit clone https://github.com/RustAudio/ogg.git\ncd ogg/\ncargo fuzz init\n```\n\nHarness at `fuzz/fuzz_targets/fuzz_target_1.rs`:\n\n```rust\n#![no_main]\n\nuse ogg::{PacketReader, PacketWriter};\nuse ogg::writing::PacketWriteEndInfo;\nuse std::io::Cursor;\nuse libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;\n\nfn harness(data: &[u8]) {\n    let mut pck_rdr = PacketReader::new(Cursor::new(data.to_vec()));\n    pck_rdr.delete_unread_packets();\n\n    let output = Vec::new();\n    let mut pck_wtr = PacketWriter::new(Cursor::new(output));\n\n    if let Ok(_) = pck_rdr.read_packet() {\n        if let Ok(r) = pck_rdr.read_packet() {\n            match r {\n                Some(pck) => {\n                    let inf = if pck.last_in_stream() {\n                        PacketWriteEndInfo::EndStream\n                    } else if pck.last_in_page() {\n                        PacketWriteEndInfo::EndPage\n                    } else {\n                        PacketWriteEndInfo::NormalPacket\n                    };\n                    let stream_serial = pck.stream_serial();\n                    let absgp_page = pck.absgp_page();\n                    let _ = pck_wtr.write_packet(\n                        pck.data, stream_serial, inf, absgp_page\n                    );\n                }\n                None => return,\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {\n    harness(data);\n});\n```\n\nSeed the corpus:\n```bash\nmkdir fuzz/corpus/fuzz_target_1/\ncurl -o fuzz/corpus/fuzz_target_1/320x240.ogg \\\n  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:320x240.ogg\n```\n\nRun:\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz run fuzz_target_1\n```\n\nAnalyze coverage:\n```bash\ncargo +nightly fuzz coverage fuzz_target_1\n./generate_html fuzz_target_1 src/lib.rs\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Problem | Cause | Solution |\n|---------|-------|----------|\n| \"requires nightly\" error | Using stable toolchain | Use `cargo +nightly fuzz` |\n| Slow fuzzing performance | ASan enabled for safe Rust | Add `--sanitizer none` flag |\n| \"cannot find binary\" | No library crate | Move code from `main.rs` to `lib.rs` |\n| Sanitizer compilation issues | Wrong nightly version | Try different nightly: `rustup install nightly-2024-01-01` |\n| Low coverage | Missing seed corpus | Add sample inputs to `fuzz/corpus/fuzz_target_1/` |\n| Magic value not found | No dictionary | Create dictionary file with magic values |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n### Technique Skills\n\n| Skill | Use Case |\n|-------|----------|\n| **fuzz-harness-writing** | Structure-aware fuzzing with `arbitrary` crate |\n| **address-sanitizer** | Understanding ASan output and configuration |\n| **coverage-analysis** | Measuring and improving fuzzing effectiveness |\n| **fuzzing-corpus** | Building and managing seed corpora |\n| **fuzzing-dictionaries** | Creating dictionaries for format-aware fuzzing |\n\n### Related Fuzzers\n\n| Skill | When to Consider |\n|-------|------------------|\n| **libfuzzer** | Fuzzing C/C++ code with similar workflow |\n| **aflpp** | Multi-core fuzzing or non-Cargo Rust projects |\n| **libafl** | Advanced fuzzing research or custom fuzzer development |\n\n## Resources\n\n**[Rust Fuzz Book - cargo-fuzz](https://rust-fuzz.github.io/book/cargo-fuzz.html)**\nOfficial documentation for cargo-fuzz covering installation, usage, and advanced features.\n\n**[arbitrary crate documentation](https://docs.rs/arbitrary/latest/arbitrary/)**\nGuide to structure-aware fuzzing with automatic derivation for Rust types.\n\n**[cargo-fuzz GitHub Repository](https://github.com/rust-fuzz/cargo-fuzz)**\nSource code, issue tracker, and examples for cargo-fuzz.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:27:36.142Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-based AI Agents requiring robust fuzz testing and sanitization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要强大的模糊测试和清理能力的基于Rust的AI代理。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが強力なファジーテストとサニタイジング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"강력한 퍼지 테스트 및 샌티타이징 기능이 필요한 러스트 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Rust que requieren capacidades de prueba de fuzzing robustas y de saneamiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Rust nécessitant des capacités de test de fuzzing robustes et de sanitizeurs.","de":"Ideal für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die robuste Fuzz-Test- und Sanierungs-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que exigem testes de fuzz robustos e capacidades de sanitização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на Rust, требующих прочных возможностей fuzz-тестирования и санитарной обработки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى روست الذي يتطلب اختبارات fuzz قوية وخصائص تصفية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage libFuzzer and AddressSanitizer for comprehensive Rust project testing, ensuring the detection of subtle bugs and security vulnerabilities through automated fuzzing with Cargo subcommands.","zh":"赋予代理使用libFuzzer和AddressSanitizer进行全面Rust项目测试的能力，确保通过Cargo子命令的自动化模糊测试检测到微妙的错误和安全漏洞。","ja":"libFuzzerとAddressSanitizerを使用して包括的なRustプロジェクトのテストを実行するエージェントの能力を提供し、Cargoサブコマンドによる自動ファジーテストで微妙なバグやセキュリティ脆弱性を検出します。","ko":"libFuzzer 및 AddressSanitizer를 사용하여 포괄적인 러스트 프로젝트 테스트를 수행하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하고, Cargo 서브 명령어를 통해 자동화된 퍼지 테스트에서 미묘한 버그 및 보안 취약성을 검출합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar libFuzzer y AddressSanitizer para pruebas de proyectos de Rust integrales, garantizando la detección de errores y vulnerabilidades de seguridad sutiles a través de fuzzing automatizado con subcomandos de Cargo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter libFuzzer et AddressSanitizer pour des tests de projets Rust complets, garantissant la détection de bogues et de vulnérabilités de sécurité subtiles grâce à un fuzzing automatisé avec des sous-commandes Cargo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, libFuzzer und AddressSanitizer für umfassende Tests von Rust-Projekten zu nutzen, um die Erkennung von subtilen Fehlern und Sicherheitslücken durch automatisiertes Fuzzing mit Cargo-Unterbefehlen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem o libFuzzer e o AddressSanitizer para testes abrangentes de projetos Rust, garantindo a detecção de bugs sutis e vulnerabilidades de segurança por meio de fuzz automático com subcomandos do Cargo.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать libFuzzer и AddressSanitizer для комплексного тестирования проектов Rust, обеспечивая обнаружение тонких ошибок и уязвимостей безопасности посредством автоматического fuzz-тестирования с подкомандами Cargo.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من الاستفادة من libFuzzer و AddressSanitizer لاختبارات شاملة لمشاريع روست، وتضمن اكتشاف أخطاء خفية وثغرات أمنية من خلال fuzz آلي مع أوامر فرعية لشحن"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating fuzz testing for Rust projects with Cargo","Debugging memory-related issues using AddressSanitizer","Enhancing project security through continuous fuzzing"],"zh":["使用Cargo自动化Rust项目的模糊测试","使用AddressSanitizer调试内存相关问题","通过持续模糊测试增强项目安全性"],"ja":["Cargoを使用してRustプロジェクトのファジーテストを自動化する","AddressSanitizerを使用してメモリ関連の問題をデバッグする","継続的なファジーテストを通じてプロジェクトのセキュリティを強化する"],"ko":["Cargo를 사용하여 러스트 프로젝트의 퍼지 테스트를 자동화하는 것","AddressSanitizer를 사용하여 메모리 관련 문제를 디버깅하는 것","계속적인 퍼지 테스트를 통해 프로젝트 보안을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de fuzzing para proyectos de Rust con Cargo","Depurar problemas relacionados con la memoria utilizando AddressSanitizer","Mejorar la seguridad del proyecto a través de fuzzing continuo"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de fuzzing pour les projets Rust avec Cargo","Déboguer les problèmes liés à la mémoire à l''aide d''AddressSanitizer","Améliorer la sécurité du projet grâce à un fuzzing continu"],"de":["Automatisieren von Fuzz-Tests für Rust-Projekte mit Cargo","Debuggen von Speicher-bezogenen Problemen mit AddressSanitizer","Verbessern der Projektsicherheit durch kontinuierliches Fuzzing"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de fuzz para projetos Rust com o Cargo","Depurar problemas relacionados à memória usando o AddressSanitizer","Aumentar a segurança do projeto por meio de fuzz contínuo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать fuzz-тестирование для проектов Rust с помощью Cargo","Отлаживать проблемы, связанные с памятью, с помощью AddressSanitizer","Повысить безопасность проекта за счет непрерывного fuzz-тестирования"],"ar":["تأتمة اختبارات fuzz لمشاريع روست مع شحن","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالذاكرة باستخدام AddressSanitizer","تعزيز أمان المشروع من خلال fuzz مستمر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and Cargo setup","Limited to Rust projects","Dependent on libFuzzer and AddressSanitizer compatibility"],"zh":["需要Rust和Cargo设置","仅限于Rust项目","依赖于libFuzzer和AddressSanitizer的兼容性"],"ja":["RustとCargoの設定が必要","Rustプロジェクトのみに限定される","libFuzzerとAddressSanitizerの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["러스트 및 카고 설정이 필요함","러스트 프로젝트에만 적용됨","libFuzzer 및 AddressSanitizer의 호환성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Rust y Cargo","Limitado a proyectos de Rust","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de libFuzzer y AddressSanitizer"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Rust et de Cargo","Limité aux projets Rust","Dépend de la compatibilité de libFuzzer et d''AddressSanitizer"],"de":["Benötigt Rust- und Cargo-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Rust-Projekte","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von libFuzzer und AddressSanitizer"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Rust e do Cargo","Limitado a projetos Rust","Dependente da compatibilidade do libFuzzer e do AddressSanitizer"],"ru":["Требует настройки Rust и Cargo","Ограничен проектами Rust","Зависит от совместимости libFuzzer и AddressSanitizer"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد روست وشحن","محدد بمشاريع روست","يعتمد على توافق libFuzzer و AddressSanitizer"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
