k 인증 통합에 대한 40개 이상의 규칙을 포함","es":"Guía de mejores prácticas de Supabase para aplicaciones seguras y optimizadas. Incluye 40+ reglas para desarrollo y revisión de código","fr":"Guide des bonnes pratiques Supabase pour des applications sécurisées et optimisées. Comprend 40+ règles pour le développement et la revue de code","de":"Leitfaden für Supabase-Best-Practices für sichere und optimierte Anwendungen. Enthält 40+ Regeln für Entwicklung und Code-Review","pt":"Guia de melhores práticas para aplicações Supabase com autenticação Clerk, incluindo 40+ regras para segurança e desempenho","ru":"Руководство по лучшим практикам для приложений Supabase с аутентификацией Clerk, включающее 40+ правил для безопасности и производительности","ar":"دليل لأفضل الممارسات لتطبيقات Supabase مع تسجيل الدخول Clerk، بما في ذلك 40+ قاعدة للأمان والأداء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["40+安全和性能优化规则","Clerk认证集成支持","Row Level Security（RLS）策略","数据库schema设计","实时功能实现"],"ja":["40以上のセキュリティとパフォーマンス最適化ルール","Clerk認証統合対応","Row Level Security（RLS）ポリシー","データベーススキーマ設計","リアルタイム機能実装"],"ko":["40개 이상의 보안과 성능 최적화 규칙","Clerk 인증 통합 지원","Row Level Security（RLS）정책","데이터베이스 스키마 설계","실시간 기능 구현"],"es":["Guía de seguridad y rendimiento","40+ reglas para desarrollo seguro","Integración con Clerk","Políticas de seguridad de nivel de fila (RLS)","Diseño de esquemas de base de datos","Implementación de características en tiempo real"],"fr":["Guide de sécurité et de performances","40+ règles pour un développement sécurisé","Intégration avec Clerk","Politiques de sécurité au niveau des lignes (RLS)","Conception de schémas de base de données","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités en temps réel"],"de":["Sicherheits- und Leitfaden","40+ Regeln für sichere Entwicklung","Integration mit Clerk","Richtlinien für Zeilenberechtigungen (RLS)","Datenbank-Schemadesign","Implementierung von Echtzeitfunktionen"],"pt":["40+ regras de segurança e desempenho","Integração com autenticação Clerk","Políticas de segurança de nível de linha (RLS)","Design de esquemas de banco de dados","Implementação de recursos em tempo real"],"ru":["40+ правил безопасности и производительности","Интеграция с аутентификацией Clerk","Политики безопасности уровня строки (RLS)","Проектирование схем базы данных","Реализация функций в реальном времени"],"ar":["40+ قاعدة للأمان والأداء","التكامل مع تسجيل الدخول Clerk","سياسات أمان مستوى السطر (RLS)","تصميم مخططات قاعدة البيانات","تنفيذ الميزات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Supabase最佳实践","Supabase安全","Supabase性能优化","Clerk认证","Row Level Security","数据库设计"],"ja":["Supabaseベストプラクティス","Supabaseセキュリティ","Supabaseパフォーマンス最適化","Clerk認証","Row Level Security","データベース設計"],"ko":["Supabase 최적화","Supabase 보안","Supabase 성능 최적화","Clerk 인증","Row Level Security","데이터베이스 설계"],"es":["Supabase","mejores prácticas","seguridad","rendimiento","Clerk","desarrollo seguro","políticas de seguridad","diseño de base de datos"],"fr":["Supabase","bonnes pratiques","sécurité","performances","Clerk","développement sécurisé","politiques de sécurité","conception de base de données"],"de":["Supabase","Best-Practices","Sicherheit","Leistung","Clerk","sichere Entwicklung","Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Datenbank-Design"],"pt":["Supabase","melhores práticas","segurança","desempenho","autenticação Clerk","RLS","banco de dados"],"ru":["Supabase","лучшие практики","безопасность","производительность","аутентификация Clerk","RLS","база данных"],"ar":["Supabase","أفضل الممارسات","أمان","أداء","تسجيل الدخول Clerk","RLS","قاعدة البيانات"]}},"owner":"nicanac","repo":"familly-journal","repoPath":"nicanac/familly-journal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.546Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-best-practices","description":"Supabase security and performance guidelines with Clerk authentication integration. Contains 40+ rules across 10 categories covering RLS policies, Clerk setup, database security, and more.","version":"1.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security and performance optimization guide for Supabase applications with Clerk authentication integration. Contains 40+ rules across 10 categories, prioritized by impact to guide secure development and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Supabase project\n- Integrating Clerk authentication with Supabase\n- Writing Row Level Security (RLS) policies\n- Designing database schemas\n- Implementing real-time feature","body":"# Supabase Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security and performance optimization guide for Supabase applications with Clerk authentication integration. Contains 40+ rules across 10 categories, prioritized by impact to guide secure development and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Supabase project\n- Integrating Clerk authentication with Supabase\n- Writing Row Level Security (RLS) policies\n- Designing database schemas\n- Implementing real-time features\n- Configuring Storage buckets\n- Writing Edge Functions\n- Reviewing code for security issues\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Row Level Security | CRITICAL | `rls-` |\n| 2 | Clerk Integration | CRITICAL | `clerk-` |\n| 3 | Database Security | HIGH | `db-` |\n| 4 | Authentication Patterns | HIGH | `auth-` |\n| 5 | API Security | HIGH | `api-` |\n| 6 | Storage Security | MEDIUM-HIGH | `storage-` |\n| 7 | Realtime Security | MEDIUM | `realtime-` |\n| 8 | Edge Functions | MEDIUM | `edge-` |\n| 9 | Testing | MEDIUM | `test-` |\n| 10 | Security | MEDIUM | `security-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Row Level Security (CRITICAL)\n\n- `rls-always-enable` - Always enable RLS on public schema tables\n- `rls-wrap-functions-select` - Wrap auth functions with (SELECT ...) for performance\n- `rls-add-indexes` - Add indexes on columns used in RLS policies\n- `rls-specify-roles` - Specify roles with TO authenticated clause\n- `rls-security-definer` - Use SECURITY DEFINER functions for complex policies\n- `rls-minimize-joins` - Minimize joins in RLS policies\n- `rls-explicit-auth-check` - Use explicit auth.uid() checks\n- `rls-restrictive-policies` - Use RESTRICTIVE policies for additional constraints\n\n### 2. Clerk Integration (CRITICAL)\n\n- `clerk-setup-third-party` - Use Third-Party Auth integration (not JWT templates)\n- `clerk-client-server-side` - Use accessToken callback for server-side clients\n- `clerk-client-client-side` - Use useSession() hook for client-side clients\n- `clerk-role-claim` - Configure role: authenticated claim in Clerk\n- `clerk-org-policies` - Use organization claims for multi-tenant RLS\n- `clerk-mfa-policies` - Enforce MFA with RESTRICTIVE policies\n- `clerk-no-jwt-templates` - Never use deprecated JWT template integration\n\n### 3. Database Security (HIGH)\n\n- `db-migrations-versioned` - Use versioned migrations for schema changes\n- `db-schema-design` - Follow proper schema design patterns\n- `db-indexes-strategy` - Implement proper indexing strategy\n- `db-foreign-keys` - Always use foreign key constraints\n- `db-triggers-security` - Secure trigger functions properly\n- `db-views-security-invoker` - Use SECURITY INVOKER for views\n\n### 4. Authentication Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `auth-jwt-claims-validation` - Always validate JWT claims\n- `auth-user-metadata-safety` - Treat user_metadata as untrusted\n- `auth-app-metadata-authorization` - Use app_metadata for authorization\n- `auth-session-management` - Implement proper session management\n\n### 5. API Security (HIGH)\n\n- `api-filter-queries` - Always filter queries even with RLS\n- `api-publishable-keys` - Use publishable keys correctly\n- `api-service-role-server-only` - Never expose service role key to client\n\n### 6. Storage Security (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `storage-rls-policies` - Enable RLS on storage.objects\n- `storage-bucket-security` - Configure bucket-level security\n- `storage-signed-urls` - Use signed URLs for private files\n\n### 7. Realtime Security (MEDIUM)\n\n- `realtime-private-channels` - Use private channels for sensitive data\n- `realtime-rls-authorization` - RLS policies apply to realtime\n- `realtime-cleanup-subscriptions` - Clean up subscriptions on unmount\n\n### 8. Edge Functions (MEDIUM)\n\n- `edge-verify-jwt` - Always verify JWT in edge functions\n- `edge-cors-handling` - Handle CORS properly\n- `edge-secrets-management` - Use secrets for sensitive data\n\n### 9. Testing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `test-pgtap-rls` - Test RLS policies with pgTAP\n- `test-isolation` - Isolate tests properly\n- `test-helpers` - Use test helper functions\n\n### 10. Security (MEDIUM)\n\n- `security-validate-inputs` - Validate all inputs before processing\n- `security-audit-advisors` - Regularly run Security Advisor checks\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nreferences/rules/rls-always-enable.md\nreferences/rules/clerk-setup-third-party.md\nreferences/rules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- When NOT to use the pattern\n- Reference links to official documentation\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `references/supabase-guidelines.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:27:49.096Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced Supabase security and performance optimization capabilities with Clerk authentication integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Supabase 安全性和性能优化能力以及 Clerk 身份验证集成的全栈代理。","ja":"Supabase の高度なセキュリティとパフォーマンス最適化機能、および Clerk 認証の統合が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Supabase 보안 및 성능 최적화 기능과 Clerk 인증 통합이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de seguridad y optimización de rendimiento de Supabase con integración de autenticación de Clerk.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin de capacités de sécurité et d''optimisation de performances avancées de Supabase avec une intégration d''authentification Clerk.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Supabase-Sicherheits- und Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen mit Clerk-Authentifizierung integrieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de capacidades avançadas de segurança e otimização de desempenho do Supabase com integração de autenticação do Clerk.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым требуются расширенные возможности безопасности и оптимизации производительности Supabase с интеграцией аутентификации Clerk.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لأمان Supabase وضبط الأداء مع دمج مصادقة Clerk."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust Row Level Security policies, design optimized database schemas, and integrate Clerk authentication with Supabase, ensuring secure development and code review across 10 categories and 40+ rules.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大的行级安全策略的能力，设计优化的数据库模式，并将 Clerk 身份验证与 Supabase 集成，确保在 10 个类别和 40+ 规则中进行安全开发和代码审查。","ja":"エージェントが強力な行レベル セキュリティ ポリシーを実装し、最適化されたデータベース スキーマを設計し、Clerk 認証を Supabase と統合して、10 のカテゴリと 40 を超えるルールで安全な開発とコード レビューを保証できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 행 수준 보안 정책을 구현하고 최적화된 데이터베이스 스키마를 설계하며 Clerk 인증을 Supabase와 통합하여 10개 이상의 카테고리와 40개 이상의 규칙에서 보안 개발 및 코드 검토를 보장할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar políticas de seguridad de nivel de fila robustas, diseñar esquemas de base de datos optimizados e integrar la autenticación de Clerk con Supabase, garantizando un desarrollo y una revisión de código seguros en 10 categorías y más de 40 reglas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des politiques de sécurité de niveau de ligne robustes, de concevoir des schémas de base de données optimisés et d''intégrer l''authentification Clerk avec Supabase, garantissant un développement et une révision de code sécurisés dans 10 catégories et plus de 40 règles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste Zeilenberechtigungspolitiken umzusetzen, optimierte Datenbankschemata zu entwerfen und Clerk-Authentifizierung mit Supabase zu integrieren, um sichere Entwicklung und Code-Review in 10 Kategorien und mehr als 40 Regeln sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar políticas de Segurança em Nível de Linha robustas, projetar esquemas de banco de dados otimizados e integrar a autenticação do Clerk com o Supabase, garantindo desenvolvimento e revisão de código seguros em 10 categorias e 40+ regras.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать прочные политики безопасности на уровне строк, проектировать оптимизированные схемы баз данных и интегрировать аутентификацию Clerk с Supabase, обеспечивая безопасную разработку и обзор кода по 10 категориям и 40+ правилам.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ سياسات أمان مستوى الصف الحصينة وتصميم مخططات قواعد البيانات المُختزلة وتكامل مصادقة Clerk مع Supabase، مما يضمن تطويرًا ومراجعة شفرة آمنة عبر 10 فئات وقواعد 40+."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing real-time features with secure data access","Designing and optimizing database schemas for Supabase applications","Writing and validating Row Level Security policies for Clerk authentication"],"zh":["实现具有安全数据访问的实时功能","为 Supabase 应用程序设计和优化数据库模式","为 Clerk 身份验证编写和验证行级安全策略"],"ja":["セキュアなデータ アクセスを備えたリアルタイム機能の実装","Supabase アプリケーションの最適化されたデータベース スキーマの設計","Clerk 認証の行レベル セキュリティ ポリシーの作成と検証"],"ko":["보안 데이터 액세스와 함께 실시간 기능 구현","Supabase 애플리케이션을 위한 최적화된 데이터베이스 스키마 설계","Clerk 인증을 위한 행 수준 보안 정책 작성 및 검증"],"es":["Implementación de funciones en tiempo real con acceso a datos seguro","Diseño y optimización de esquemas de base de datos para aplicaciones de Supabase","Escritura y validación de políticas de seguridad de nivel de fila para la autenticación de Clerk"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités en temps réel avec un accès sécurisé aux données","Conception et optimisation de schémas de base de données pour les applications Supabase","Rédaction et validation de politiques de sécurité de niveau de ligne pour l''authentification Clerk"],"de":["Implementierung von Echtzeitfunktionen mit sicherem Datenzugriff","Entwurf und Optimierung von Datenbankschemata für Supabase-Anwendungen","Erstellung und Validierung von Zeilenberechtigungspolitiken für die Clerk-Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Implementação de recursos em tempo real com acesso seguro a dados","Projeto e otimização de esquemas de banco de dados para aplicações Supabase","Escrita e validação de políticas de Segurança em Nível de Linha para autenticação do Clerk"],"ru":["Реализация функций в реальном времени с безопасным доступом к данным","Проектирование и оптимизация схем баз данных для приложений Supabase","Написание и проверка политик безопасности на уровне строк для аутентификации Clerk"],"ar":["تنفيذ الميزات في الوقت الفعلي مع وصول آمن إلى البيانات","تصميم مخططات قواعد البيانات المُختزلة للتطبيقات Supabase","كتابة واعتماد سياسات أمان مستوى الصف لمصادقة Clerk"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Supabase project setup","Clerk authentication integration needed","Specific to Supabase applications"],"zh":["需要 Supabase 项目设置","需要 Clerk 身份验证集成","特定于 Supabase 应用程序"],"ja":["Supabase プロジェクトの設定が必要","Clerk 認証の統合が必要","Supabase アプリケーションに特有"],"ko":["Supabase 프로젝트 설정 필요","Clerk 인증 통합 필요","Supabase 애플리케이션에 특정"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto de Supabase","Se necesita integración de autenticación de Clerk","Específico para aplicaciones de Supabase"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un projet Supabase","Nécessite une intégration d''authentification Clerk","Spécifique aux applications Supabase"],"de":["Benötigt Supabase-Projektsetup","Benötigt Clerk-Authentifizierung integrieren","Spezifisch für Supabase-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Supabase","Necessária integração de autenticação do Clerk","Específico para aplicações Supabase"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Supabase","Требуется интеграция ау